<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">GEN- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Unk'hongo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu kikwitangwa Unk'hongo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Unk'hongo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Unk'h</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu kikwitangwa Unk'hongo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Unk'h</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Ulongoelo we kitabu cho Unk'hongo, “Unk'hongo” ni ulosi ukutambalisa chotoko che vint'hu. Kitabu iki nicho che nk'hongo mwe vitabu ve Bibilia Ndagano ya Kale. Mwe chotoko, Kiibulania chakonga na mbuli ikugamba “Aho nk'hongo.” Ino yalagisa ivo kila kint'hu chakongaga hegu uko kilawile naho na ivo Mnungu akongaga kunda na want'hu. Wahina ywa mazua aya wana fanyanyi zibindile ingi mwe mbuli ya want'hu hegu mnt'hu awandikaga kitabu iki che chotoko, naho kugamba chawandikwagwa ini. Wamwenga wahuwila kugamba ni mawandiko yaduganywe kulawa mwe zink'humbukila kwe kaline ya shano na kaline ya mtandatu B.C uko Babeli, umwo Yesu andaga akei kwelekwa. Wamwenga nawo wahuila kugamba ni Musa awandikaga vitabu va Unk'hongo, ne kitabu cho Ukulawa, kitabu che Zimbuli za Walawi, Kitabu cho Uwazilo ne Tolati, mwe miaka ya alufu na magana matatu hegu alufu na magana mane B.C, Umwo Yesu andaga akei kwelekwa. Kitabu cho unk'hongo kina mbuli nyingi hezikuungwa kusweswa zikudaha kuwambiza Want'hu kukombaganya Bibilia yose mwe Zindagano zose zimbili, Ndagano ya Kale ne Ndagano Imp'ya. Iviaivia yalagisa ivo wavu wengilaga mwe isi naivo vawaungaga want'hu wapate myokozi. Naho yagubula mzungu wa Mnungu wa kuwayokola want'hu. Ino yadaha kuonwa mwo ulotezi wa nk'hongo mwe mbuli ya Yesu. Unk'hongo 3:15 na yadya Mnugu amwelisilaga Ibulahimu kuwavikila want'hu wa si zose. Unk'hongo 12:3 Ayo yemndani: 1. Mnungu aumbaga isi, amuumba Adamu na Hawa enga ivo kikuisoma mwo mnango wa nk'hongo na wa kaidi. 2. Mwo mnango wa katatu mpaka wa shano, numo kikuona zimbuli za Adamu na Hawa no wavu ywawe na welekwa ywawe. 3. Mwo mnango wa Tandatu mpaka mnago wa kenda umwo zalongwa zimbuli za Nuhu no ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi yose. 4. Naho kitabu cho Unk'hongo mwo mnango wa mlongo na wa mlongo na umwenga, chalonga icho kilaile mwo lupisi lwa Nuhu na lwa Ibulahimu hamwenga no mnala wa Babeli. 5. Mwe milango ya mlongo ma miidi mpaka mnago wa milongo mishano, ino yalongo mwe mbuli ya Abulahamu, imp'huga yakwe ne chotoko che want'hu wa Izilaeli. Wikazi wa abulahamu na mkaziwe Sala umwe milango ya mlongo na miidi na mpaka mnango wa milongo miidi na mishano. Wikazi wa Isaka na mkaziwe Labeka chauna mwo mnango wa milongo miidi na umwenga mpaka mnango wa milongo miidi na mnane, niyo kubanika kwakwe kwasimwiilwa mwo mnango wa milongo mitatu na mishano. Wikazi wa Yakobo na wanawe no kusama kwakwe kuita Misili wakalawa Kanaani, chaziona mwo mnango milongo miidi na mishano mpaka mnango wa milongo mishano. Mwo mnago wa milongo mitatu na mfungate mpaka kwo mnango wa milongo mishano kitabu kikaulisa wikazi wa mwana aungiswe ywa Yakobo uyo Yusufu na ivo ezaga kunda mkulu mwe isi ya Misili .</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu ivo aumbaga isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Aho nk'hongo Mnungu aumbaga mbingu na si. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Si hayandaga enga ivo ili haluse naho yandaga heiina kint'hu. Ziza kulu dyagubikaga mazi matali ayo yagubikaga kila hant'hu, naho Muye ywa Mnungu andaga akayeya mwa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Mnungu niyo agamba, “Kunde ung'azi” niyo kwanda unga'zi. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Mnungu auwonaga udya ung'azi kugamba ni wedi. Naho aho aupangaga ung'azi no lwiza, <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />niyo Mnungu awitanga ung'azi “Msi”. Ulwiza nalo alwitanga “Kilo”. Zuwa niyo dyaswa, niyo kwacha, idyo dyandaga zuwa dya nk'hongo.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Mnungu agambaga, “Kunde pwazi, diyapange amazi” niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Mnungu adamanyaga pwazi, niyo ayapanga mazi ye kwe mbingu na yadya ye hasi ye mbingu. Niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Mnungu aditangaga dipwazi idyo “Ulanga.” Niyo dyaswa, niyo kwacha, idyo dyandaga zuwa dya kaidi.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Mnungu niyo agamba, “Mazi ye hasi yo ulanga yakeduganye hamwenga, vileke hant'hu hanyaile halaile” niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Mnungu ahetangaga hadya hanyaile “Si.” Amazi nayo yekale hamwenga ayetangaga “Bahali.” Mnungu aonaga kugamba ni vedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Naho agambaga, “Si ihoteze mani, mani yakweleka mbeyu na maziti yakweleka matunda ye hengi yata mbeyu.” Niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ivo isi niyo yahoteza mani yakweleka mbeyu zi hengi na maziti yakweleka matunda yata mbeyu zihengi. Mnungu aonaga kugamba ni vedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Zuwa dyaswaga, niyo kwacha. Idyo dyandaga zuwa dya katatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Mnungu niyo agamba, “Kunde ming'azi mwo ulanga ikaupange msi ne kilo, naho ikalagise misimo na miaka na mazuwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Ilangaze mwo ulanga igele unga'zi mwe si.” Niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Ivo Mnungu adamanyaga ming'azi mikulu miidi. Udya mkulu, idyo dizuwa dilongoze nomsi, udya mdodo nawo, uwo mnenge ulongoze nekilo, naho niyo adamanya ne zint'hondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Mnungu aiikaga ming'azi iyo mwo ulanga vileke ilangaze mwe si <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />vilongoze kilo na msi no kupanga ung'azi no ulwiza. Niyo Mnungu aona kugamba ni vedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Zuwa dyaswaga niyo kwacha. Idyo dyandaga zuwa dya kane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Mnungu niyo agamba, “Viumbwa vina ugima vimeme mwa mazi, madege nayo yameme mwo ulanga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ivo Mnungu aumbaga makala yakulise ya mwe bahali, na vint'hu vose vina ugima va mwa mazi, na madege ye hengi. Mnungu aonaga kugamba ni vedi. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Mnungu avivikilaga akavigamba ivo viumbwa vikwikala mwa mazi veleke no kuimemeza ibahali no kuyagamba madege nayo yagenyele mwe si. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Zuwa dyaswaga niyo kwacha, idyo dyandaga zuwa dya shano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Naho Mnungu agambaga, “Si ilave viumbwa vino ugima vihengi, vikudimwa hawena viumbwa vikubulumka mwe sanga na va kwembago vihengi vikulu na vidodo” niyo vanda ivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ivo Mnungu aumbaga makala ya kwe mbago ye hengi na yakudimwa nayo ye hengi, na viumbwa vose vikutambala vi hengi. Mnungu aonaga kugamba ni vedi.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Niyo Mnungu agamba, “Kimuumbe mnt'hu, akeige suwe wenye, naho ande enga suwe. Ande na udahi kwe zisamaki za kwe bahali na madege ya mwo ulanga na makala yakudimwa ne isi yose na viumbwa vose vikutambala.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ivo Mnungu niyo amuumba mnt'hu akeigile enga yehe mwenye. Awaumbaga mgosi na Mvele, <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />awavikilaga akawagamba, “Indiliseni na cheleko, vileke cheleko chenyu kikekale mwe si yose no kuiika mwo udahi wenyu. Nawaikani nyuwe mnde wadahi mwe zisamaki na madege na makala yose ya kwe mbago.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Mnungu niyo agamba, “Himink'hani maziti yose yakweleka mbeyu na maziti yose yana matunda yande nk'hande yenyu, <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />na makala yose ya mwe isi na madege yose mwo ulanga na viumbwa vose vikubulumka na kila kiumbwa kina ugima, nk'hande yawe neinde mani.” Niyo vanda iivo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Mnungu aonaga kugamba kila icho adamanyaga, chandilisaga chedi. Zuwa dyaswaga niyo kwacha. Idyo dyandaga zuwa dya mtandatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ivo mbingu ne si vajikaga hamwenga na vose vimndani mwake. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Mwe dizuwa dya mfungate Mnungu ahumulaga kwaviya andaga kabinda zindima zakwe zose. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Mnungu niyo adivikila dizuwa dyo mfungate no kuditenda dikukile, kwaviya mwe dizuwa idyo Mnungu ahumulaga aho eze ibinde zindima zakwe zose zo uumbi.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiunga cha Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Ivo nivo si ne mbingu ziumbigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Aho Zumbe Mnungu aumbaga si ne mbingu, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />hakwandaga na maziti mwe isi, naho hakwadaga na mbeyu, kwaviya andaga akei kwigala fula, naho hakwandaga na mnt'hu ywa kuilima isanga, <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />mna mazi kulawa hasi yatumbukaga mwe si niyo yomela si yose.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu aguha ulongo we si na kumuumba mnt'hu kwa uwo ulongo no kumvila muye wo ugima kwe zimp'hula zakwe, uyo mnt'hu niyo anda kiumbwa kina ugima.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Naho Zumbe Mnungu ahandaga kiunga uko Edeni, uko ulailo wa zuwa, niyo amwiika uyo mnt'hu amdamanyaga. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Mnungu ahotezaga maziti yedi ye hengi yakweleka matunda yedi yakudigwa. Hagati he kiunga handaga na ziti dikugela ugima ne diziti dyo umanyi wa ayedi na yaihile.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kwandaga na mto uko Edeni womeelaga kiunga kulawa Edeni uwo mto wakepangaga mwe mito mine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Zina dya mto wa nk'hongo wetangagwa Pishoni, uwo wazunguluka mgati mwe isi yose ya Havila, ukwo kwandaga na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ye isi iyo yandilisaga yedi. Naho kwandaga na mavuta ya mhemp'he yakwitangwa bedola na maiwe ya ugoli yakwitangwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Mto wa kaidi wetangwa Gihoni, uwo wazunguluka mwe isi yose ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Zina dyo mto wa katatu wetangwa Tigilisi, ukuseela kwo ulailo wa zuwa wa Asilia, naho wa kane wetangwa Euflate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Mnungu amwiikaga uyo mnt'hu mwe Kiunga icho cha Edeni akilime hamwenga na kukikaula vedi. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga uyo mnt'hu, “Wadaha kudya matunda ya kila ziti mwe kiunga, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />mna matunda ya mti wo umanyi we yaihile na ayedi usekudya, kwaviya zuwa noudiile matunda yo mti uwo ikindedi noubanike.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu afanyanyaga mwenye kugamba, “Hivo vedi mnt'hu uyu ekale ekedu. Nenimuumbile mwambizi akuunga amwelele.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ivo aguhaga ulongo we si niyo aumba makala yose na madege. Ayegalaga kwa uyo mnt'hu akaule ivo akuunga ayetange, ivo mazina ayenk'haga yanda naayo mazina yawe hata diyelo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ivo uyo mnt'hu ayenk'haga mazina ayo makala ya kudimwa na makala ya kwe mbago na madege yose ya mwo ulanga, mna hakwandaga na chochose chaonekaga kunda mwambizi amwelelaga uyo mnt'hu.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu amwink'haga uyo mnt'hu nt'hongo zizamise, umwo andaga mwe zint'hongo, alusomolaga lubavu lwakwe lumwenga mwa uyo mnt'hu niyo alugubika ne nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Amuumbaga mvele kulawa mwo lubavu niyo amwigaila uyo mnt'hu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Niyo uyo mnt'hu agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Haluse, uyu vuha kulawa mwa mavuha yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">naho nyama kulawa mwe nyama yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">neetangwe mvele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwaviya kalavigwa mwe mgosi.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Kwe mbuli iyo mgosi naamwase ise na nine no kutimilana na mkaziwe, naho nawalungane kunda mwili umwenga.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mnt'hu uyu na mkaziwe, wose waidi wandaga kimbwigili, mna hawaonaga soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Kusaguka kwo mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Nyoka andaga mpapala mwa makala yose aumbaga Zumbe Mnungu. Nyoka niyo amuuza yudya mvele, “Nikindedi Mnungu kawagambani msekudya matunda ya mti wowose mwe kiunga?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Yudya mvele niyo ahitula, “Matunda ya mti wowose mwe kiunga chadaha kudya, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />mna umti uwo wihagati mwe kiunga bule, Mnungu kakilemeza kisekudya matunda yakwe, naho kaigamba kisekuukwafa, kwaviya ikindedi nekinabanike.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Nyoka niyo amgamba mvele, “Bule,ikindedi hombanike. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Mnungu kalonga ivo, kwaviya kamanya kugamba mnadya matunda yo mti uwo nomfumbulwe meso yenyu nomnde enga Mnungu, mkamanya ayedi na yaihile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Yudya mvele eze aone udya mti ni wedi kwa nkh'ande naho wagela kumunk'hwamunk'hwa, naho ni wedi kwa kupata umanyi. Ivo niyo aguha matunda yo mti uwo niyo adya. Niyo amwink'ha mgosiwe naye niyo adya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Weze wadye amatunda ayo, niyo wenk'higwa umanyi no kubunk'hula kugamba nawanda kimbwigili, ivo wakesumilaga wenye mani yo mtini niyo wakevala.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Kisingi kiya Adam na mkaziwe weze weve Zumbe Mnungu akagenda mwe kiunga, wakefisaga mgati mwa maziti ye kiunga. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Mna Mnungu niyo amwitanga uyo mnt'hu, “We mnt'hu wikuhi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Uyo mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Nehyogoha nize nikwive umwo mwe kiunga, hikefisa kwaviya nikimbwigili.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Mnungu niyo amuuza. “Uyo akugambile kugamba ukimbwigili niani? Weye kudya matunda yadya nakugambile usekudya?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo ahitula, “Yudya mvele unink'hile kindanye niye anink'hile matunda, niyo nadya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amuuza yudya mvele, “Nii ukatenda ivi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Yudya mvele niyo ahitula, “Nyoka niye anidant'hilize niyo nadya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnungu alava usengelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu amgamba nyoka, “Nohusulumize kwaayo udamanye, nakuligita weye wi kedu mwa makala yose. Kukongela ivi haluse no kugendeela nougende kwa kubulumka ne zinda, naho noudye luvumbi mwo wikazi wako wose. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Name neni watendeni mnde wank'hondo weye na uyo mvele, cheleko cha uyo mvele nekikuhonde umtwi, cheleko chako weye nekikihonde kisinyagilo che cheleko chakwe uyo mvele.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Niyo amgamba yudya mvele, “Nehwongezelese usungu mwo kweleka kwako. Noweleke wana kwa usungu. Hata ivo nouunge kugendeela kwikala na mgosiyo naho naakwikaile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Naho niyo amgamba Adamu, “Kwaviya weye kumtegeleza mkaziyo niyo wadya matunda yo mti udya nakugambile usekudya. Kwaayo udamanye, isanga iligitwa. Ukombekese mwe zindima zako mwo ugima wako wose vileke ikwink'he nk'hande ya kukukint'ha. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Sanga neikwelekele mbigili na miwa, naho noudye matunda na mani ya kwembago. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Nouungwe udamanyise ndima no kulawa kiluke uitende isanga ikwelekele kint'hu, mpaka mwe dizuwa nouuyiye mwe sanga umwo walawaga. Weye ywi sanga, naho mwe sanga nouuye.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu amwink'haga mkaziwe zina niye Hawa, kwaviya niye mamiyawe dya want'hu wose welekwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Zumbe Mnungu awadamanyilaga suke za nk'hingo Adamu na mkaziwe.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adam na mkaziwe waguluswa mwe kiunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu agamba, “Haluse mnt'hu kanda enga miyetu naho ana umanyi wo kumanya ayedi na yaihile. Na ivi hakuungwa kuguha matunda yo mti wo ugima no kuyadya, niyo ekala mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu awagulusaga kulawa mwe kiunga cha Edeni no kumtenda ailime isanga umwo walawaga. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Zumbe Mnungu eze awakulumbuze, aikaga makelubi kwe nt'hendelo yo ulailo wa zuwa we kiunga, na gola dya moto dikuhituka hituka nt'hendelo zose kwamila isila ikuita kwe diziti dyo ugima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Habili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu agonaga na Hawa mkaziwe, Hawa niyo engilwa ni ubovu. Engila nyumba mwanawe uyo Kaini. Niho hawa agambaga, “Kwa wambizi wa Zumbe Mnungu hipata mwana kilume.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Engilaga nyumba mwana kilume mtuhu etangwagwa Habili. Habili andaga mdimi, Kaini naye andaga mlimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Iwize lwomboke lupisi, Kaini aguhaga hant'hu ho ulozo niyo awigala kunda malavo kwa Zumbe, <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abeli naye aguhaga nt'hula sasu ze zingoto, niyo achinja, no kuguha zinyama zigimbale no kumlavila Mnungu. Zumbe elelwagwa ni Habili ne nt'hambiko yakwe, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />mna amlemelaga Kaini na malavo yakwe. Kaini aihiwagwa niyo afujuka kwa maya. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Zumbe amgambaga Kaini, “Nii ukaihiwa? Nii ukafujuka? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Wandile wadamanye yawagile, hegu hwa zumilwe? Mna huna damanye yawagile, wavu wakukimaila ho lwivi lwako, naho wakunyatila ukugwile, mna weye waungwa uuhume.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Niho Kaini amgambaga nduguye Habili, “Kite ha kabuga.” Umwo wandaga kwa kabuga Kaini amkump'hukilaga nduguye niyo amkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Zumbe amuuzaga Kaini, “Nduguyo Abeli ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kaini niyo ahitula, “Himanyize uko eli. Miye ni mtumwa ywa kumdima ndugu yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Niyo Zumbe agamba, “ Kudamanyai? Sakame ya nduguyo yaniila kulawa mwe sanga. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Haluse, weye kuligitwa mwe sanga iyo ikegubule niyo sakame ya nduguyo uyo umkomile yanweela umwo! <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Ndima yoyse noudamanye mwe sanga heikwink'he ulozo, naho nounde mnt'hu ywa kwangadika heena nt'hulwe mwe isi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini niyo amgamba Mnungu, “Usengelo wangu ukulisa hikudaha kuufinyiliza. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Dyelo kunigulusa kwe nk'honde ina ulozo no undiilo wako. Neninde hina kaya no kwangadika mwe isi, naho yeyose naanione naanikome.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu niyo agamba, “Bule. Uneva yeyose anakukoma, naalihizwe nk'hanana mfungate kujinka weye.” Ivo Mnungu amwikaga kiwalo Kaini kumkanya mnt'hu yeyose akuunga wamuone Kaini kugamba asekumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Kaini niyo ahalawa ho undiilo wa Mnungu no kugenda kwikala kwe isi ikwitangwa Nodi, ulailo wa zuwa mwa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheleko cha Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini na mkaziwe wapataga mwana kilume wamwink'hile zina niye Enoko. Niyo Kaini akonga kuzenga mzi niyo auwink'ha zina dya mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoko amwelekaga Iladi, Iladi naye amwelekaga Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli naye amwelekaga Metushaeli, Metushaeli naye amwelekaga Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki alombaga wavele waidi, yumwenga etangagwa Ada yumwenga naye etangagwa Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada amwelekaga Yabali, uyo andaga mkale ywa wadimi wandaga wakekala mwe zink'hambi. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Nduguye andaga ni Yabali, mkale ywa wila wandaga wakatoa miluli na mazeze. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila amwelekaga Tuba kaini, mkale ywa wasani vint'hu va shaba vilama. Lumbudye dya Tuba Kaini andaga ni Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki niyo awagamba wakaziwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila tegelezeni izwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">wakaza Lameki tegelezeni kiya hulonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Hikoma mnt'hu kwaviya kunigela nk'wenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Himkoma mbwanga kwaviya kanilumiza.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Uneva Kaini naalihizwe nk'hanana mfungate, ikindedi Lameki naalihizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">yeyose naanikome miye naalihizwe nk'hanana milongo mfungatena mfungate.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu apataga naho mwana kilume kwa mkaziwe Hawa. Adamu amwink'haga mwana uyo zina niye Seti, akagamba, “Mnungu kanink'ha mwana hant'hu ha Abeli, akomigwe ni Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti naye apataga mwana kilume, niyo amwink'ha zina dya Enoshi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:26">Aho niho want'hu wakongaga kumlombeza Mnungu kwa zina dyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Ulu nulo ludongo lwe cheleko cha Adamu. Umwo Mnungu awaumbaga want'hu, awaumbaga wakeigile na yehe mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Awaumbaga mgosi na mvele, niyo awavikila, no kuwetanga “Want'hu”. <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Umwo Adamu eze abule miaka gana na milongo mitatu, apataga mwana akeigile na yehe mwenye, niyo amwitanga Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Eze amweleke Seti, Adamu ekalaga miaka magana mnane mituhu. Apataga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />niyo abanika akanda na miaka magana kenda na milongo mitatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Umwo Seti andaga na miaka gana na mishano, apataga mwana, etangwagwa Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Eze amweleke Enoshi ekala miaka magana mnane na mfungate. Apataga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />niyo abanika akanda na miaka magana kenda na mlongo na miidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi eze abule miaka milongo kenda amwelekaga Kenani, <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Enoshi eze amweleke Kenani ekalaga miaka magana mnane na mlongo na mishano mituhu, <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi abanikaga akanda na miaka magana kenda na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Umwo Kenani andaga na miaka milongo mfungate, apataga mwana kilume uyo etangagwa Mahalaleli, <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kenani eze amweleke Mahalaeli ekelega miaka magana mnane na milongo mine mituhu. Elekaga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani abanikaga akanda na miaka magana kenda na mlongo.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli eze abule miaka milongo mtandatu na mishano, elekaga mwana kilume etangwagwa Yaledi, <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Eze amweleke Yaledi, Mahalaeli ekalaga miaka magana mnane na milongo mitatu. Elekega wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaeli abanikaga akanda na miaka magana mnane na milongo kenda na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Umwo Yaledi eze abule miaka gana dimwenga na milongo mtandatu na miidi, elekaga mwana kiume etangwagwa Enoki, <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />eze amweleke Enoki, Yaledi ekalaga miaka magana mnane mituhu. Apataga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaledi abanikaga akanda na miaka magana kenda na milongo mtandatu na miidi.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki eze abule miaka magana milongo mtandatu na mishano, apataga mwana kilume etangwagwa Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Akajika aho, Enoki ekalaga akamwelela Mnungu kwa miaka magana matatu niyo eleka wana watuhu wakike na wakilume. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoki ekalaga miaka magana mtandatu na mishano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Ekelaga akamwelela Mnungu wikazi wose, niyo agiila, kwaviya aguhagwa ni Mnungu vileke ande hamwenga naye.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Umwo Matusela eze abule miaka gana milongo mnane na mfungate, elekaga mwana kilume, niye Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Eze amweleke Lameki ekalaga miaka magana mtandatu na milongo mnane na mbili. Elekaga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela abanikaga akanda na miaka magana kenda na milongo mtandatu na kenda.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki eze abule miaka gana na milongo mnane na miidi, elekaga mwana kilume. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Amwink'haga zina niye Nuhu, akagamba “Mwana uyu niye naakisangalaze kulawa mwe ndima ndala kikuidamanya suwe wenye mwe sanga iligitwe ni Zumbe.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Eze amweleke Nuhu, Lameki ekalaga miaka magana mashano na milongo kenda na mishano. Elekaga wana watuhu wakike na wakilume <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki abanikaga akanda na miaka magana mfungate na milongo mfungate na mfungate.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu eze abule miaka magana mishano, elekaga wana kilume watatu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Wavu wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Umwo want'hu weze wagenyele mwe isi na wanakike weze welekwe mwe isi, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />wana Mnungu wamwenga waonaga kugamba awo wanakike wa awant'hu wandaga wahombweela, ivo niyo wawaguha wadya wawaungile vileke wande wavele ywawe. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Niyo Zumbe agamba, “Muye wangu howikale mndani mwo mnt'hu mazuwa yose, woho ni wa kubanika du. Kukongela ivi haluse no kugendeela hawekale kujink'ha miaka gana milongo miidi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mwa mazuwa ayo no kugendeela, kwandaga na mazint'hu mwe isi yandaga ni cheleko cha wavele na wana wa Mnungu. Want'hu awo wandaga ni wadahi naho aho kale watogoleswawa.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Mnungu eze aone kila mnt'hu adamanya wavu mwe isi na kufanyanya wiihi kwa lupisi lwose, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Zumbe Mnungu akanaga mwo moyo wakwe kugamba amuumbaga mnt'hu no kumwiika mwe isi. Zumbe Mnungu engilwgwa ni kinyulu mwo moyo wakwe, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />niyo agamba, “Neniwabanage pele want'hu niwaumbile mwe isi, naho nenibanange makala na madege na viumbwa vikutambala. Kwaviya nna kinyulu kugamba nehiwaumba mwe isi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Mna Mnungu elelwagwa ni Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ino niyo simulizi ya Nuhu. Nuhu andaga ni ywedi hameso ha Mnungu, andaga hakukalalizwa ni want'hu wekalaga nae mwo lupisi lwakwe naho andaga mbwiyaye dya Mnungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu andaga na wana watatu wa kilume, Shemu na Hamu na Jafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Mnungu aonaga isi ibanika naho imema nt'hulumunndu kila hant'hu mwe isi.<verse eid="GEN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Mnungu aikaulaga isi niyo aona kugamba yandaga ibanika, kwaviya want'hu wose watimila sila zawe ziihile.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Nuhu, “Hipata ulamuzi kuwabanaga wose we mwe isi. Ikindedi neniwabanange pele hamwenga ne isi, kwaviya waimemeza isi kwa wiihi na kuhujila. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Kwaivo kezengele safina yako kwa mahant'hi ya ziti ditogese, ikant'he vyumba naho ikizige lami kundani na kuse. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Izenge kwa utali wa mita gana dimwenga milongo na mitatu na kenda na uzangalamu wakwe mp'hima milongo mitatu, utali wakwe kuita kulanga nawo mp'hima milongo mitatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Udamanye mzeze mwe safina, naho wase mwazi nyanda mlongo na mnane kulawa mwo mzeze mwe zimbavu zakwe. Izengele magulu matatu naho ugele lwivi mwo lubavu lwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Nenigale ugubiko wa mazi mengi mwe isi nikome kila kiya kina ugima. Kila kint'hu mwe isi nekibanike, <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />mna neniike Ndagano na weye. Nowingile mwe safina weye na wanao na wavele ywawe. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Gela makala maidi idi mwe safina viumbwa viidi idi gosi na vele, vileke visekubanika enga ivo nevinde kwako. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Maidi idi mwe kila madege na kila makala ye hengi na kila kiumbwa kikutambala vikanda viidi idi vileke visekubanika. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Uguhe kila nk'hande ikudigwa, kwaajili yenyu na kwaajili ya viumbwa ivo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu adamanyaga yose yadya asigiilwe ni Mnungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Nuhu, “Ingila mwe safina weye hamwenga na wanao wose, Kwaviya hiona kugamba ni weye wikedu du mwe isi ukutenda yakunelela. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Uguhe makala ye hengi mfungate yakanda maidi idi gosi na vele, yawagilwe kwa nt'hambiko na makala ye hengi yaihile, guha gosi na vele du. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Iviya viya guha madege ye hengi yande maidiidi gosi na vele yande mfungate, vileke uike yase kubanika pele mwe isi ayo makala yehengi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Mazuwa mfungate kukongela haluse nenigale fula mwe isi neinye mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi, vileke nikome viumbwa vose ivo niviumbile.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Ivo Nuhu adamanyaga yose viligane na ivo Zumbe amsigiilaga.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nuhu andaga na miaka magana mtandatu umwo ugubiko mkulu wa mazi ukeza mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuhu na mkaziwe na wanawe wa kilume hamwenga na waka wana, wengilaga mwe safina wakakehonya no ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Naho makala yehengi yawagilwe kwa nt'hambiko na heye wagilwe kwa nt'hambiko, na madege na viumbwa vose vikutambala mwe isi, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />yengilaga mwe safina maidi idi gosi na vele, hamwenga na Nuhu, viligane na ivo Mnungu asigiile. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mfungate, ugubiko mkulu wa mazi wezaga mwe isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Umwo Nuhu andaga na miaka magana mtandatu, mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na mtandatu dyo mwezi wa kaidi, zuwa idyo n'choko zose zi hasi mwe isi zatumbukaga, niyo malanga ya kwe mbingu nayo yagubuka, <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />fula niyo yanya mwe isi mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Dizuwa idiya Nuhu na mkaziwe wengilaga mwe safina hamwenga na wana ywawe wa kilume, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti na wavele wawe. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Wengilaga woho wenye na makala ye hengi ya kwembago na makala ya kudimwa mwe zikaya na viumbwa vikutambala na madege ye hengi. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Viumbwa viidi idi vi hengi vengilaga mwe safina hamwenga na Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />viumbwa ivo vengilaga gosi na vele vi hengi enga ivo Mnungu amsigiilaga Nuhu, Mnungu naye niyo avugala ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ugubiko mkulu wa mazi wagendeelaga kwa mazuwa milongo mine, niyo mazi yagenyela no kuinula safina niyo yayeya. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Mazi yagenyelesaga, safina niyo yayeya mnanga mwa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Niyo yagenyelesa mwe isi na kuigubika milima yandilisaga mitali, <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />mazi niyo yongezekela no kujink'ha imilima kwa utali wa mp'hima mlongo na kane kuita kulanga. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Viumbwa vose vandaga na ugima mwe isi vabanikaga, kila dege na kila makala ya kwe mbago na kila makala ya kudimwa na kila na viumbwa vose na want'hu wose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Kila kint'hu kina muye mwe isi chabanikaga. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Mnungu avibanangaga pele kila kiumbwa chandaga na ugima mwe isi. Want'hu na makala na viumbwa vikutambala na madege, vose ivo nevibanangwa. Nuhu du, hamwenga na wadya wose wandaga nawo mwe safina nawo wahonaga. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Mazi aya yekalaga mwe isi kwa mazuwa gana milongo mishano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Kusila ko ugubiko mkulu wa mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Niyo Mnungu amkumbukila Nuhu na makala ya kwembago yose hamwenga ne mifugwa andaga nayo mwe safina, Mnungu niyo egala nk'hun'gunto mwe isi niyo mazi yakonga kunyweela. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Mwo lupisi ulo nc'hoko zi hasi mwe isi nezileka kulava mazi na mbingu yandile itumbuka . Fula niyo yacha, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />niyo mazi yagendeela kunyweela mwe isi naho yeze yomboke mazuwa gana na milongo mishano niyo mazi yanda yahungukisa. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mwe dizuwa dya mlongo na mfungate mwo mwezi wa mfungate safina yakimalaga mwe milima Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Mazi yagendeelaga kunyweela, niyo mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wo mlongo, vinenengwa ve milima vaonekelaga.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa milongo mine, Nuhu akomolaga dilanga diya adamanyaga mwe safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />niyo atuma kungulu ukwo kuse, dyaitaga uko na uko mpaka hadya mazi yeze yanyale pele mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Niho Nuhu atumaga naho suwamanga vileke ikakaule uneva mazi yabindaga kunyala mwe isi, <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />mna kwaviya mazi yandaga yakei yagubike isi, suwa manga hayaonaga ho kukima. Ivo isuwamanga yauyaga kwa Nuhu mwe safina. Nuhu achululaga mkono na kuigwila niyo ingiza kwe safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Agojaga mazuwa matuhu mfungate niyo atuma naho isuwamanga kulawa mwe safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />suwamanga yauyaga nekisingi ina zani bisi dya mzeituni mwo mnomo wakwe. Ivo Nuhu amanyaga kugamba mazi yanyala mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Niyo agoja mazuwa matuhu mfungate niyo aituma naho isuwa manga, aho elo, isuwamanga haiuiye naho kwe safina.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Umwo Nuhu andaga na miaka magana mtandatu na umwenga, mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dyo umwezi, mazi yanyalaga we isi. Nuhu ausaga ingubiko ye safina, akakaula, nokuona kugamba isi yanyalaga. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mwe dizuwa dya milongo miidi na mfungate mwo mwezi wa wakaidi, isi yanyalaga pele.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Fosa mwe safina weye na mkazio na wanao wakilume na wakaza wanawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Foseza mwe safina kila kiumbwa kina ugima viya vandile hamwenga na weye, madege na makala na viumbwa vose vikutambala mwe isi vileke vikakeeleke no kugenyela mwe isi yose.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ivo Nuhu afosaga mwe safina hamwenga na mkaziwe, na wanawe na wakawanawe. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Makala yose na viubwa vose vi mwe isi na madege yose na kila kimwenga kikutambala, vafosaga mwe safina viligane na ivo vandaga vihengi.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu amlavila Mnungu nt'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nuhu aduganyaga maiwe na kuyaumbika kunda enga nc'hanja ya kumvika Mnungu, aguhaga yamwenga mwa makala na madege yakuwagilwa kwa nt'hambiko ye hengi no kuyoka yose kunda nt'hambiko ya koka aho kilingo. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Zumbe eze ahefye mhemp'he ukwelela, akelobgelaga mwenye akagamba, “Heniiligite naho isi kwa wiihi wa want'hu, kwaviya himanya kugamba kukongela udodo fanyanyi zawe ziiha du. Heniuiye kubananga pele iviumbwa vina ugima enga ivo nidamanye. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Mwo kugendeela kwe isi, msimo wo kuhanda no kuvuna, na msimo wa mp'heho na wo kubwikana na msimo wa nk'hung'unto na mmp'eho itendese na kilo na msi. Ivi hevinde na uheelo.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu adamanya Lagano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Mnungu niyo awavikila Nuhu na wanawe akawagamba, “Yelekeni mgenyele, mwiimemeze isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Makala yose na madege mwo ulanga na vint'hu vose vimemile mwe isi na samaki zose kwe bahali, nevimwogoheni. Ivo vose viikwa mwo udahi wenyu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Neniwenk'heni kila kina ugima kinde nk'hande yenyu, enga viya niwenk'hileni amaziti, naho haluse nawenk'hani kila kint'hu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Mna msekudya nyama ina sakame, kwaviya ugima umwe sakame. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Mnt'hu yeyose akumkoma miyawe naye nenimsengele kwa kumkoma, naho kala dyodyose nedimkome mnt'hu nenidikome. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Akuunga amkome mnt'hu, naye naakomigwe ni mnt'hu kwaviya mnt'hu kaumbwa akeigile kwa Mnungu.”<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Nyuwe yelekeni mgenyele, mwelekese mkagenyele mwe isi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Mnungu amgambaga Nuhu na wanawe, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Haluse naika Ndagano yangu na nyuwe hamwenga ne welekwa wenyu wakwiza, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ne viumbwa vose na madege yose na makala yose na kila kiya kilaile mwe safina hamwenga na nyuwe na kila kiumbwa kino ugima mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Naika lagano dyangu mwa nyuwe kugamba henibanage pele naho viumbwa kwa ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi, hokunde naho na ugubiko mkulu wa mazi ukuunga uibanange isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Niyo Mnungu agamba, “Iki nicho kilagiso mwe dilagano idi huika na nyuwe hamwenga ne viumbwa vose vina ugima, lagano dya vyeleko vose vikwiza. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Naika tamwasi dyangu mwa mavunde. Neinde kilagiso che dilagano dyangu ne isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Haigubika isi na mavunde tamwasi niyo dyailaila mwa mavunde, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />neni kumbukile dilagano dyangu kwenyu kwa makala yose, kugamba ugubiko mkulu wa mazi houkome wose wana ugima kaidi. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Tamwasi dikalaila mwa mavunde, Nenidione no kukumbukila dilagano dyangu dya mazuwa yose mwa miye ne viumbigwa viumbe mwe isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Nuhu, “Icho nicho kilagiso che dilagano huika mwa miye na viumbwa vose vina ugima.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na wanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Wana Nuhu wafosaga mwe safina wandaga Shemu na Hamu, na Yafeti. Hamu amweleke Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Wana awa watatu wa Nuhu wandaga nawo wakale wa want'hu wose mwe isi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu, andaga mlimi naho akongaga kulima nk'honde wa mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Zuwa dimwenga anywelesaga divai aidamanyaga, niyo akolwa, niyo atambala kimbwigili kwe dihema dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu ise dya Kanani amuonaga ise ekimbwigili niyo agendaga kuwagambila wadya wanduguze waidi awo wandaga kuse. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Mna Shemu na Yafeti waguhaga mgolole niyo wakehasika kunyuma mwa maega yawe. Wengilaga kisengelenyuma kwe dihema dya tati yawe niyo wamgubika wakayaonya meso yawe ukwo walawile wase kuuona umbwigili wa tati yawe. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuhu eze aleukwe no kubunk'hula kiya mwanawe mdodo amtendile, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Aligitwe Kanaani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Naande mtumwa ywa watumwa kwa wanduguze.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Naho niyo agamba, atogolwe Zumbe Mnungu ywa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani ande mtumwa ywa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Mnungu amgenyeze Yafeti. Zina idi kwa kiibulania, nuko kugamba, mgenyezo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Welekwa wakwe wikale mwe dihema dya Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani naande mtumwa ywa Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi wize womboke, Nuhu ekalaga miaka magana matatu na milongo mishano. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Nuhu abanikaga akanda na miaka milongo kenda na milongo mishano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa wana wa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Aho ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi wize usile, wana wa Nuhu awo wakina Shem na Hamu na Jafeti, welekaga wana wa kilume na wa kivele.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Welekwa wa Yafeti ni awa, Gomeli na Magogu na Madai na Javani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Welekwa wa Gomeli ni Ashikenazi na Lifasi hamwenga na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Welekwa wa Yavani wandaga ni Elisha na Talashishi na Kitimu na Lodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Awa nicho ichotoko cha want'hu wakwikala na kusambala mp'wani, kila want'hu kwa ulosi wawe na lukolo lwawe na kwa si zawe.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Wana wa Hamu wandaga ni Kushi na Misili na na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Wana wa Kushi wandaga ni Seba na Havila na Sabta na Laama na Sebteka. Wana wa kilume wa Laama wandaga Shebe na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi amwelekaga Nimlodi uyo andaga mhumi ywa nk'hongo mwe si zose. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Kwa wambizi wa Mnungu andaga mkala mkulu, naivo nivo vikuleka want'hu wagamba, “Zumbe akutende mkala mkulu enga ivo eli Nimlodi!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Mizi ya nk'hongo yo useuta wakwe yandaga ni Babeli na Eleki na Akadi na Kaline mwe si za Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Eze alawe mwe isi idya aitaga Asilia no kuizenga mizi ya Ninawi na Lehoboti-Ili na Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Leseni ihagati ya Ninawi na Kalashi mzi mkulu.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Wana wa Misili wandaga ni Waludi na Waanami na Walehabi na Wanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Wapatilasi na Wakasiluhi, awa nawo chotoko cha Wafilisiti na Wakafutoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kaanani andaga niye ise dya Sidoni uyo nt'hula sasu ywakwe, hamwenga na Wahiti. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Kanani iviya iviya andaga niye mkale ywa Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagiligali, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />na Wahivi na Waaliki na Waasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Waavadi na Wazemali na Wahamati. Akajika aho makabila ayo ye hengi ya Wakanani yasambalaga, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />niyo wabula nt'hendelo za Kwa mwenye mzi mwa Sidoni kuhinga Gelali hagihi na Gaza na nt'hendelo za ulailo wa zuwa mpaka Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Zeboimu hagihi na Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Awa nawo wana wa Hamu kwa nk'holo zawe na milosi yawe na si zawe. <verse eid="GEN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu mkuluwe dya Yafeti andaga niye mkale ywa Waibulania wose. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Awa nawo wana wa Shemu, Elamu na Asilia na Alipakishadi na Ludi na Asilia. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Wana wa Asilia wandaga ni Usi na Huli na Getheli na Meshi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alipakishadi amwelekaga Shela, Shela amwelekaga Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebeli niye elekaga wana kilume waidi. Ywa nk'hongo etangagwa Pelegi kwaviya elekagwa mwo lupisi want'hu we isi wakapangana. Wakaidi naye etangwagwa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Wana wa Yokitani ni Alimodadi na Selefu na Hasamaweti na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hodulamu na Uzali na Dikilaha, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali na Abimaleki na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Awa wose ni welekwa wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Wekalaga mwe isi kulawa Mesha kuhinga Sefali mwe isi ye vigulu va Ulailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Shemu wakwikala viligane ne zink'holo zawe ne si zawe na milosi yawe na makabila yawe.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Awa wose ni welekwa wa lukolo wa wana wa Nuhu, viligane ne vyeleko vawe na si zawe. Kulawa kwa want'hu awo, want'hu wose wa si zose nawagenyela mwe si zose aho ugubiko mkulu wa mazi mwe isi wize womboke.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mnala wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Aho nk'hongo want'hu wose mwe isi wandaga wakalonga ulosi umwenga na milongele imwenga. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Ivo want'hu weze watambe kulawa ulailo wa zuwa, wabulaga kwe isi ye nt'hindiga uko Babiloni niyo wekala uuko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Niyo wakegamba, “Hake nekidamanye matofali naho kiyoke vedi.” Ivo niyo wadamanya matofali hant'hu ha maiwe na kuguha lami yo kulunganyila. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Niyo wagamba, “Kizengeni mzi wa mnala lunenengwa lwakwe lubule kwe mbingu vileke kitogolwe ni want'hu naho kise kusambala mwe isi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Mnungu aseelaga hasi vileke akaule umzi wo mnaala uwo uzengigwe na want'hu awo, <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />niyo agamba, “Want'hu awa ni wamwenga, naho walonga ulosi umwenga, naho ino niyo ink'hongelo du ya yadya wakuunga wadamanye. Naivo nawadahe kudamanya dyodyose diya nawaunge! <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Kiseeleni kikawahanganye milosi yawe vileke wasekuivana.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Naivo Zumbe awatendaga wasambale mwe isi yose niyo waleka kuuzenga umzi. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Mzi wetangwagwa Babeli kwaviya nuko Mnungu auhanganyaga ulosi we si yose. Ivo kukongela aho, Zumbe auhanganyaga ulosi wa want'hu wose, niyo awatenda wasambale mwe isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Awo nawo welekwa wa Shemu. Ize yomboke miaka miidi aho ugubiko mkulu wa mazi wize womboke mwe isi. Shemu andaga mkulu ywa miaka gana. Elekaga mwana kilume akwitangwa Alipakishadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Niyo ekala naho miaka mituhu magana mashano niyo eleka wana watuhu wakike na wa kilume.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Alipakishadi eze abule miaka milongo mitatu na mishano elekaga mwana kilume etangwagwa Sela, <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Alipakishadi aho ekalaga miaka mituhu magana mane na mitatu niyo eleka wana watuhu wakike na wa kilume.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela eze abule miaka milongo mitatu elekaga mwana kilume etangagwa Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Akajika aho Sela ekalaga naho miaka magana mane na mitatu, elekaga wana watuhu wakike na wa kilume.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebeli eze abule miaka milongo mitatu na mine, elekaga mwana kilume etangagwa Pelegi, <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Akajika aho Ebeli ekalaga naho miaka magana mane na milongo mitatu umwo elekaga wana watuhu wa kilume na wa kike. <verse eid="GEN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi eze abule miaka milongo mitatu elekaga mwana kilume etangagwa Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Akajika aho Pelegi ekalaga naho miaka magana maidi na kenda umo elekaga wana watuhu wa kilume na wa kike. <verse eid="GEN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu eze abule miaka milongo mitatu na miidi elekaga mwana kilume etangagwa Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Akajika aho Leu eze amweleke Selugi ekalaga naho miaka magana maidi na mfungate umwo elekaga wana watuhu wa kilume na wa kike. <verse eid="GEN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Selugi eze abule miaka milongo mitatu elekaga mwana kilume etangagwa Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Akajika aho Selugi eze amweleke Naholi, ekalaga miaka mituhu magana maidi, elekaga wana watuhu wa kilume na wa kike.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naholi eze abulize miaka milongo miidi na kenda, elekaga mwana kilume etangwagwa Tela, <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Naholi eze amweleke Tela, ekalaga miaka gana na mlongo na kenda mituhu, elekaga wana watuhu wakilume na wa kike.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela eze abule miaka milongo mfungate, awelekaga Ibulamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Welekwa wa Tela ni awa, Ibulamu na Naholi na Halani niye ise dya Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Uyu Halani abanikilaga mwo mzi wa kwawe ukwitangwa Uli uko Babiloni, umwo ise andaga akei mgima. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ibulamu amlombaga Salai, Naholi naye amlombaga Milika mwana Halani, uyo iviya iviya andaga niye ise dya Iska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai andaga mgumba.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela amguhaga mwanawe Ibulamu hamwenga na mwezukuluwe Lutu uyo mwanawe dya Halani, hamwenga salai andaga mkaza mwanawe. Alawaga nao mwo mzi wa Uli uko Babiloni niyo waita kwe isi ya Kanaani. Weze wabule Halani niyo wekala aaho. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela abanikilaga uko Halani akanda na miaka magana maidi na mishano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe amwitanga Ibulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Zumbe amgambaga Ibulamu, “Halawe mwe isi yako na wanduguzo ne isi ya iso, wiite kwe isi idya huunga hulagise. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nohutende unde na want'hu wengi vitendese. Naho nohuvikile no kuditenda dizina dyako dimanyikise naho weye nounde uvikilwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Neniwavikile wose wakukuvikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Mna neniwaligite wose wakukuligita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Naho kwa weye neniwavikile want'hu wa si zose.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Ivo Ibulamu ahalawaga enga ivo Zumbe amgambilaga, Lutu naye aitaga na Ibulamu. Ibulamu andaga na miaka milongo mfungate na mishano umwo akahalawa kulawa Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Ibulamu amguhaga mkaziwe Salai na Lutu mwana nduguye no ugoli wakwe wose na watumwa awaguhaga uko Halani, niyo wakonga kuita kwe isi ya Kanani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Weze wengile Kanani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Ibulamu ombokelega mgati mwe isi mpaka hant'hu hakukile kwo mti mkulu wa Momle, uko Shekemu. Mwo lupisi ulo Wakanani wandaga mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Zumbe amlailaga Ibulamu niyo amgamba, “Ino niyo isi neniwenk'he welekwa wako.” Niyo Ibulamu amzengela Zumbe uyo amlailaga kilingo cha kutambikila. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Akajika asogelaga kuhinga kwe isi ye vigulu ikwo ulailo wa zuwa wo mzi wa Beseli, niyo azenga nk'hambi. Beseli ikanda Usweelo wa zuwa, mzi wa Ai nawo ukanda kwo ulailo wa zuwa. Hadya naho amzengelaga Zumbe kilingo cha kutambikila niyo amvika kwa zina dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Akajika aho agendeelaga na nt'hambo kuita kwe isi ya Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu mwe isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Mna kwalailaga gumbo kulu uko Kaanani chamtendaga Ibulamu ahingise Kwa mwenye mzi kuita Misili no kwikala uuko kwa lupisi kwaviya gumbo dyandilisaga kulu. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Eze ande hagihi kwingila Misili amgambaga mkaziwe Salai, “Himanya kugamba weye umvele uhombweele. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Wamilisi wanakuona nawagambe weye ywi umkazangu, naivo nawanikome nokukuleka weye mgima. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Ivo wagambile weye ulumbu dyangu, naivo hawanikome naho nawanitendele ayedi kwajili yako.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Weze wajink'he umhaka no kwingila Misili, Wamisili waonaga kugamba Salai ni mvele ahomboele. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Wandima wa Falao weze wamuone uyo mvele, niyo wagenda kumgambila Falao ivo uyo mvele ahombweele, Salai niyo egalwa kwe kaya kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kwajili yo mvele uyo, Falao amtendelaga uwedi Ibulamu, naho niyo amwink'ha mafyo ya ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na mp'hunda vele na gosi na watumwa wagosi na wavele na ngamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Mna kwaviya Falao kamguha Salai mkaza Ibulamu, Zumbe amwigailaga maine ya kusumlumiza uyo Falao na want'hu we mwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Falao niyo amwitanga Ibulamu no kumuuza, “Weye kunitenda vivihi? Nii hunigambile kugamba uyu andaga mkazio? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Nii ukagamba uyu ni lumbudyo niyo waleka miye namguha kunda mkazangu? Mkaziyo uyo mguhe naho uhalawe!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Niyo Falao awagamba want'hu wakwe, wamlave Ibulamu mwe isi hamwenga na mkaziwe no kila kiya andile nacho.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Ibulamu wapangana na Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Ibulamu akwelaga kulawa Misili na kuuya Negebu akanda na mkaziwe na kila kint'hu chakwe hamwenga na Lutu mwana nduguye. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ibulamu andaga mgoli vitendese ywa mifugwa hamwenga na matundu na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Agendeelaga no utafi kuita Negebu mpaka Beseli, hadya hant'hu azengaga nk'hambi indaga ni hagati ya Beseli na Ai. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Aho niho azengaga kilingo cha kutambikila ha nk'hongo, niyo Ibulamu amvika Zumbe eketanga zina dyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Naho Lutu uyo atambaga na Ibulamu andaga na ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe hamwenga ne mp'huga yakwe na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Kwaivo hawadahaga kukint'ha wose kwa udimi kwaviya kila yumwenga andaga na mafyo makulu yalekaga wasekudaha kwikala hamwenga. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ivo kwalailaga nk'humbizi kwa wadimi wa Ibulamu na wadimi wa Lutu. Mwo lupisi ulo Wakanani na Wapelizi wandaga wakaya mwe isi iyo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ibulamu niyo amgamba Lutu, “Suwe kindugu, elo kisekugomba miye na weye, hegu wadimi wako na wadimi wangu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Kaula isi yose ino ukwiiona, Ivo kipangane. Sagula hant'hu hohose mwe isi ukuunga. Ukahinga kulume miye nenihinge kumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu akaulaga no kuwona kolongo dyose dya Yolidani mpaka Zoali kwandaga na mazi mengi enga kiunga cha Zumbe, hegu enga ni isi ya Misili. Ino yandaga umwo Zumbe akei kuibananga mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ivo Lutu akesaguilaga dikolongo dyose dya Yolidani no kugendeela kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa. Ivo nivo want'hu awa waidi wapanganaga. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Ibulamu ekalaga mwe isi ya Kanani, Lutu naye ekalaga mwe mizi imwe dikolongo niyo asamiza nk'hambi yakwe Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Mna want'hu wa Sodoma wandaga waihile vitendese wamtendelaga Zumbe wavu mkulu.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulamu alagiswa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lutu eze ahalawe, Zumbe amgambaga Ibulamu, “Kaula vedi mwe zint'hendelo zose kukongela aho wili kaula Kasikazini na Kusini. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Nohwink'he isi ino yose ukuiona, weye hamwenga na welekwa wako, naho neinde yenyu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Nohwink'he welekwa wabindile ingi hekwiina mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kuwawaza, enga viya hevikudahika kuwaza luvumbi mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ita, uigendele isi kwo utali wakwe no uzangalamu wakwe kwaviya nakwik'ha weye.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Ivo Ibulamu amolaga mahema yakwe niyo agenda kwikala hagihi ne miti mikulu ya Mamle uko Hebuloni, naho uko niyo azenga kilingo cha kutambikila kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Ibulamu amyokola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Mwo mazuwa yo kwikaila kwakwe seuta Amlafeli ywa Shinali, maseuta awa washano, Amlafeli seuta ywa isi ya Shinali na Alioko seuta ywa isi ya Elaza na seuta Kadolaoma ywa isi ya Asilia na Tidali seuta ywa isi ya Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />wagendaga kutowana nk'hondo na maseuta watuhu, wakina Bela seuta ywa Sodoma na Bilisha seuta ywa Gomola na Shinabi seuta ywa Adima na Shemebeli seuta ywa Zeboimu, hamwenga na seuta ywa Zoali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Maseuta awa washano walunganyaga mafyo yawe ya watowani niyo dyanda fyo dimwenga uko kwe dikolongo dya Sidimu, idyo kwaivi haluse dikwitangwa Bahali yo munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa miaka mlongo na miidi wandaga wakamtegeleza seuta Kedolama, mna ize ibule mwo mwaka wa mlogo na mitatu wasagukaga. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mwo mwaka wa mlongo na kane, seuta Keodalama na wadya maseuta weyawe wezaga na watowani wawe niyo wawahuma want'hu wa Lefaimu uko Ashitelohi Kanaimu na Wazuzi wa uko Hamu, na wa Emimu mwe zint'hindiga za Kiliathaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Waholi uko mwe milima ya Edomu, no kuwagulusa mpaka Elipalani mwo mhaka ne dijangwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Niyo wauya kunyuma mpaka Eninishipati nuko kugamba Kadeshi, niyo waitowa isi yose ya Waamaleki, na kuwahuma Waamoli wandaga wakekala Hazazoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Niho seuta ywa Sodoma na seuta ywa Gomola na seuta wa Adima na seuta ywa Seboimu na seuta ywa Bela wayaduganyaga mafyo ya watowani wawe kwa nk'hondo uko kwe dikolongo dya Sidimu. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Watoane na seuta Elamu Goimu na Babelonia na Elasali, maseuta washano kuhigana na maseuta wane. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Kolongo dya Sidimu dya memaga mabome ya lami, ivo seuta ywa sodoma na seuta ywa Gomola wakanyilika ink'hondo wakwamaga mwa mabome, mna maseuta watuhu wadya watatu wanyilikilaga kwe milima. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ivo wadya wahumi waguhaga kila kint'hu hamwenga na nk'hande uko Sodoma na Gomola, niyo wakeitila. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Ivo wamtaha Lutu, mwana nduguye dya Ibulamu, uko andile akekala Sodoma hamwenga na ugoli wakwe no kuita kwawe.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mna mnt'hu yumwenga anyilikaga niyo akumgambila Ibulamu Muibulania andaga akekala hagihi ne miti mikulu ya muamoli ya Mamle. Mamle andaga na nduguye akwitangwa Eshikelo na Aneli wose awa walaganaga na Ibulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Ibulamu eze eve kugamba mwana nduguye katahigwa, awetangaga watowani wa mwe nyumba yakwe wabulaga magana matatu na mlongo na mnane niyo wawatimila wadya maseuta wane mpaka Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Nekilo iicho, Ibulamu awapangaga want'hu wakwe mwe mabunga bunga, niyo wawatowa wank'hondo wawe no kuwahuma. Awagulusaga mpaka Hoba mkoma mahanya mwa Damaska, <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />niyo aukombola ugoli wose udya watahigwe na wank'hondo. Iviya iviya amvuzaga Lutu mwana nduguye ne vint'hu vakwe, hamwenga na wavele, na want'hu watuhu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikezedeki amvikila Ibulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Umwo Ibulamu andaga akauya kulawa kokumhuma Kedolama na maseuta watuhu, seuta ywa Sodoma agendaga kumsingila kwe dikolongo dya Shawe, idyo dikwitangwa iviya iviya Kolongo dya maseuta. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Melekizedeki uyo andaga seuta ywa Salemu, uyo andaga mlava nt'hambiko ywa Mnungu ywo udahi wose naye egalaga mkate ne divai kwa Ibulamu, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />amvikilaga akamgamba, “Mnungu ywo udahi ywa yose aumbile mbingu ne isi naamvikile Ibulamu! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Naatogolwe Mnungu ekwe mbingu, uyo akwambizaga kuwahuma wank'hondo wako!” Ibulamu niyo amwink'ha Melekizedeki hant'hu ha mlongo mwe vint'hu vakwe vose viya ananavo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Akajika ayo, seuta ywa Sodoma niyo amgamba Ibulamu. “Usigale ne vint'hu vose, mna univuzile want'hu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Ibulamu amhitulaga kugamba, “Nakelisa kwa Mnungu Mkulu, muumbi ywe mbingu ne isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kugamba heniguhe chochose ichako, luzi hegu hata luzigi lwa vilatu vako, unase uketogole ugambe. Ni miye nimtendile Ibulamu kunda mgoli. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Heniguhe chochose, mna neniguhe du viya vint'hu va wabwangwa wangu wadile na viya ivint'hu va want'hu wandile hamwenga na miye, nawo ni awa, Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamle, awo leka waguhe upasi wawe.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya Mnungu na Ibulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Yeze yomboke ayo Ulosi wa Zumbe yamwizilaga Ibulamu mwe zisozi akamgamba, Ibulamu, “Usekogoha, nohwamile no wiihi wose naho geleko dyako nedikulise.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Mna Ibulamu niyo ahitula, “We Zumbe Mnungu ywa yose nounink'he wedi wani ukuunga unde nt'hunyo kwangu name hina mwana yeyose? Mkipe ywangu ni Eliezeli du mnt'hu ywa Damasika. <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Niyo Ibulamu agamba, hunink'hile mwana kwaivo mtumwa elekwe mwe nyumba yangu naande mkipe ywangu.” <verse eid="GEN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Niho akamwiva Zumbe Mnungu akalonga naye naho, “Mtumwa uyu Eliezeli hakudaha kunda mkipe ywako, mkipe ywako naande mwanao mwenye.”<verse eid="GEN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Zumbe amlavaga Ibulamu kuse niyo amgamba, “Kaula kwe mbingu ikindedi uneva wadaha kuziwaza zint'hondo. Ivo nivo nounde na welekwa enga zoho.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Ibulamu amhuwilaga Zumbe, kwaivo Zumbe naye kamzumila kunda ywedi.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba, “Miye ni Zumbe akulavile Uli uko Babiloni vileke hwink'he isi ino inde yako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Mna Ibulamu amuuzaga Mnungu ywa yose akamgamba, “Nenimanye vivihi kugamba neinde yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Nigaile moli ya ngombe na nt'hogota ya mbuzi na ndolome naho zose zinde za miaka mitatu tatu, hamwenga na suwa na suwamanga.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ibulamu avigalaga ivo kwa Mnungu, ivo avipangaga hindi niyo apanga zint'hili ziya mwe zisafa kila imwenga mwe misafa miidi, mna yadya madege yandaga hayatumbulwe. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Ndege nyika zezaga zidye ivimba viya, mna Ibulamu azigulusaga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Zuwa dize diswe Ibulamu apataga nt'hongo, wogofi wo lwiza umgubike. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Zumbe niyo amgamba, “Welekwa wako nawande watakwiza mwe isi hi yawe, nawande watumwa uko no kudumangizwa kwa miyaka magana mane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Mna neni itowe isi idiya ikuwatenda kunda watumwa wawe, naho umwo wakafosa mwe isi idya wakutendigwa watumwa, akajika ayo nawafose na ugoli mwingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Mna weye mwenye nowikalise mwo udala wako, naho noubanike kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Mwe cheleko cha kane niho welekwa wako nawauye aha, kwaviya heniwaguluse Waamoli mpaka watende wavu vileke niwatowe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Zuwa dize diswe niyo kwanda na ziza, nunda ikufunk'ha mosi na gala dikukweela moto valailaga aaho niyo vombokela mwe vimba viya vikant'higwe. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Mwe dizuwa idyo Zumbe aikaga Ndagano na Ibulamu akamgamba, “Welekwa wako neniwenk'he isi ino yose kulawa kwe mihaka ya Misili kuita kwo mto mkulu wa Efulati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />hamwenga ne ziisi za Waakeni na Wakenizi na Wakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Wahiti na Wapelizi na Walifaimu, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Waamoli na Wakanani na Wagiligashi na Wayebushi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hajili no mwanawe Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Salai mkaza Ibulamu, hamwelekele mgosiwe mwana yeyose. Mna andaga na mvele mtumwa akulawa misili etangagwa Hajili, <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />naivo Salai niyo amgamba Ibulamu mgosiwe, “Mnungu haungile kunink'ha mwana haluse gona na uyo mtumwa ywangu Hajili mafani adaha kunelekela mwana.” Ibulamu azumilaga yadya alongile mkaziwe Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Ivo Salai niyo amwigala Hajili mtumwa ywakwe andile Mmisili kwa Ibulamu vileke ande mkaziwe. Aya yalailaga miaka mlongo umwo Ibulamu andaga kekela Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Ibulamu agonaga na Hajili niyo Hajili apata ubovu. Hajili eze aone kapata ubovu, aketogolaga no kumbela Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Salai amgambaga Ibulamu, “Noukalalizwe weye kwo lubezo akunitendela Hajili. Miye nehikwink'ha mtumwa ywangu, mna eze aone kugamba kapata ubovu niyo anibela. Mnungu alamule mwa miye na weye.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Ibulamu niyo ahitula, “Nivedi, Hajili mtumwa ywako naho ehasi yako, Mdamanyile viya ukuunga.” Ivo Salai amtendelaga Hajili ukwank'walu vilekile Hajili kanyilika.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Mtumigwa ywa kwembingu ambwiilaga Hajili he n'choko ya mazi mwe dijangwa, mwe sila ikwiita Shulu, <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />niyo mtumigwa ywa kwembingu amuuza, “Hajili mtumwa ywa Salai, walawanahi, naho waitanahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajili niyo amhitula, “Miye namnyilika mkulu uyo Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Mtumigwa ywa kwembingu niyo amgamba, “Uya kwa mkuluwo Salai ukande naho mtumwa ywakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Yudya mtumigwa wa kwembingu ongezaga kugamba, “Miye nohwink'he welekwa wabindile ingi heweekuwazika. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Noweleke mwana kilume naho noumwink'he zina niye Ishumaeli. Zina idyo kwa kiibulania nuko kugamba, Zumbe eva. Kwaviya Zumbe eva indilo ya makunt'ho yako. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Mna mwanao neekale enga mp'hunda ya kwe mbago, naaihiane na kila mnt'hu, na kila mtu naande mwiihi wakwe. Neekale hale na wanduguze.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hajili niyo akelongela mwenye, kindedi hibunk'hula kugamba Mnungu aniona. Amwink'haga zina uyo Zumbe alongaga naye kugamba, “Niwe Mnungu ukuniona.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Nivo vikuleka want'hu wakitanga kisima kiya kihagati ya Kadeshi na Baledi, “Beeli Lahai Loi.” “Kisima cha Mta Ugima Akuniona.”<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hajili amwelekelaga Ibulamu mwana kilume niyo Ibulamu amwink'ha zina umwana niye Ishumaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ibulamu, andaga na miyaka milongo mnane na mtandatu umwo Hajili akamweleka Ishumaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Iagano dyo kuvinilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Umwo Ibulamu andaga na miaka milongo kenda na kenda, Zumbe amlailaga niyo agamba, “Ni miye Mnungu ywo udahi. Unitegeleze miye naho udamanye yakwelela mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Naika lagano dyangu na weye, naho nohongelese welekwa wako.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Ibulamu niyo afunamila hasi, akadumika kihanga mwe sanga, niyo Mnungu agamba, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Naika lagano idi na weye, nakugamba nounde tate ywa want'hu wengi wa si nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Howitangwe naho Ibulamu, nowitangwe Ibulahimu, kwaviya hikutenda tate ywa want'hu wengi wa si nyingi”. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nohwink'he welekwa wengi, nenidamanye si kulawa mwako na maseuta nawalawe kwako.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Neni didime dilagano dyangu kwako na kwa welekwa wako kwe cheleko kikwiza kunda lagano hediina uheelo. Neninde Mnungu ywako naho neninde Mnungu ywa welekwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nohwink'he weye na vyeleko vako isi ino mkwikala haluse enga watakwiza. Isi ino yose ya Kanani inde yenyu mazuwa yose, miye name neninde Mnungu ywawe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Niyo Mnungu amgamba Ibulahimu, “Weye waungwa kuditoza dilagano dyangu, weye na welekwa wako ne vyeleko vako vikwiza. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Idi nidyo dilagano dyangu kwako weye na welekwa wako wakukutimila, lagano ukuungwa kuditoza. Kila mgosi mwa nyuwe vaungwa avinilwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Nomvinilwe, naho nicho nekinde kilagiso che dilagano mwa miye na nyuwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kila mwana wa kigosi ywa mazuwa mnane vaungwa avinilwe, hamwenga na watumwa welekwe mwe kaya zenyu, hegu watile kugulwa kwa matundu yenyu kulawa kwa watakwiza wadya hiyo welekwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Kila elekwe mwe nyumba yako hata aguligwe kwa matundu aungwa avinilwe. Icho nekinde kilagio mwo mwili wako che dilagano dyangu dya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Mgosi yeyose heevinilwe naapagulwe kulawa mwa want'hu wakwe, kwaviya haditozile dilagano na miye.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Mnungu niyo agendeela kumgamba Ibulahimu, “Homwitange naho mkaziyo, Salai, kukongela ivi haluse noumwitange mkaziyo, Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Neni mvikile naho naakwelekele mwana kilume. Neni mvikile Sala mkaziyo, naande mwelesi ywa si nyingi, naho maseuta nawelekwe kwakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ibulahimu afunamilaga hasi, kihanga chakwe kika sila mwe sanga, mna andaga akaseka uku akafanyanya akagamba, “ Ivo vadahika mt'hu kweleka mwana akanda mdala ywa miaka gana? Vadahika Sala mta miaka milongo kenda eleke mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ibulahim amuuzaga Mnungu, “Nii Ishumaeli asekunda mkipe ywangu?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Niyo Mnungu amgamba, “Bule. Mkaziyo Sala naakwelekele mwana kilume naho noumwink'he zina niye Isaka.” Neniike Ndagano yangu na Isaka hamwenga na welekwa wakwe, Ndagano ya mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Hikwiva mwe mbuli ya Ishumaeli, Neni mvikile no kumwink'ha wana na welekwa wengi. Neeleke watemi mlongo na waidi naho neni mtende si nk'hulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />“Lagano dyangu nedikint'he kwa mwanao Isaka akuunga elekwe ni mkazio Sala lupisi enga ulu mwaka ukwiza.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Mnungu eze ibinde kulonga na Ibulahimu niyo ahalawa.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Mwe dizuwa idiya Ibulahimu amguhaga Ishumaeli mwanawe na wose welekwe mwe nyumba yakwe na wadya watilwe kuguligwa, wagosi wose mwe nyumba yakwe niyo awavinila enga ivo Mnungu amgambile. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ibulahimu avinilagwa umwo andaga na miaka milongo kenda na kenda, <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />mwo lupisi ulo mwanawe Ishumaeli naye andaga na miaka mlongo na mitatu umwo avinilagwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ibulahimu na mwanawe wavinilagwa wose mwe dizuwa iidyo dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Naho kila mgosi mwe nyumba ya Ibulahimu ikanda ni hamwenga na wose welekwe mwe nyumba yakwe hegu watile kuguligwa kwa watakwiza, wose wavinilagwa hamwenga naye.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Sala na Ibulahimu wenk'hwa kawiilo dya mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Zumbe amlailaga Ibulahimu he miti mikulu ya Mamle. Ibulahimu andaga ekale henk'hili ye nk'hambi yakwe umwo kwandile msi ubwikane. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Ibulahimu enulaga meso niyo aona want'hu watatu wakimale. Aaho eze awaone awagulukilaga kugenda kuwa singila. Afunamilaga hasi ne kihanga chakwe kikakima hasi, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />akagamba, “Wamkulu mnaona ni vedi, msekunomboka, miye mtumwa ywenyu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Gojeni niwenk'heni mazi mhake iviga venyu, mwadaha kuhumula hasi yo mti uno. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Neniwenk'heni nk'hande ludodo, neiwenk'heni ludole mdahe kugendeela ne nt'hambo yenyu. Mnitunya kwa kwiza mwe kaya yangu, elo lekeni niwasank'hanileni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Niyo wahitula, “Nivedi, kizumila.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ibulahimu asunguzaga kwingila kwe nk'hambi yakwe no kumgamba Sala, “Sunguza kuguha vihimo vitatu va unga wedi udamanye nk'hande.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Akajika asunguzaga kwiita kwe difyo dye zing'ombe zakwe niyo asagula ndama yedi igimbale, no kumwink'ha mndima asunguze kuichinja na kuyambika. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ibulahimu niyo aguha mabongo na mele na nyama niyo awenk'ha awo want'hu wadye. Umwo wandile wakadya, yehe nakakimala hagihi nao hasi ho mti.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Wadya watakwiza niyo wamuuza Ibulahimu, “Mkaziyo sala ekuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Niyo ahitula, “Ekwe nk'hambi kundani.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Yumwenga ywawe andile kilongozi niyo agamba, “Miezi mnane kukongela ivi haluse, Neni uye kwako, naho mkazio Sala naande na mwana kilume”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala andaga hanyuma yo ulwivi lwe nk'hambi akategeleza. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ibulahimu na mkaziwe wandaga wadalahalise, naivo Sala andaga hakuona mazuwa yakwe ye miezi. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Sala niyo aseka akagamba, “Miye hidalahala, mnumangu naye kadalahala, nenidahe kunda na kinyemi na kupata wana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Zumbe niyo amuuza Ibulahimu, “Nii Sala kaseka niyo agamba, ‘Ivi ni kindedi nadaha kupata mwana no kudalahala kwangu uku?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Ivo kiyuko kint'hu chochose kidala kiku mhuma Mnungu? Ivo nilongile niivo, miezi mnane kukongela ivi haluse neni uye, naho Sala naande na mwana kilume.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Mna Sala kwa kogoha akakanaga kugamba “Hisekile”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Mna Zumbe amgambaga, “Heiye kuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu awalombezela want'hu wa sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Wadya want'hu watatu wahalawaga niyo wabula hant'hu wakudaha kuuona mzi wa Sodoma, Ibulahimu naye aitaga nao akawasindikiza. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Zumbe niyo akelongela mwenye kugamba, “Henimfise Ibulahimu kiya hugenda kudamanya. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Yehe naande Tate ywa want'hu wa isi nk'hulu ina udahi, naho kwa yehe want'hu wa si zose nawavikilwe. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Himsagula vileke awahinize wanawe nawelekwa wakwe, yehe nawahinize kutoza sila zangu wande wedi na kudamanya yakunelela, miye name nidahe kuwakint'hizila kiya nilagane nawo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Ibulahimu, “Yeyuko malongelezo yaihile kwa Sodoma na Gomola, naho wiyuko wavu utendese uko. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ivo neniseele uuko hakaule miye mwenye, uneva malongelezo ayo nivile ni kindedi hegu vihi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Wadya watakwiza waidi wahalawaga no kugendeela kuhinga Sodoma, mna Zumbe asigalaga kakimala na Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ibulahimu niyo ambasa Zumbe no kumuuza, “Ni kindedi nouwakome want'hu heweina wiihi hamwenga na waihi? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Uneva unanda na want'hu milongo mishano mwo mzi uwo heweina wavu. Noubanange umzi uwo wose? Houwalekele awo want'hu kwajili ya awo milongo mishano? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Hangi uneva noutende ivo kuwakoma want'hu awedi hamwenga na waiihile. Want'hu wedi kudamanyilwa enga want'hu waihile. Haikudahika! Msengela mbuli we isi yose haeleke kudamanya ayadei.”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Uneva nna wabwiila want'hu milongo mishano uko Sodoma, heni ubanange umzi uwo kwajili ya awo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Niyo naho Ibulahimu agamba, “Zumbe nionele mbazi kwa kugendeela kulonga na weye, miye ni mnt'hu du, naho hina wedi wa kulonga chochose. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Mna yadahika wakanda uuko want'hu milongo mine na washano kuleka wadya milongo mishano. No uubanange umzi wose kwaviya wahunguka awo washano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Zumbe amhitulaga, “Heniubanange mzi wanada uukwo want'hu milongo mine na shano heweena masa.” <verse eid="GEN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibulahimu niyo amuuza naho, “Mafani kwadaha kunda na want'hu milongo mine du.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Heni ubanange uneva wanada uuko want'hu milongo mine.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibulahimu niyo agamba, “Nakulombeza Zumbe, usekuniihiya, naunga nilonge kaidi. Nevinde vivihi uneva wananda uuko want'hu milongo mitatu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Zumbe niyo agamba, “Heni ubanange uneva wananda uuko want'hu heweina wavu milongo mitatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibulahimu niyo agamba, “Zumbe unifile mbazi kwaviya higendeela kulonga na weye. Togola wananda uuko milongo miidi du?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Nnawaona heweina wavu milongo miidi mwo mzi uwo, heniubanange.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ibulahimu niyo agamba, “Usekunda na maya Zumbe, nenilonge, uulu du. Togola wananda uuko want'hu mlongo du heweina wavu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Niyo Zumbe agamba, “Heniubanange umzi uneva wananda uuko want'hu mlongo heweina wavu.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Zumbe eze ibinde kulonga na Ibulahimu niyo akeitila, Ibulahimu naye auyaga kaya.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Wavu utendese wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Kisingi kiya wadya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu waidi weze wabule Sodoma, Lutu andaga kekala he nk'hili yo mzi. Aaho eze awaone, enukaga no kugenda kuwa hokela. Afunamaga hasi <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />niyo agamba, “Wakulu miye ni mndima ywenyu. Mwize kwe nyumba yangu. Hakeni mazi mwe viga mkehumuze ikilo iki aha. Kukacha no mwinuke kilokilo no kugendeela ne nt'hambo yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Mna woho wahitulaga, “Bule nekikale aha ho lwazo kilo chose.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Mna Lutu awahembelesaga, niyo wazumila kwingilanya nawo kwe nyumba yakwe. Awadamanyilaga nk'hande no kuwokela mikate heigeligwe ugwadu niyo wadya.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Mna wadya watakwiza umwo wandile wakei kugona, wagosi wa Sodoma, waizungulukaga inyumba. Wagosi wose wo mzi, wabwanga na wadala wandaga aaho. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Wamwitangaga Lutu kuse na kumuuza, “Wekuhi wadya want'hu wezile kwako kilo iki? Walete kwetu vileke kigende nawo!”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu awabasaga uko kuse niyo avugala ulwivi kwa kunyuma. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Niyo Lutu agamba, “Wambuya zangu mse kudamanya wavu enga uno! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Kauleni nnanao wana kike waidi wali na mazanga. Gojeni niwenk'heni aawo, mwadaha kuwatenda viya mkuunga. Mna awa want'hu mse kuwatenda dyodyose, ni watakwiza mwe nyumba yangu, naungwa niwaamile.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Mna niyo wagamba, “Halawe aha, weye umgeni! Weye niwe ani niho ukipangile dyo kudamanya? Halawe aha, nekikutende vihise kujink'ha woho.” Niyo wamsukumizila Lutu kunyuma no kuusogeela ulwivi vileke wauvune. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Mna wadya want'hu waidi wafosaga kuse niyo wamvuta Lutu kwe nyumba no kuvugala ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Niyo wawatowa wadya want'hu wendile kuse kwa unt'hunt'hu vitendile wasekudaha kuluona ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu ahalawa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Wadya watakwiza waidi niyo wamgamba Lutu, “Una yeyose aha, ikanda ni wanao wa kilume hegu wakike hegu wakwezo hegu nduguyo yeyose akwikala mwo mzi uno? Walave aha, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />kwaviya Zumbe keva malongelezo yaihise mwa want'hu awa, naivo kakigala suwe kize kiubanage mzi uno wa Sodoma.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Niyo Lutu agenda kuwagambila wadya waungaga wawalombe wanawe no kuwagamba, “Sunguzeni mfose aha, Zumbe aunga ahabanange.” Mna wakweze wamuonaga enga mnt'hu akutanila.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Kwize kutandazuke wadya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wamtigizaga Lutu asunguze, Wakamgamba, “Sunguza! Mguhe mkaziyo, na wanawo waidi we kike mhalawe, mnase kwaza ugima wenyu umwo umzi ukabanagwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu andaga na nk'hangamizi, mna Mnungu amuonelaga mbazi, ivo wadya want'hu waidi wawatozaga Lutu na mkaziwe na wadya wanawe we kike waidi no kuwalava kuse yo mzi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Weze wande wamlava kuse yumwenga mwa wadya watumigwa waidi wa kwe mbingu niyo agamba, “Nyiliseni ugima wenyu! Mse kusinya kunyuma naho mse kukimala hohose he dikolongo. Nyilikileni kwo lugulu vileke mse kukomwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Mna Lutu niyo agamba, “Bule, zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Kindedi kunidamanyila uwedi mkulu na kuuhonya ugima wangu. Mna vigulu vitendesa uhale, ubanangi nounibwiile, name nenibanike nikei mpaka kudya. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Kauleni aha hana mzi mdodo woho wi hagihi vitendese miye ninyilikile uukwo. Hamwenga na kugamba waoneka mdodo vitendese mna miye nenikehonyele ugima wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Niyo ahitula, “Nivedi, Hikuzumila ayo ulongile. Heniubanange umzi udya ulongile. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Mna Kombeka! Henitende dyodyose mpaka aho noubule uko.” Nivo vikuleka mzi uwo wetangagwa Zoali. Zoali nuko kugamba mzi mdodo.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola yabanangwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Zuwa dyandaga ditont'homoke umwo Lutu abulaga Zoali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Niyo Zumbe akimp'hula moto wa chola kulawa kwe mbingu kwa Zumbe mwe mizi ya Sodoma na Gomola, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />niyo abananga mizi iyo ne dikolongo dyose hamwenga na want'hu wose na kila kint'hu kikuile mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Mna mkaza Lutu uyo andaga kunyuma ya mgosiwe, ahitukaga kunyuma niyo ahituka sugulu ya munyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Mtondo Ibulahimu aitaga hadya hant'hu akimalaga hameso ha Zumbe, <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Akaulaga mwondwaisi uko Gomola na Sodoma, ne dikolongo dyose, niyo aona mosi ukufunk'ha mwe isi enga mosi wa moto mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Mna umwo Mnungu aibanangaga imizi ya mwe dokolongo, amkumbukilaga Ibulahimu kwa mlava Lutu mwe mizi iyo vileke ase kubanagwa pele hamwenga nayo.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chotoko cha Wamoabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu ogohaga kwikala Zoali ivo niyo asama mzi uwo yehe hamwenga na wanawe waidi we kivele, niyo wagenda kwikala kwe mp'hanga ukwo kwo vigulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Wakanda ukwo zuwa dimwenga mwana mkulu niyo amgamba mvunawe, “Haluse tate kadalahala, naho hahali mgosi yeyose mwe isi yose akuunga akilombe suwe enga ivo vili kwa want'hu wose vileke kipate wana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Elo, nekimnywese tate divai nk'hali vileke kigone naye kimwiikile”. <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Wamwink'haga divai nk'hali ikilo ikiya niyo akolwa, aho yudya umkulu agonaga na ise, mna ise akolesagwa ivo valekaga asekumanya kint'hu.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Zuwa ditimile yudya mkulu niyo amgamba nduguye, “Kilo kiya miye higona na tate, nekimnywese divai nk'hali akolwe vileke ukagone naye. Niho nekinde na cheleko na tati yetu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ivo kilo icho naho niyo wamtenda akolwe, yudya mdodo niyo akugona na ise. Aho iviya iviya andaga hamanyize kint'hu kwaviya andaga kakolwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Kwa ivi wana kike wa Lutu wose waidi wapataga ubovu kulawa mwa tati yawe. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Yudya mwana umkulu ywe kike elekaga mwana kilume, niyo amwink'ha zina niye Moabu, niye umkale ywa Wamoabu hata dielo. Kwa Kiibulania, Moabu nuko kugamba “Kulawa kwa tate”. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Yudya mwanakike umdodo naye niyo eleka mwana kilume, amwink'haga zina niye Ben Ami. Uyo niye mkale ywa Waamoni hata dielo. Kwa Kiibulania, Ben Ami nuko kugamba “Mwana kilume kulawa kwetu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu na Abimaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ibulahimu asamaga kulawa aho kuhinga nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi ya Kanani, niyo akwikala hagati ya Kadeshi na Shuli. Akajika niyo agenda kwikala kwa lupisi luguhi ukwo Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ibulahimu awagambaga kugamba Sala andaga lumbudye. Ivo seuta Abimaleki ywa Gelali amguhaga Sala ande mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Mna Mnungu amlailaga Abimaleki nekilo mwe zi sozi niyo amgamba, “Weye noubanike kwaviya kumguha mvele uyo, uyo mkaza mnt'hu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Mna Abimaleki miye hinati nigone naye, niyo agamba, “Zumbe miye hina lema! Waunga unikome hamwenga na want'hu wangu? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ibulahimu mwenye niye agambile uyu ni lumbudye, uyo mvele naye niyo alonga aayo. Hidamanya ayo hamanya kugamba hina lema.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Umwo mwe zint'hogo Mnungu niyo amhitula, “Heiye, himanya kudamanya idyo hiyo kwa wiihi, ivo hikutenda usekunitendela wavu na yehe, naho hikulekile ugone naye. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Haluse elo mvuze uyo mvele kwa mgosiwe. Uyo yehe ni mlotezi ywa Mnungu, naivo naa kulombezele kwa Mnungu, vileke use kubanika. Mna huna mvuzile kwa mwenye, nakugambila kugamba noubanike weye na want'hu wako.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Mtootondo Abimaleki enukaga kukei mtondo no kwitanga vilongozi we hasi yakwe no kuwagambila kiya kilaile, nawo niyo wogohesa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Abimaleki amwitangaga Ibulahimu no kumuuza, “Kukitenda vivihi? Hiku banangai hata ukigaile wavu mkulu kwa miye no useuta wangu? Hahali mnt'hu naakadaha kudamanya enga ivo unidamanyile. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Naho Abimeleki niyo agendeela kuuza nii uka vitenda ivi?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibulahimu niyo ahitula, “Nehifanyanya ivo kugamba hahali yeyose aha akumogoha Mnungu, naivo hegu nawanikoma vileke wamguhe mkazangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Hamwenga na ayo ikindedi uyu lumbu dyangu mwana tate, mna hiye mami yetu yumwenga mna miye himlomba. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Naivo Mnungu eze anigambe nihalawe he kaya ya tate no kuita kwe isi za kwe samo, namgambaga alagise ivo akunitegeleza, naho kugamba hohose nekiite uwagambe want'hu kugamba, miye ni mkuluo.”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimaleki niyo amvuza Sala kwa mgosiwe, iviyaiviya naho niyo amwink'ha na ngoto na ng'ombe na watumwa wa kilume na wa kike. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Amgambaga Ibulahimu, “Ino yose isi yangu, ikala hohose hadya ukuunga.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Niyo naho amgamba Sala, “Namwink'ha lumbudyo matundu milongo gana, kulagisa kwa wose mnanawo kugamba nyuwe hamna lema, kila yumwenga naamanye kugamba hamna icho mbanange.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Kwa yadya yalaile kwa sala mkaziwe dya Ibulahimu, Mnungu niyo atenda vinde vidala kwa mvele yeyose mwe nyumba ya Abimaleki kweleka wana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Ibulahimu amlombezelaga kwa Mnungu, Mnungu niyo amhonya yehe na mkaziwe na watumwa wakwe we kivele, naivo wadahaga kweleka wana.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Ukwelekwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Niyo Mnungu amvika Sala enga viya amwiikilaga Ndagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Ivo Ibulahimu umwo andaga mdala, Sala enulaga ubovu no kumweleka mwana kilume. Mbwanga uyo elekagwa mwo lupisi uludya alongaga Mnungu kugamba neelekwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibulahimu amwink'haga uyo mwana zina niye Isaka, <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />naho Ibulahimu amvinilaga Isaaka, umwo eze abule mazuwa mnane enga viya Mnungu asigiile. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Umwo Isaka akelekwa Ibulahimu andaga na miaka gana. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sala niyo agamba, “Mnungu kanink'ha kinyemi na luseko. Yeyose akuunga eve imbuli iyo naaseke hamwenga na miye.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Niyo ongeza kugamba, “Niani agambile Sala hegu nakamwelekela Ibulahimu mwana? Mna himwelekela mwana kilume mwo udala wangu uno.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka niyo agendeela kukula, niyo mwe dizuwa alekelaga ukonk'ha, Ibulahimu amtendelaga wila wa kinyemi.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hajili na Isumaeli waguluswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Zuwa diwenga Sala amuonaga Isaka akaseziga na Ishumaeli mwana Hajili Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ivo Sala niyo amgambila Ibulahimu, “Mguluse mtumwa uyo na mwanawe. Mwana ywao mvele uyo hana ukipe wowose mwo ukipe wa mwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Mbuli ino neimgelesa kinyulu Ibulahimu kwaviya Ishumaeli naye andaga mwanawe.<verse eid="GEN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Mna Mnungu niyo amgamba Ibulahimu, “Usekunda na kinyulu mwa uyo mwana uyu hegu mtumwa ywako ywe kike mna damanya enga ivo Sala mkaziwo alongile. Ikindedi welekwa wako nawalawe kombokela kwa Isaka enga ivo nilagane. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Naho kwa mbuli yo mwana uyo ywo mtumwa ywako nenimtende kunda na want'hu wengi kwaviya yehe naye ni mwanao.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Mtondo wakwe, Ibulahimu amwink'haga Hajili nk'hande na kazembe kamemile mazi. Niyo amwelesa umwana kwo mgongo, niyo amgamba ita. Hajili ahalawaga niyo anda aka twangadika no mwana uko kwe nyika ya Belisheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Mazi yeze yasile mwa kazembe, Hajili amwikaga umwana he nk'holo yo mti, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />niyo yehe ekala hasi, uhale wa nk'hacho gana. Akelongelaga mwenye kugamba, “Henidahe kifinyiliza hakaula mwanangu ivo akubanika.” Umwo andile kekala hadya, niyo akonga kuilisa.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mnungu amwivaga umwana akaila, niyo uko kwe mbingu mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu amuuza Hajili, “Una sungu sungu dyani? Usekogoha. Mnungu kamwiva uyo mwana akaila ukwo eli. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Inuka, ita kamwinule umhembeleze, kwaviya nenimtende si nk'hulu, kulawa mwa welekwa wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Mnungu niyo amgubula meso Hajili, aonaga sima dina mazi.Ivo agenda kuteka mazi mwe kazembe niyo amnywesa umwana. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Mnungu andaga na uyo umwana mwo kukula kwakwe, yehe ekalaga kwe nyika akanda mkala mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Nekekala kwe dijangwa dya Palani, nine niyo amzunguila mvele ywa Kimisili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya Ibulahimu na Abimaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Lupisi ulo Abimaleki hamwenga na Pikoli endile mkulu ywe difyo dyakwe dya watoani, waitaga kwa Ibulahimu na kumgamba, “Mnungu ehamwenga na weye kwa kila kiya ukudamanya. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ivo uike kilapi aha kugamba hounidant'hilize miye hegu wanangu hegu welekwa wangu. Miye ni mkindedi kwako, weye nawe uniikile Ndagano kugamba nounde mkindedi kwangu na kwe isi ino ukwikala.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibulahimu niyo amhitula, “Naika kilapi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Niyo Ibulahimu amkalaliza Abimaleki mwe mbuli ye disima diya watumwa wa Abimaleki watahaga. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimaleki niyo agamba, “Himmanyize uyo adamanye ayo. Hunigambile imbuli iyo, naivo nivo bosi naiva.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Akajika aho Ibulahimu niyo aguha ngoto na ng'ombe no kumwink'ha Abimaleki na want'hu awo waidi niyo waika lagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ibulahimu niyo apagula ngoto za kivele mfungate mwe difyo dyakwe, <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />niyo Abimaleki amuuza Ibulahimu, “Nii ukatenda ivo?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ibulahimu niyo agamba, “Zumila imyate ino ye zingoto mfungate. Kwa kudamanya ivi wanda muwona kugamba ni miye nisimbile disima idi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Naivo hant'hu aho niyo hetangwa Belisheba. Kwa kiibulania Nuko kugamba, “Sima dya kilapi.” Kwaviya aho naho awo waidi waikilaga kilapi.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Weze wajike kuika Indagano iyo aho Belisheba, Abimaleki na Pikoli wauyaga kwe isi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibulahimu ahandaga mkwazu uko Belisheba niyo amvika Zumbe, Mnungu ywa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ibulahimu ekalaga kwa wafilisiti kwa lupisi lutali.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu amlava mwanawe kunda nt'hambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Akajika aho, mwo lupisi lumwenga Mnungu amgezaga Ibulahimu, amwitangaga, “Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Niyo Ibulahimu etika, “Woe!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Mguhe mwanao,” “uyudya umwanao Isaka heena miyawe ukumuungisa, wiite kwe isi ya Molia. Kwe milima huunga hulagise, ukamlave kunda nt'hambiko.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Mtootondo utimile, Ibulahimu akant'haga nk'huni zo kokela malavo, niyo apakiya mwe mp'hunda yakwe, niyo amguha Isaka hamwenga na watumwa wakwe waidi. Wakongaga int'hambo kuita kudya agambilwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu Ibulahimu auonaga mnima kwa hale. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Niyo awagamba wadya watumwa, “Ikaleni aha ne dipunda. Miye no mbwanga kigendeele mpaka hadya kikavike, akajika chauya.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ibulahimu amtwikaga Isaka zink'huni zo kokela malavo, yehe mwenye aguhaga ngola no moto. Umwo wandile wakaitanya, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka niyo amuuza ise, “Tate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ibulahimu niyo etika, “Woe mwanagu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka niyo amuuza ise, “Naona kugamba umoto ne zink'huni kinanazo, haluse ingoto ye nt'hambiko iihi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibulahimu niyo amhitula mwanawe, “Mnungu mwenye naamanye uko neilawe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Weze wabule hadya Ibulahimu agambilwe ni Mnungu, Ibulahimu adamanyaga kilingo cha kutambikila, niyo apanga zink'huni mnanga. Niyo amgwila mwanawe niyo amkakiliza, no kumtambalika mnanga mwe zink'huni aho he kilingo cho kutambikila. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Niyo aguha ingola yakwe amchinje mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Mna mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo amwitanga, “Ibulahimu, Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ibulahimu niyo etika, “Woe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Niyo amgamba, “Use kumkoma mwanao naho use kumtenda dyodyose.” “Haluse himanya kugamba wamtegeleza Mnungu naho wamwogoha kwaviya hulemele kunilavila mwanawo heena miyawe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ibulahimu niyo enula meso no kuwona ngoto ikegwiile mahembe yakwe mwa kasaka. Agendaga kuiguha niyo ailava yoho kunda nt'hambiko yo koka hant'hu ha mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ibulahimu ahenk'haga zina hant'hu aho, “Zumbe enk'hiza.” Naho hata ivi dielo want'hu wagamba, “Kwo mnima Mnungu kalava.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Mnungu uko kulanga amwitangaga kaidi Ibulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />Mnungu kagamba, “Nakelisa kwa zina dyangu mwenye kugamba hunilemeele kunilavila mwanao, mwanawo heena miyawe, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />ikindedi nohuvilkile na kuwatenda welekwa wako wande wengi enga nt'hondo za kwe mbingu naho enga msanga wa mp'hani. Welekwa wako nawaikaile mizi ya wank'hondo wawe. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Naho kombokela kwa weye want'hu wa si zose nawavikilwe kwaviya weye kunitegeleza.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ibulahimu awauiiyaga watumwa wakwe, no kuuyanya nawo Belisheba uko ekalaga.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Yakajika ayo, Ibulahimu abunk'hulaga kugamba Milika elekaga wana kilume mnane, kwa nduguye Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo etangagwa Uzi, nduguye amtimile etangangwa Buzi na kutimilwa ni Kemueli ise dya Asilia, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesidi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafi na Betueli, <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />ise dya Labeka. Milika amwelekelaga Naholi nduguye dya Ibulahimu awo wana kilume mnane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Hamwenga na ayo, Luma muwele ywa Naholi naho amwelekaga Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Ukubanika kwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sala ekalaga na kubuza miaka gana na milongo miidi na mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Abanikilagwa uko Kiliti Aba, Hebuloni mwe isi ya Kanani. Ibulahimu niyo ahongeza ifile ya mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Alekaga ikimba cha mkaziwe niyo awabasa Wahiti, no kuwagamba, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Miye ni mgeni hwikala aaha na nyuwe, nitagileni hant'hu ni mmose mkazangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Niyo wamhitula, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Kitegeleze, mkulu. Weye ywi mnt'hu mkulu vitendese aha hetu, mmose mkaziyo, hohoose hadya no usagule. Hahali mnt'hu yeyose mwa suwe naakunyime ho kummosela msanga mkaziyo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Ibulahimu niyo awafunamila, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />no kugamba, “Uneva mnizumila ni mmose mkazangu aha, nilombezeleni kwa Efuloni mwana ywa Zoali <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />anitagile hant'hu ha Makepela, idya ikolumbili lwo nk'honde wakwe. Nilombezeleni anitagile hant'hu he vikuta va kuwamosela msanga want'hu wangu. Mgambeni anitagile kwa yombe dikint'hile aha hameso yenyu.” <verse eid="GEN 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuloni mwenye andaga aaho kekala na Wahiti aho hant'hu he midugano he nk'hili yo mzi, ahitulaga wose wakategeleza, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Tegeleza, mkulu, nohwink'he nk'honde wose na ho kummosela msanga mkaziwo. No hwink'hile ha meso ha want'hu wangu, udahe kummoselaa msanga mkaziyo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ibulahimu niyo afunama kwa kweseleza naho kwa Wahiti <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />niyo amgamba Efuloni, want'hu wose wakategeleza, “Nawalombezani, mnitegeleze. Nenigule nk'honde wose. Hokela maliho yangu, nenimmose msanga mkazangu aho.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuloni niyo ahitula, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Mkulu, diyombe dyo nk'honde ni matundu magana mane du. Icho ni kint'hu chani mwa suwe? Mmose msanga mkaziyo uumo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibulahimu azumilaga niyo ahima kihimo cha matundu icho Afuloni awatambulaga Wahiti wakamwiva, kugamba ni matundu magana milongo mine, viligane ne vihimo vo lupisi ulo.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ivo nivo vandile hata unk'honde uwo wandaga wa Efuloni uko Makipela, ulailo wa zuwa wa Mamle unda wa Ibulahimu. Imp'hanga yandile umo ne miti yose mwo mgunda, mpaka kwo uheelo wo mgunda, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />neimanyika kwa Wahiti wose wandile aaho, kugamba Ibulahimu niye mta hant'hu aho.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Yeze yajike ayo, Ibulahimu ammoselaga msanga mkaziwe Sala kwe mp'hanga, mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Ivo umgunda ne mp'hanga vandaga uumwo venk'hizagwa kwa Ibulahimuwa vinde vakwe na welekwa wakwe hande hant'hu ha kumosela msanga.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Mkaza Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ibulahimu adalahalisaga, naho Mnungu amvikilaga kwa kila kint'hu kiya adamanyaga. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Zuwa dimwenga amgambaga mtumwa ywakwe uyo andaga mnyamp'hala mkulu mwe vint'hu vose andaga navo Ibulahimu, “Geleka umkono wako hasi ya mawambo yangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Nakuunga uike kilapi kwa zina dya Mnungu, ywa kwe mbingu na we isi, kugamba homloze mwanangu ywe kilume kwa want'hu awa aha Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nowiite kudya kwe isi idya nelekwe niyo wamzunguila mvele mwanagu Isaka uko kwa wandugu zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Yudya mtumwa niyo auza, “Nevinde vivihi uneva uyo mvele analemela kwiza kwikala uku na miye? Neni mlekele mwanao aite akekale uko walawaga?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Niyo Ibulahimu ahitula, “Bule usekugeza kumvuza mwanangu kudya! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Zumbe, Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu, uyo anilavaga kwe isi ya tate na wandugu zangu, niyo akelapiza kwangu kugamba naawenk'he welekwa wangu ino isi. Uyo Mnungu naamtume mtumigwa ywakwe akulongoele vileke ukapate mvele ywo kumloza mwanangu ukwo. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Uneva uyo mvele haaunge mwizanye, nounde kulekelwa mwe kilapi changu. Mna usekugeza kumvuza mwanagu uko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ivo niyo yudya mtumwa aika umkono wakwe hagati ha mawambo ya Ibulahimu, mkulu ywakwe, no kuika kilapi kugamba naadamanye ayo agambilwe ni Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Umtumwa uyo andaga niye mnyamp'hala mkulu we vint'hu va Ibulahimu, aguhaga ngamia mlongo ya mkulu wakwe niyo aita komzi naakekala Naholi, mwe isi ya Mesopotamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Eze abule azitendaga zingamia zifike madi he disima kuse yo mzi. Yandaga kisingi lupisi lwa wavele kugenda kuteka mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Niyo alombeza, “ We Zumbe, Mnungu ywa zumbe dyangu Ibulahimu unink'he uhumi dielo naho umkumbukile zumbe ywangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Kaula! Miye hikimala hagihi nedisima aha, naho wavele wo mzi naweze wateke mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Elo! Neinde ivi, yudya mndele huunga nimgambe ketule biga dyako niywe mazi, naye niyo ahitula, ‘nywa naho nenizinywese zingamia zako.’ Vinde uyu nie mvele umsaguile mndima ywako Isaka. Kwaivo inanda ivo, nenimanye kugamba kumdamanyila wedi mkulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Umwo andile akei kubinda kulonga, ivo Labeka mwana Betueli, mwana Milka mkaziwe dya Naholi nduguye dya Ibulahimu ezaga aketwikile dibiga dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Andaga mndele ahombweele ukamsinya, mwali na mazanga. Engilaga kwe disima niyo ateka mazi mwe dibiga dyakwe no kufosa kuse. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Yudya mndima asunguzaga kumbwiila niyo amgamba, “Nalombeza unink'he mazi ya mwe dibiga dyako ninywe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Niyo amgamba, “Haya nywa mkulu.” Niyo asunguza kuketula na kumtozela vileke anywe. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Eze ibinde ukunywa amgambaga, “Iviaivia neni zinywese zingamia zako mpaka zigute.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Asunguzaga kuzigidila mazi zingamia yandaga mwe dibiga umwo mwo luhondo lwo kunywesela naho niyo aguluka kugenda kuguha matuhu. Azinywesaga zingamia zakwe zose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Yudya mnt'hu andaga akamkaula yudya mndele kwa hagihi haheina kulonga dyodyose akafanyanya kugamba mafani Zumbe kautenda utafi wakwe kunda wedi.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamia zize zibinde ukunywa, yudya mnt'hu aguhaga kipini cha zahabu cha yombe kulu niyo amwink'ha bangili nk'hulu za yombe kulu za zahabu no kumvika mwe mikono yakwe, <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />niyo agamba, “Hake nigambile, iso ni ani. Miye na want'hu wangu nekipate hant'hu ho kugona kwenyu nekilo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Labeka niyo agamba, “ Miye ni mwana Basueli elekwe na Naholi kwa mkazewe Milika.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Ongezelaga akagamba, “Kwetu kaya yeyuko mani yo kuzink'ha zingamia zako naho heaho hant'hu ukudaha kuhumula.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo afika madi no mkumvika Zumbe.<verse eid="GEN 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Niyo agamba, “Atogolwe Zumbe, Mnungu ywa mkulu Ibulahimu hejaile kiya alagane na mkulu. Zumbe kanilongoza mpaka kwa wanduguze dya mkulu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Yudya mndele agulukaga mpaka kwa wanduguze dya nine no kuwagambila mbuli zose. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Labeka andaga na lumbudye etangagwa Labani agulukaga kuse kuita kwe disima ukwo wandaga uukwo wandima wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Umwo andile akei kuita, Labani aonaga kipini cha mwe mp'hula ne zibangili zandaga mwe mikono ya lumbudye, na ivo evaga lumbudye Labeka andaga akalonga, ayo agambilwe ni uyo mnt'hu. Aitaga kwa mndima ywa Ibulahimu andaga kakimala hagihi ne zingamia zawe kwe disima, <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />niyo awagamba, “So kaya weye uvikilwe ni Zumbe, nii mkimaila kuse name hiwaikilani lumwe ugono we zingamia zenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Niyo yudya mgeni eza kwe nyumba ya Labani naye azitulaga zingamia imizigo niyo azink'ha mani ya kudya, niyo wadya want'hu andile nawo awenk'ha mazi ya kuhaka hamwenga na yehe mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Amtengelaga nk'hande mna niyo agamba, “Henidye nk'hande mpaka ninde kulonga kiya kinigale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani niyo amgamba, “Haya longa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Akongaga kulonga akagamba, “Miye ni mndima ywa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Zumbe kamvikilisa mkulu niyo amtenda mgoli. Kamwink'ha mafyo ya ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na vint'hu vidamanywe kwa maiwe ya yombe kulu na zahabu na watumwa wagosi na wavele na ngamia na mp'hunda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sala uyo mkaziwe dya mkulu, apataga mwana kilume mwo udala wakwe, mkulu ywangu kamwink'ha mwana uyo kila kint'hu kunda chakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Mkulu ywangu kanigambila miye kwa kilapi nidamanye kiya alongile. Agambaga, usekumsaguila mwanagu mvele kulawa kwa wandele wa Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Vituhu vakwe wiite kwe isi yangu want'hu wa kwetu ukamsaguile mwanangu mvele. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Naho nehi muuza mkulu, nevinde vihi uneva hinezile naye? <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Amhitulaga kugamba, Zumbe akunilongoza kila zuwa naakwink'he mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu mndanye, niyo naikint'hize int'hambo yako. Noumpatile mwanangu mvele kulawa kwa want'hu wangu naho kulawa kwe mp'huga ya tate. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Uneva unaita kwa want'hu wangu niyo waleka kukwink'ha uyo mndele, weye nounde mlekelwa mwe kilapi chako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Dielo nizenize kwe disima niyo nalombeza hagamba, ‘Zumbe, Mnungu ywa mkulu Ibulahimu nakulombeza ukint'hize mwa iki hudamanya. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Hikimala aha he disima. Neeze mndele ateke mazi nimgambe, nalombeza mazi ninywe kulawa mwe dibiga dyako. <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Anazumila kunink'ha mazi, niyo azink'ha mazi zingamia zangu, uuyo naande niye mvele umsagule kunda mke mwana ywo mkulu ywangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Umwo nandile nikei kubinda kulonga ivo mwo moyo wangu, Labeka ezaga ahagate dibiga dyakwe mwa mayega niyo aseela kwe disima ateke mazi. Niyo namgamba, Nalombeza mazi ninywe. <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Niyo asunguza kuketula dibiga dyakwe niyo kugamba, Nywa naho neni zinywese zingamia zako. Naywaga niyo azinywesa ne zingamia zangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Naho namuuzaga, iso niani? Naho ahitulaga, miye mwana Bethueli mwana Naholi na Milika. Niyo namvala kiswaufu cha zahabu na bangili mwo mkono. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Nafikaga madi hamvika Zumbe na kumtogola Mnungu ywo mkulu dyangu Ibulahimu anilongoze vedi kwa mndele mwana ywo lukolo ywa wandugu wa zumbe dyangu kwajili ya mwanawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Naivo nigambileni, uneva nomumtendele mkulu ywangu kwa wedi na uhuwilwa hegu bule nigambileni nimanye cho kudamanya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani na Besueli niyo wahitula, “Kwaviya mbuli ino ilawa kwa Zumbe, suwe dyokulonga hadihali. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Mguhe uyo Labeka, uite naye naho akande mkaza mkulu ywako enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu alongile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Yudya mndima ywa Ibulahimu eze eve ivo, afikaga madi no amvika Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Yudya mndima alavaga vint'hu va masawa na va zahabu na suke niyo amwink'ha Labeka. Iviyaiviya amwink'haga mageleko ya yombe kulu lumbudye na nine dya Labeka.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Niho yehe hamwenga na want'hu wandaga aho wadya na kunywa. Ize ibule mtondo yudya mndima agambaga, “Gojeni niuye kwa mkulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Mna wanduguze dya Labeka na mami yawe wagambaga, “Mndele ande kwikala nawo kwa mazuwa heye kuhunguka mlongo, akajika naaite.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Mna niyo agamba, “Mse kunizulusa kwaviya Zumbe kaitenda int'hambo yangu kunda ya uhumi nilekeleni niuye kwa mkulu ywangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Niyo wamgamba, “Goja kimwitange, kimtegeleze mwenye.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ivo wamwitanga Labeka niyo wamuuza “Togola waunga wiite na mnt'hu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Yehe niyo ahitula, “Heiye.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ivo wamzumilaga Labeka aite hamwenga na mnyamp'hala ywa Ibulahimu na want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Niyo wamvikila Labeka wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Weye lumbu dyetu, unde mwelesi dya wana wengi heweina mnt'hu hakudaha kuwawaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Welekwa wako wawahume wank'hondo wao!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Niyo Labeka na wandima wakwe we kivele wakwela mwe zingamia no kuitanya na yudya mndima ywa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Mwo lupisi ulo Isaka ahalawaga Beer Lahai Loi niyo ekala uko Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Kisingi kimwenga Isaka atalamkaga kwe nk'honde vileke ande ekedu na kufanyanya, niyo aona kweza ngamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Labeka eze amuone aseelaga hasi kulawa mwe ngamia, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />niyo wamuuza mndima ywa Ibulahimu “Yudya akugenda mwe nk'honde akwiza kukisingila ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Yudya mndima niyo amhitula, “Ni mkulu ywangu.” Niyo Labeka aguha suke no kugubika uso wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Wudya wandima wamgambilaga Isaka yose yadya wadamanyaga. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Isaka amwigalaga Labeka kwe dihema idyo nine Sala andaga akekala. Amguhaga Labeka niyo anda niye mkaziwe. Isaka amuungisaga Labeka naivo aonaga utondowazi kwaviya nine abanikaga.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa watuhu wa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibulahimu alombaga mvele mtuhu etangagwa Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula amwelekelaga wana, mazina yawe ni Zimlani na Jokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Jokishani niye aweleke Sheba na Dedani na Waashulu na Waletushi na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Mazina ya wana Midiani wandaga ni, Epa na Epeli na Hano na Abida na Elida. Woseni awa nawo welekwa wa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibulahimu niyo amwink'ha Isaka kila kint'hu andaga nacho, <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />mna umwo andaga akei mgima, awenk'haga nt'hunyo wadya wana elekelwe ni wavele wakwe watuhu, niyo awegala kwe isi ya ulailo wa zuwa, hale na kudya eli mwanawe Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubanika no kumoswa msanga kwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibulahimu abanikaga akanda ni mdala ywa miaka gana na milongo mfungate na mishano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Ibulahimu akant'haga umuye wakwe akanda kadalahala vedi, magutwi yakwe yandaga magima, niyo akelunga na wakale wakwe wamlogoele. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Awanawe, Isaka na Ishumaeli, wammoselaga msanga tatiyawe uko kwe mp'hanga ya Makipela, imwe nk'honde ya Mamle, iyo yandaga ya Epuloni mwana Zohali Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />idya inkonde Ibulahimu agulaga kwa Wahiti. Ibulahimu na mkaziwe wamoselagwa msanga aaho. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Ibulahimu eze abanike, Mnungu amvikilaga Isaka mwanawe, uyo andaga akekala hagihi ne Beeli Lahai Loi. Kiibulania nuko kugamba “Disima dya mta ugima Akuliona.”<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Ishumaeli mwana ywa Ibulahimu amweleke kwa Hajili Mmisili, andaga mtumwa ywa Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Elekaga wana kilume awa viligane no ludongo ivo welekwe, Nebaioti na Kedali na Adibeeli na Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi na Tema na Jetuli na Nafishi na Kedama. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Awa wandaga wana wa Ishumaeli na aya nayo mazina ya vilongozi we mp'huga mlongo na mbili kutimila na aho nawekala na mazina yawe. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishumaeli abanikaga akanda na miaka gana na milongo mitatu na mfungate niyo akelunganya na wakale wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Welekwa wa Ishumili wekalaga hagati gati ya isi ya Havila na Asilia, kwe nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Misili, kuhinga Asilia. Wekalaga hale na welekwa watuhu wa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekwa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Na ivi nivo vyeleko va Isaka mwana ywa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka eze abule miaka mlongo mine amlombaga Labeka mwana wa Betueli, Mshami ywa Mesopotamia, naho ni lumbudye dya Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Labeka andaga mgumba, naivo Isaka amlombezaga Zumbe kwajili ya mkaziwe. Zumbe naye niyo amhitula, Labeka niyo enula ubovu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Ubovu uwo wandaga wa mapasa, mna umwo wandaga wakei kwelekwa, wandaga wakahigana kwe zinda za mami yawe. Labeka niyo agamba, “Ni mbuli ino ikanilaila?” Ivo niyo agenda kumuuza Zumbe.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Si mbili zimndani mwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Want'hun waidi kulawa mwe nda yako hawaivane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Yumwenga naande na ludole kumjink'ha miyawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Umkulu naande mtumwa kwo mdodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Mazuwa yakwe yo kweleka yeze yande hagihi, andaga na mapasa mwe zinda zakwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Ywa nk'hongo andaga mnk'hundu, naho mwili wakwe wandaga enga suke ya mazoya, niyo wamwimnk'ha zina niye Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Lupisi ludodo, nduguye naye niyo elekwa umkono wakwe ukanda umtoza Esau kisinyagilo. Ek'hagwa zina niye Yakobo. Isaka andaga na miaka milongo mtandatu umwo Labeka akaweleka awo mapasa.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ataga uwagilwa wakwe wa nk'hongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Wana awo niyo wakula, Esau andaga mkala mkulu, mnt'hu ywa kutanga, mna Yakobo andaga mnt'hu mp'halahole ywa kwikala kwe kaya. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaka amuunisaga Esau kwaviya naakambweda kudya ukala wa mwanawe, mna Labeka amuungagisaga Yokobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Zuwa dimwenga Yakobo andaga akambika nk'hunde, Esau ezaga akalawa kwo ukala, andilisaga na sala.<verse eid="GEN 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Nink'he nk'hade iyo ink'hundu nidye, kwaviya nazehuka!” Nivo vilekile aketangwa Edomu. Kwa kiibulania, Edomu, nuko kugamba “ink'hundu”.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo niyo amhitula, “Yanda kunitagila uwagilwa wo welekwa wako wa nk'hongo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau niyo agamba, “Nihagihi no kubanika, uwagilwa wo welekwa wangu wa nk'hogo wanambizai?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo niyo amgamba, “Unde kuniikila kilapi kugamba nounink'he uwagilwa wo welekwa wako wa nk'hongo.” Ivo Esau niyo aika kilapi kwa Yakobo akamtagila uwagilwa wakwe wo welekwa wa nk'hongo. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ivo Yakobo amwink'haga Esau mkate ne ditibwa dye zink'hunde. Ivo Esau adyaga na kunywa mazi, niyoahalawaa. Ivo Esau auonaga uwagilwa wo welekwa wakwe wa nk'hongo kugamba hi kint'hu.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Kwalailaga gumbo kulu mwe isi, kujink'ha diya dyalailaga mwo ugima wa Ibulahimu. Isaka niyo aita kwa Abimaleki seuta ywa Wafilisiti uko Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Zumbe Mnungu amlailaga Isaka niyo amgamba, “Use kuita Misili, wikale mwe isi idya huunga hulagise. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ikala aaha, miye neninde na weye, naho nohuvikile, naho neniwenk'heni weye ne vyeleko vako isi ino yose. Naho neni kint'hize kiya namlaganaga iso Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Neniwatende welekwa wako kunda wengi enga nt'hondo za kwe mbingu, neniwenk'he welekwa wako isi ino yose, naho kombokela kwa welekwa wako want'hu wose mwe si nawavikilwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Nohuvikile kwaviya Ibulahimu nakanizumila, niyo adamanya zisigilizi zangu, na malagizo yangu na miko yangu”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Naivo Isaka ekalaga uuko Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Umwo want'hu weze wamuuze mwe mbuli ya mkaziwe, yehe awagambaga, andaga lumbudye. Ogohaga kugamba andaga mkaziwe kwaviya want'hu nawakadaha kumkoma vileke wamguhe Labeka uyo mkaziwe ahombweele. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka eze ekale uko kwa mazuwa mengi seuta Abimaleki asungiilaga mwe dilanga niyo aona Isaka akamkumbatila mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimaleki amwitangaga Isaka niyo amgamba, “Kindedi uyu mkazio! Nii nokunigamba uyo lumbudyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Yehe ahitulaga, “Kwaviya nehogoha kukomwa kwajili yakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimaleki niyo agamba, “Kukitenda vivihi?” “Yumwenga mwa want'hu awa naakadaha kugona na mkazio haheina kufanyanya hegu nokukigela mwa masa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Abimaleki niyo awakanya want'hu akagamba, “Yeyose akumtendela vihile mnt'hu uyu hegu mkaziwe naakomwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaka ahandaga mbeyu mwe isi idya niyo avuna kwa magana gana, kwaviya avikilagwa ni Mnungu. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Isaka andaga mgoli niyo anda mgoli vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Wafilisiti wamuonelaga finju kwo ugoli andaga nawo. Andaga na mafyo mengi ya mbuzi na ng'ombe na wandima wengi. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Yadya masima yasimbagwa ni wandima wa Ibulahim Ise dya Isaka umwo andaga mgima, wayasilizaga niyo wayamemeza sanga.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimaleki amgambaga Isaka, “Halawe mwe isi yetu kwaviya kunda na ludole kukijink'ha suwe.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ivo niyo isaka ahalawa mwe isi idya niyo akuzenga kwe dikolongo dya Gelali niyo ekala uko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Asimbaga naho masima yasimbagwa umwo Ibulahimu ise andaga mgima. Wafilisiti wayasilizaga aho ise eze abanike. Isaka niyo ahenk'ha zina ayadya Ibulahimu ise ayetangaga masima ayo.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Wandima wa Isaka wasimbaga sima mwe dikolongo niyo wabwiila mazi yakubwiluka. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Mna wadimi wa Gelali wagombaga na wadimi wa Isaka wakagamba, “Mazi aya yetu.” Ivo niyo Isaka aditanga disima diya, “Mgombelwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Wandima wa Isaka wasimbaga sima tuhu niyo kwalaila nk'humbizi ya kudigombela idyo nadyo, niyo aditanga disima idyo, “Sitina”. Kwa Kiibulania, Nuko kugamba, “Gaina.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Ahasogelaga hant'hu aho niyo akusimba sima tuhu kutuhu. Hakwandaga na nk'humbizi elo uko niyo adik'ha zina, “Rehoboth.” Akagamba, “Haluse Zumbe kakink'ha luneka kwikala mwe isi ino naswe nekigendeele.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Isaka ahalawaga uko niyo aita Belisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ikilo ikia Zumbe amlailaga niyo amgamba, “Ni miye Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu. Usekwogoha miye ni hamwenga na weye. Nohuvikile na kukwink'ha welekwa wengi enga ivo nalaganaga na mndima ywangu Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaka adamanyaga kilingo cha kutambikila niyo amvika Mnungu. Naho azengaga nk'hambi ukwo niyo wandima wakwe wafuka sima tuhu.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwivano wa Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Zuwa dimwenga Abimaleki ezaga kulawa Gelali akanda hamwenga na Azati mlangilizi nywakwe na Fikoni mkulu ywa watowani wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka niyo awauza, “Mni basai nanywe aho nk'hongo nomniihiya niyo mwaleka nasama mwe isi yenyu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Niyo wamhitula, “Haluse kimanya kugamba Zumbe ehamwenga na weye, naivo kiona kugamba kinde na kilapi cha mwivano weye na suwe chaunga wiike Ndagano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kugamba houkitendele vihile naswe hekikutendela vihile. Nekinda wedi kwako nawe uhalawe kwa utondowazi. Naho imanyika kugamba Zumbe kakuvikila.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Niyo Isaka awadamanyila fugo niyo wadya no kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Mtondo utimile kila mnt'hu aikaga Ndagano kwa kilapi. Isaka awalagaga niyo wapangana enga wambuya.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Dizuwa idia wandima wa Isaka wezaga niyo wamgambila mbuli ze disima wasimbile. Wagambaga, “Kiona mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Niyo disima idyo aditanga, “Kilapi.” Kwaivo zina dyo mzi uwo wetangwa Beelisheba hata ivi dielo. Zina idyo kwa Kiibulania nuko kugamba “Sima dya Kilapi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau eze abuze miaka milongo mine, alombaga wavele waidi, Yudisi mwana Beeli na Basemasi mwana Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Wavele awo watendaga imioyo ya Isaka na Labeka kunda na masulumizo.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka Amvikila Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka adalahalaga niyo meso yakwe yanda haya kuona. Amwitangaga mwanawe mkulu Esau niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu.” Esau niyo ahitula, “Woe!”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka niyo amgamba, “Kaula miye hidalahala himanyize dizuwa dyo kubanika kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Guha uta wako ne misale uite kwe nyika ukanikomele nyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Uyambike nk'hande imwile idya huiungisa niyo wanigaila nidye hajika ukudya huvikile iivi hinati kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Umwo Isaka andile akalonga na Esau nine andaga akategeleza. Ivo esau eze ande kaita kwo kongola, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />uyo Labeka niyo amgamba mwanawe Yakobo, “Hiva ivo iso naakalonga na Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />Kanikomele nyama niyo wanambikila nk'hande imwile. Habinda ukudya huvikile hameso ya Zumbe iivi hinati kubanika. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Labeka niyo agendeela akagamba, “Haluse mwanagu, nitegeleze udamanye ivo hulonga. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ita kwe difyo ukasagule mbuzi mbili zigimbale, niziguhe miye nambike nk'hande idya iso akuiungisa. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Akajika umwigaile iso akadye naye nakuvikile iivi akei kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Mna Yakobo niyo amgamba nine, “Kumanya kugamba Esau anafili mwili wose, mna miye hina. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Mafani tate naanitoze niyo abunk'hula kugamba namdant'hiliza, kwa sila ino nadaha kuligitwa hant'hu hakuvikilwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nine niyo amhitula kugamba, “Ligito nedinde dyangu mwanangu, weye damanya ivo hulonga, weye ita kanigaile zimbuzi izo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ivo agendaga kuziguha zimbuzi niyo amwigaila nine niyo ambika nk'hande idya ise akuiungisa. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Labeka aguhaga suke izedi za Esau izo zandile kwe nyumba ya Labeka niyo amvala Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Iviyaiviya amvalaga nk'hingo mwe mikono na mmwenga mwe singo yakwe hemwiina fili.<verse eid="GEN 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Niyo amwink'ha ink'hande imwile yedi ne mikate idya aidamanye.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Niyo Yakobo aita kwa ise niyo amwitanga, “Tate!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Esau etikaga, “Woe.” “Ni weye yuhi mwanangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Ni miye mwanao Esau, hidamanya enga viya unigambile. Nakulombeza ukungumale udye inyama hwigaile vileke univikile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaka niyo agamba, “Kupata kale vivihi kwa uhufu ivo mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe Mnungu ywako kanambiza kuipata.” <verse eid="GEN 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaka niyo amgamba Yakobo, “So hagihi na miye hutoze mwanagu nimanye kindedi kugamba weye ywi Esau kindedi hegu bule.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobo amsogeelaga ise. Ise amtozaga niyo agamba, “Izwi dyako dyenga dya Yakobo, mna mikono yako haitoza enga ya Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Hadahaga kumanya kugamba andaga ni Yakobo kwaviya mikono yakwe yandaga ina fili enga ya Esau, ivo niyo akonga kumvikila. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Mna amuuzaga kaidi, “Weye ni we mwanangu Esau ywe kindedi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakobo amhitulaga ise akagamba “Ni miye.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaka niyo agamba, “Haya nink'he iyo inyama nidye ukala wako mwanangu, akajika aho huvikile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Niyo Ise agamba, “So unikumbatile kwa kuninonela mwanagu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Ivo Yakobo amwiziilaga ise hagihi ise niyo amnonela, ise naye eze eve mhemp'he we zisuke zakwe niyo amvikila. Agambaga, “Mhemp'he wedi we zisuke za mwanangu ni enga mhemp'he wa nk'honde ivikilwe ni Zumbe <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Mnungu akwink'he fula kwa lupisi lwakwe naho nk'honde yako inde kitefe. Akwink'he nk'hande na divai vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Want'hu wa si zose wande wandima wako, naho want'hu wafike madi hameso hako. Unde kilongozi cha wanduguzo na welekwa wa nyokwe wakufikile madi. Wose wakuunga wakuligite waligitwe, wadya wakuunga wakuvikile, nawo wavikilwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ahembeleza uvikilwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka eze ibinde kwink'hiza uvikilwa aaho Yakobo eze ahalawe, nduguye Esau auyaga kulawa kwo kongola. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Yehe naye ambikaga nk'hande yedi niyo aigala kwa ise niyo amgamba, “Tate itakwikala udye inyama hwigaile vileke univikile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka niyo auza, “Ni weye yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esau niyo ahitula, “Ni miye mwanao mkulu Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka niyo etuka na kuzingiza kwa wogohi niyo auza, “Ni ani akomile nyama niyo anigaila? Hiidya umwo weye wandile ukei kwiza. Himvikila pele, naivo yehe ni mvikilwa mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau eze eve milosi ya ise, ailaga kwa izwi kulu na kwa usungu mkulu niyo agamba, “Tate nivikile name!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isaka niyo agamba, “Nduguyo keza niyo anidant'hiliza. Kauguha uvikilwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau niyo agamba, “Kaidi aka akanihujila. Nivo vikuleka etangwa Yakobo. Zina idi kwa Kiibulania nuko kugamba, hujila. Kaguha uwagilwa wangu wo welekwa wa nk'hongo, haluse naho aguha uvikilwa wangu. Tate! Hunisigazile uvikilwa?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka ahitulaaga akagamba, “Himtenda kale kunda mkulu kwako naho hiwa tenda wanduguze kunda watumwa wakwe. Himwink'ha nk'hande na divai. Hina cha kukudamanyila mwanangu!”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau agendeelaga kumlombeza ise akagamba, “Ivo weye Tate una uvikilwa umwenga du? Nivikile name tate!” Akongaga kuila kwa izwi kulu.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Isaka niyo amgamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Wikazi wako nounde hale na sanga ya kitefe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">naho hale na mnyuzu ukulawa kulanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Wikazi wako nounde wa kutoana na want'hu na kutaha vint'hu vawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">mna ywi mtumwa ywa nduguyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Aho ukeza kusaguka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Hounde mtumwa ywakwe naho.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esau amwihiyaga Yakobo kwaviya ise nakamvikila niyo alonga mwo moyo wakwe, “Lupisi lwo kuhongeza kwajili ye file ya tate lwihagihi, niho nenimkome ndugu yangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Mna Labeka eze ave mzungu wa Esau wa kumkoma niyo amwitanga na kumgambila Yakobo mwanawe akugamba, “Tegeleza nduguyo Esau aika mzungu wa kukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Haluse mwanagu damanya aya hukugambila. Sunguza wiite Halani kwa mkulu Labani, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />ukekale naye kwa lupisi mpaka maya ya nduguyo yamseele <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />no kujala kiya umtendele, akajika neni mtume mnt'hu akubase. Nii nibanikilwe na nyose waidi kwa zuwa dimwenga?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka amtuma Yakobo kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Niyo Labeka amgambaga Isaka, “Nna usungu mwo moyo kwajili ya wavele awa we Kihiti wa Esau. Uneva Yakobo naye analomba mvele ywa Kihiti. Wikazi wangu una uwedi wani?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Isaka niyo amwitanga Yakobo, niyo amvikila akamsigiila kugamba, “Usekulomba mvele ywa Kikanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Sunguza kuita Padanalamu kwa babako Besueli, uko Mesopotamia, ukalombe soviyo yumwenga, mwa wana mtumbao Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Mnungu ywo Udahi wose naaivikile indoza yako, no kukwink'ha wana wabindile ingi, naivo nounde tate ywa isi nyingi! <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Mnungu akuvikile weye hamwenga na welekwa wako enga viya amvikile Ibulahimu. Naho, isi ino ukwikala enga mtakwiza neinde yako, isi iino Mnungu amwink'haga Ibulahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Isaka amtumaga Yakobo kuita Mesopotamia kwa Labani, andaga mwana Besueli Mwalamu, naho niye lumbudye dya Labeka, uyo nine dya Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau alomba Mvele mtuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau amanyaga kugamba, Isaka kamvikila Yakobo, naho kamtuma kuita Mesopotamia kugenda kuzungula mvele. Iviya iviya, abunk'hulaga kugamba, umwo Isaka akamvikila Yakobo, amsigilaga kugamba asekulomba mvele ywa Kikanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Naho aonaga kugamba Yakobo kaweva nine na ise, naho kaita Mesopotamia. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Niyo Esau anda kamanya kugamba, ise Isaka hakwelelwa ni wavele wa Kikani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Ivo Esau aitaga kwa ise mdodo Ishumaeli, mwana ywa Ibulahimu niyo amlomba Mahalati mwana ywa Ishumaeli andaga lumbudye dya Nebaioti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo alota sozi kudya Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo akongaga utafi kulawa Beelisheba kuhinga Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Zuwa dize diswe, aikaga nt'hulwe niyo aguha iwe nokudiika hasi yo mtwi wakwe, niyo atambala na kugona aikile mtwi wakwe mwe diiwe idyo. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Mwe zisozi aonaga mhindo ulaile hasi mwe isi, mpaka kulanga, watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wakakwela na kuseela mwo mhindo uwo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Zumbe akimalaga hakanda ha Yakobo, niyo agamba, “Ni miye Zumbe, Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu na Isaka. Nohwink'he isi ino, iino uigonele, weye na welekwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Nawande wabindile ingi, enga luvumbi lwe isi. Nawasambale nt'hendelo zose, naho kwa kombokela weye neniwavikile want'hu wa si zose. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Ukumbukile kugamba, neninde hamwenga na weye, naho nohwamile hohose nowiite, naho no huvuze mwe isi ino. Hohuleke hata nikint'hize yadya nilagane kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Yakobo eze enuke mwe zint'hongo niyo agamba, “Zumbe eyaha aha! Name hyamanyize!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Ogohaga niyo agamba, “Hant'hu aha hatisa vidala! Vadahika ino Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, naho nk'hili ya kuita kwe mbingu.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobo enukaga kilo kilo, niyo aguha diiwe diya aikilaga umtwi wakwe, niyo adikima dinde mkimaila niyo adigidila mavuta diiwe vileke dinde nk'humbukila kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Ehetangaga hant'hu aho Beseli. Hamwenga na kugamba mzi uwo wetangagwa Luzi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Yakobo niyo aika kilapi kwa Zumbe, “Uneva unanda hamwenga na miye no kunidima mwe nt'hambo yangu ino no kunink'ha nk'hande na suke, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />naho nna uya mp'heho tondolo kwa tate, nounde ni weye Mnungu ywangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Iwe idi dye nk'humbukila nikimalise aha, nahande ni hant'hu nouvikigwe, naho nohwink'he kimwenga mwe kila vint'hu mlongo ukunink'ha.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo abula he nyumba ya Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobo agendeelaga ne nt'hambo niyo ahinga nt'hendelo ya Uailo wa zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Uuko aonaga sima dya mazi umwo mwe nyika na mafyo matatu ya ngoto zichumile kuzunguluka disima. Zingoto nezikanyweswa he disima idyo dyagubikagwa ni iwe kulu kwo mnomo wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Mwe kihendo chawe, mafyo yose yakanda yadugana yakanyweswa, wadimi nawakaditongolosa diiwe nokuzinywesa zingoto. Naho wakabinda nawakadivuza diiwe hant'hu hakwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo awauzaga awadimi akagamba, “Wambuya zangu, mwalawa nahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Wamhitulaga kugamba, “Chalawa Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Niyo awauza, “Mummanya Labani mwezukulu ywa Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Niyo wahitula, “Heiye, kimmanya.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Niyo awauza, “Mgima? Niyo wamhitula, Kaula, Laheli, mwanawe we kivele eza ne zingoto.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Kwaviya zuwa dikei msi, naho hakei mpaka hokwigala zingoto kwe kaya, nii hamkuzinywesa niyo mwazivuza kwo kokudya?”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Niyo wahitula, “Hakikudaha kudamanya ivo mpaka mafyo yose yande aaha niyo diiwe ditongoloswe, niho nekinywese zingoto.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Umwo Yakobo andile akalonga nawo, Laheli niyo engila ne difyo dye zingoto. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Ivo Yakobo eze amuone Laheli mwana kike ywa Labani mtumbawe, lumbudye dya ise ne zingoto za Labani, aitaga kwe disima, no kuditongolosa diiwe niyo azinywesa zingoto. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Amkumbatilaga niyo akonga kuila kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Niho Yakobo akamgamba, “Miye ni nduguye dya iso, mwana Labeka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Labeka agulukaga kugenda kumgambila ise, <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani eze eve zimbuli za mwihwawe Yakobo, amgulukilaga kumsingila, amkumbatilaga no kumnonela no kuita naye kwe nyumba yakwe. Yakobo eze amgambile Labani kila kint'hu icho kilaile, <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani niyo agamba, “Kindedi, weye uywangu ne sakame yangu.” Yakobo ekalaga hadya kwa mwezi mgima.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo awalomba Laheli na Lea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Zuwa dimwenga Labani niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Weye mhwangu mna haikuungwa unidamanyile ndima bule. Nigambile waunga maliho yakwinga vihi?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani andaga na wana kike waidi, umkulu etangagwa niye Lea, no umdodo etangagwa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea andaga na meso yahombweele, mna Laheli andaga mndele ywedi ivo aumbigwe vedi.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo andaga kambwedesa Laheli, ivo amgambaga Labani, “Neni damanye ndima kwa miaka mfungate, uneva nounink'he nimlombe Laheli.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani niyo ahitula, “Nivedi kukuloza weye kujink'ha kuloza mnt'hu mtuhu yeyose. Weye kikalanye aaha.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yakobo adamanyaga ndima miaka mfungate vileke amlombe Laheli, lupisi ulu lwaonekaga kunda luguhi kwa Yakobo, kwaviya amuungisaga Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Akajika aho Yakobo amgambaga Labani, “Lupisi lubula, niloze mkazangu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ivo Labani afunganyaga wila we ndoza no kulalika kila yumwenga. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Mna ikilo kiya, Yakobo hant'hu ha kwigailwa Laheli, niyo egailwa Lea, Yakobo niyo agona naye. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani amwink'hizaga mndima ywakwe Zilipa kwa Lea, vileke ande mndima ywakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Kwize kuche, Yakobo nakabunk'hula kugamba yudya andaga ni Lea. Amwiitilaga Labani akanda kaihiwa na kumgamba, “Weye! Nii ukanitendela ivi? Hidamanya ndima vileke unink'he Laheli. Nii ukanidant'hiliza?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani niyo ahitula, “Hiyo kihendo chetu aha kumloza mdodo umwo mkulu akanda akei. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Binda amazuwa mfungate ye ndoza kwa Lea, niho nenikwink'he uyo Laheli uneva noudamanye ndima kwa miaka mfungate mituhu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo azumilaga, naho mazuwa mfungate ye ndoza yeze yasile, Labani niyo amwink'hiza Laheli kwa Yakobo kunda mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />(Labani amwikizaga mndima ywakwe ywe kike uyo Biliha kwa Laheli mwanawe.) <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobo agonaga na Laheli iviya iviya naho nakamuungisa Laheli kujink'ha Lea. Ivo amdamanyilaga Labani ndima miaka mfungate mithu.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheleko cha Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Umwo Mnungu aonaga kugamba Lea haakabwedeswa kujink'ha Laheli, amtendaga Lea ande na cheleko, mna Laheli amtendaga mgumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea enulaga ubovu, elekaga mwana kilume uyo amwink'ha zina niye Lubeni. Niyo agamba, “Zumbe kayaona masulumizo yangu, haluse Mnumangu naanibwede.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Enulaga ubovu mtuhu no kweleka mwana kilume naho. Niyo agamba, “Zumbe kanink'ha mwana kilume mtuhu, kwaviya keva kugamba miye hikubwedigwa.” Ivo Lea amwink'haga uyo mwana zina niye Simioni. Kwa Kiibulania nuko kugamba, “Kanitegeleza.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Naho niyo enula ubovu mtuhu no kweleka mwana kilume mtuhu. Niyo agamba, “Haluse mgosi nenimtoze kwaviya himwelekela wana kilume watatu.” Ivo niyo amwitanga zina dyakwe Lawi. Nuko kugamba “Tozeleza.”<verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Lea enulaga ubovu mtuhu. Amwelekaga mwana kilume, niho agambaga, “Haluse neni mtunye Zumbe.” Ivo niyo amwitanga zina dyakwe Yuda. Nuko kugamba “Tunya.” Niyo cheleko chakwe chaheleza.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Aho Laheli eze aone kugamba hamwelekele mgosiwe Yakobo mwana, amuonelaga finju mkuluwe, niyo amgamba Yakobo mgosiwe, “Nelese, cheivo nenibanike!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo niyo amuonela maya Laheli akamgamba, “Hikudaha kunda enga Mnungu. Yehe niye hekwink'hile wana.”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Laheli niyo ahitula, “Mtumwa ywangu ywe kivele Biliha, eyaha, gona naye anelekele wana, name ninde na wana kombokela yehe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ivo niyo Laheli amwink'ha Yakobo mgosiwe, mtumwa ywakwe, Biliha, ande mkaziwe, niyo agona naye. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Niyo Biliha enula ubovu no kumwelekela Yakobo mwana kilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Laheli niyo agamba, “Mnungu kanitendela vedi, keva indilo yangu, no kunink'ha mwana kilume.” Niyo Laheli amwink'ha uyo mwana zina niye Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha niyo apata ubovu mtuhu, niyo amwelekela Yakobo mwana kilume ywa kaidi. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Laheli niyo agamba, “Hihigana vitendese na mkulu, mna himhuma.” Niyo amwink'ha zina uyo mwana niye Nafutali. Nuko kugamba, “Higana.”<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea eze ande kaleka ukweleka, amguhaga mtumwa ywakwe uyo Zilipa, niyo amwink'ha mgosiwe Yakobo vileke ande mkaziwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Niyo Zilipa amwelekela Yakobo mwana kilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Niyo Lea agamba, “Hipata tondokela.” Ivo niyo amwitanga uyo mwana niye Gadi. Nuko kugamba, “Tondokela.” <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa mtumwa ywa Lea, amwelekelaga Yakobo mwana kilume ywa kaidi, <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />niyo Lea agamba, “Nna kinyemi kikulu! Haluse wavele nawanitange, kinyemi.” Niyo amwink'ha mwana uyo zina niye Asheli. kwa kiibulania nuko kugamba “Kinyemi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Mwo msimo wo uvuni we ngano, Lubeni aitaga kwe nk'honde niyo aona mti uwo want'hu wakuuhuwila kugamba maizi yakwe yadaha kuwatenda wavele kupata ubovu, niyo aguha amwigaile nine Lea. Laheli niyo amgamba Lea, “nink'hage maizi ludodo mwa maizi ya mwanao.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea niyo amhitula, “Togola ni mbuli ndodo kwa kunihoka mnumagu? Naho haluse waunga uguhe maizi ya mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laheli niyo ahitula, “Uneva unanink'ha maizi ya mwanao, Yakobo naakagone na weye ikilo cha dielo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Kisingi kiya umwo Yakobo andaga akalawa kwo mgunda, Lea afosaga kugenda kumsingila niyo amgamba, “Kilo cha dielo chakugonanya, kwaviya hikugula kwa maizi ya mwanangu.” Ivo ikilo kiya niyo Yakobo agonanyaga na Lea.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Mnungu amwivaga Lea, niyo enula ubovu, na kumwelekela Yakobo mwana ywa shano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea niyo agamba, “Mnungu kanink'ha uwagilwa wangu, kwaviya nehimwink'ha mtumwa ywangu ande mkaza mnumangu.” Niyo Lea amwink'ha umwana zina dya Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea enulaga ubovu naho, niyo amwelekela Yakobo mwana ywa mtandatu. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Lea niyo agamba, “Mnungu kanink'ha geleko dyedi. Haluse mnumangu naanizumile kwaviya himwelekela mwana ywa mtandatu.” Niyo amwink'ha mwana zina niye Zabuloni. Kwa kiibulania nuko kugamba, “Geleko.” <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Uuko uko Lea elekaga mwana kike, niyo amwink'ha zina niye Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Mnungu amkumbukilaga Laheli, niyo azumila kulombeza kwakwe niyo alohola cheleko chakwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ivo Laheli enulaga ubovu niyo engila nyumba mwana kilume, niyo agamba, “Mnungu kausa zisoni zangu kwa kunink'ha mwana kilume.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Niyo amwitanga mwana uyo Yusufu naho niyo agamba, “Zumbe naanink'he mwana mtuhu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafyo ya Yakobo yagenyela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Aho Laheli eze amweleke Yusufu, Yakobo amgambaga Labani, “Nilekele niite kwetu kaya, kwe isi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Nink'he wakazangu na wanangu nipatile kwa kudamanya ndima kwako, unilekele niite. Kumanyisa ivo miye hudamanyile ndima.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Labani niyo amgamba, “Name nna dya kulonga. Mnungu kanitenda nikombaganye kugamba Mnungu kanivikila kwajili ya weye. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Longa maliho yako, name nohulihe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo niyo amhitula, “Weye mwenye kumanya ivo hudamanyile ndima, na ivo mafyo yako yagenyele mwo kudima kwangu, <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />kwaviya madimo yako yandaga mageke umwo nandile nikei kwiza, mna haluse yagenyelesa, naho Mnungu kakuvikila vitendese kila aho naitaga. Haluse, niini neniite hadamanye mbuli za kwe nyumba yangu mwenye?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani niyo amgamba, “Nohwink'he mbwai?” Yakobo niyo amhitula, “Use kuniliha chochose, Nenigendeele no madimo yako uneva unazumila iki hulonga. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Nilekele nomboke mwa madimo yako yose dielo, no kupagula kila ngoto ina mawalo na madoladola, na kila mbuzi nt'hitu na ina madoladola, na mawalo. Ayo nayande nayo maliho yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Uko kulongole nowize uone kugamba nandaga mhuwilwa, umwo ukeza kulaula maliho yangu uneva neninde na mbuzi heiina mabalobalo hegu madoladola, hegu ngoto yeyose heiina utitu, aho naho noumanye kugamba iyo ibaigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani niyo agamba, “Ni vedi! Goja vinde enga ivo ulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Mna dizuwa idia Labani apagulaga mavulata yandile na malema, na yadya yandile na madoladola, ne zint'hogota zandile na mabalo ne zia zandile na madoladola, na kila imwenga yandile no ung'azi, na kila ngoto yandile no utitu, niyo aziika mwo ukimalizi wa wanawe. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Labani niyo aita na mafyo hale na Yakobo, lugendo lwa mazuwa matatu, umwo Yakobo akagendeela kudima mafyo ya Labani yasigale.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Niyo Yakobo aguha nk'hombosha za mnwati mbisi na za mlozi na za mwalamoni, niyo azigobola vileke zink'hombosha zinde na malema yang'aile. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Aziikaga zink'hombosha kulongole kwo luhondo ludya lwa mafyo yakunyweela. Aziikaga hadya kwaviya mavulata naho yakuozelega yakeza kunywa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Mafyo niyo yawozela yakanda halongole he zink'hombosha izo, niyo yeleka mabehela yandaga na malema, naho yandaga na mabalo na madoladola.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Akajika aho niyo Yakobo azizagula zingoto ne zimbuzi, mna kwa ziya zisigale aonyekeza vihanga vawe kwe zia zandile na malema, na zose zandile no utitu mwa mafyo ya Labani, naho hahanganye na madimo yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Umwo mbuguma zina ludole zikabwikana, Yakobo aikaga zingoda kulongole kwa mahondo yo kunywesela, vileke yaozele hagihi ne zingoda. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Mna mifugwa isokele haikaga zingoda kulongole. Ivo mifugwa isokele yandaga ya Labani, mna idya idamane niyo yanda ya Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Kwaivo Yakobo niyo anda mgoli vitendese. Nakanda na mafyo mengi, na watumwa na ngamia na mapunda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo anyilika kulawa kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobo keva kugamba wana Labani wagamba, “Yakobo kaguha kila kint'hu cha tati yetu kanda mgoli kwa vint'hu va tati yetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Naho aonaga kugamba Labani handile na lukunde enga ivo andaga nk'hongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Niyo Zumbe amgamba Yakobo, “Uya kaya kwa waiso na wanduguzo. Neninde hamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="GEN 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ivo Yakobo awatumilaga ulosi na kuwetanga, Laheli na Lea wambwiile kwo kudima ukwo idifyo dyakwe dyandaga. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Niyo awagamba, “Hibunk'hula kugamba tati yenyu hakuniunga enga hadya nk'hongo mna Mnungu ywa tate kanda hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Nyuwe nyose mmanya kugamba himdamanyila ndima kwa ludole lwangu lwose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Naho tati yenyu kanihujila nk'hanana mlongo mwo kuniliha mna Mnungu hamlekele anilumize. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Kila aho tati yenyu agambile, mbuzi za maoleole nezinde nizo maliho yako, fyo dyose dyelekaga maoleole. Eze agambe zinde ne misilimbo nayo amaliho yako, zose niyo zeleka zina misilimbo. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Ivo Mnungu kaisamiza mifugwa kwa tati yenyu niyo anink'ha miye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Mwo lupisi lwe mifugwa kusimika, nalotaga sozi kugamba mavulata yandaga yakaozela yandaga na Misilimbo na maoleole na mabalobalo. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu alongaga mwe zisozi akanigamba, ‘Yakobo!’ Niyo netika, ‘woe.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Niyo anigamba, ‘Kaula, mavulata yose yakuozela mwe difyo dyako yana misilimbo naho yana maoleole na mabalobalo kwaviya hiona yose Labani akukutendela. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ni miye Mnungu nakulailaga Beseli hadya wadiikaga diiwe dyo lukumbusa kwa kuditiila mavuta niyo waika kilapi na miye. Haluse waungwa kukeika lumwe uuye kwa isi kudya welekelagwa.’”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Laheli na Lea wamhituilaga Yakobo kugamba, “Suwe elo hakina chochose kisigale enga ukipe wetu kulawa kwa tate. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Akiona suwe enga watakwiza kakitaga, naho haluse adya ugoli udya enk'higwe kwajili yetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Kila kiya Mnungu aguhile kwa tati yetu icho ni chetu hamwenga na wana wetu. Kwaivo damanya kiya Mnungu akusigiile.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Yakobo enukaga niyo awakweza wanawe hamwenga na wakaziwe mwe zingamia, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />aduganyaga mifugwa yakwe yose na vint'hu vakwe vose ivo apataga, ukwo Padanialam no kuita kwa Isaka kwe isi ya Kaanani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Labani agendaga kukant'ha zingoto zakwe amazoya, niyo Laheli anda kapata luneka lwa kubawa milungu midodo ya kwa ise umwo hawanati kuita. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Iviyaiviya Yokobo ahalawaga kwa kumdant'hiliza Labani wa Asilia kwa kuhalawa haheina kulaga. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Aguhaga kila kint'hu kiya chandaga chakwe niyo anyilika niyo awomboka mto wa Efulate na kuita kwe isi ye vigulu va Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani amtimila Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa matatu, Labani agambilagwa kugamba Yakobo kanyilika. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Labani awaguhaga wanduguze niyo wamzungula kwa mazuwa mfungate niyo wakumbwiila mwe isi ye vingulu va Giliadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Mnungu amwiziilaga Labani wa Asilia mwe zisozi akamgamba, “Ukaulise, usekumtenda dyodyose.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Labani ambwiilaga Yakobo kaika nk'hambi kwe isi ye vigulu va Giliadi niyo yehe na wanduguze waika nk'hambi kwe vigulu va Giliadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labani amuuzaga Yakobo, “Kudamanyai? Kunidant'hiliza niyo wawaguwa wanangu enga want'hu watahigwe kwe nk'hondo! <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Nii ukenuka kwa kinyele na kunidant'hiliza niyo hunigambile? Hegu nehikusindikiza kwa kinyemi na ukemi na kwa ngoma na mazeze. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Nii hunink'hile luneka lwa kuwalaga wanangu na kuwanonela wezukulu wangu? Ikindedi mbuli udamanye hiyo yedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nehadaha kukutenda vihile mna Mnungu ywa watati zako nakanilaila kilo cha dielo niyo anikanya kugamba, nise kukulonga chochose kiihile. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Hata uneva nokuhalawa kwaviya una nk'hwina za kwenyu kaya, mna nii ukabawa mahili ya milungu yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo niyo ahitula Labani akagamba, “Hikugambile kwaviya nehyogoha kugamba waunga unihoke wanao. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Mna unamuona yeyose ana mahili yako, akomigwe. Kilagise ha hameso ya want'hu wako, chako chochose ukiguhe.” Yakobo hamanyaga kugamba Laheli niye abawaga mahili.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Labani agendaga kusank'hula kwe dihema dya Yakobo niyo aita kwe dihema dya Lea niyo naho aita kwe dihema dya wadya watumwa waidi mna haone mahili ya babakwe. Akajika naho aitaga kwe dihema dya Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Laheli aguhaga mahili ayo niyo ayafisa hasi ye ditandiko dye ngamia niyo ekala mnanga. Labani asank'hulaga mwe dihema dyose mna hayaonaga mahili ayo. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Laheli niyo amgamba ise, “Tate usekuniihiya kugamba hikudaha kukimaala ha meso hako kwa viya ni mwa mazuwa ye kivele.” Labani asank'hulaga mna haonaga mahili yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Niho Yakobo aihiwagwa no kumbasa kwa maya Labani, “Masa yangu ni yahi?” “Hidamanya wavu wani, vikuleka ukaniziila kwa ivi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ivo usank'hule sank'hule mwe vint'hu vangu vose, kuona kibwai ichako? Kiike aha hameso ya want'hu wako na wakwangu vileke walamule mwa suwe waidi. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Hikala na weye miaka milongo miidi. Zimbuzi ne zingoto zako hazidunduke kweleka, naho hinati kudya ndolome na mavulata yako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Hikwigaile kint'hu kikomigwe ni makala, kuhungukilwa uko nokunda kwangu mwenye. Naho nehiungwa kuvuza chochose kibaigwe nomsi hegu nekilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Nahasulumila kwa mengi. Msi zuwa nedisiila mwangu, nekilo mp'heho. Nt'hongo nehinda hina mwa meso yangu. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Miyaka ino milongo miidi nehinda mwana ywa mwe nyumba yako, hikudamanyila ndima miyaka mlongo na mine kwa wanawo awa waidi we kivele, miyaka mtandatu nayo kwajili ya madimo yako. Hamwenga na ayo kwa nk'hanana mlongo kunihujila mwo kuniliha. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Wandile Mnungu ywa watate, ywa Ibulahimu na Mnungu ywa Isaka handile na miye hegu nokunigulusa hiina kint'hu, mna Mnungu kayaona makunt'ho yangu ne ndima nidamanye. Mwe kilo cha gulo Mnungu kakukanya.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwivano wa Yakobo na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labani niyo ahitula, “Wandele awa wanangu, wana awa wakwangu naho mifugwa ino ya kwangu na vose ukuviona aha vakwangu. Elo neniwatendeleni mbwani mwa awa wanangu na wana wawe? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Haluse kiike Ndagano miye na weye inde uwona mwa miye na weye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ivo Yakobo aikaga iwe niyo adikimalisa enga mnala. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yakobo niyo awagamba want'hu wakwe, “Duganyeni maiwe.” Wayaguhaga maiwe ayo niyo wayatenda nunda. Niyo wadiila nk'hande aaho he nunda ya maiwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani ahetangaga aho hant'hu, Jegashaduta. Mna Yakobo ahetangaga Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani niyo amgamba yakobo, “Dielo nunda ino ni uwona mwa miye na weye.” Nivo vikuleta yetangwa Gilaedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Labani agendeelaga kulonga, “Zumbe akikaule umwo kikapangana.” Iviya iviya “hant'hu aho hetangangwa Mizipa.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Niyo agendeela kulonga, “Una watendela wanangu vihile hegu una lomba mvele mtuhu, hata uneva hikumanya, manya kugamba Mnungu ni muwona mwa miye na weye. <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Kaula nunda ino ya maiwe no mkimailo uno niikile hagati ya weye na miye. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Inunda ino no mkimailo uno ni uwona kugamba hikudaha kujink'ha inunda ino kwiza kwako na kukukump'hukila. Nawe hukudaha kujink'ha mkimailo uno kwiza kwangu kunikump'hukila. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Mnungu nywa Ibulahimu na Mnungu ywa Naholi, naalamule mwa suwe.” Yakobo aikaga kilapi kwa zina dya Mnungu uyo akuvikwa na Isaka ise, kutoza kiya alagane. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yakobo atambikaga kwo mnima naho alalikaga want'hu kwo ludyo. Weze wabinde kudya wasigalaga uuko kwo mnima kilo chose. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Mtotondo Labani enukaga niyo awanonela wezukuluwe na kuwalaga wanawe we kike. No kuwaavikila. Ahalawaga niyo auya kaya.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo adugana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Naho Yakobo agendeelaga no utafi wakwe, umwo mwe sila adugananga na mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Eze awaone niyo agamba, “Awa watoani wa Mnungu.” Ivo ahetangaga hant'u aho Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobo atumaga wegala ulosi wamlongoele kwa nduguye Esau mwe isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Awasigiilaga kugamba, “Aya nayo mkuungwa mkamgambile mkulu Esau, ‘Mtumwa ywako Yakobo agamba, nahekala na Labani, naho nehinda hata ivi haluse. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nna ng'ombe na mpunda na mbuzi na watumwa wa kilume na wa kivele. Haluse nakutumila ulosi uno weye zumbe dyangu, kugamba wadaha ukanionela mbazi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Wadya wegale ulosi weze wauye kwa Yakobo, wamgambaga, “Nekiita kwa nduguyo Esau, naho eza kukusingila. Ehamwenga na want'hu magana mane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakobo ogohesaga na kwingilwa ni kinyulu. Awapangaga wadya want'hu andaga nawo hamwenga ne zingoto ne zimbuzi ne izing'ombe ne zingamia, mwa mafyo maidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Afanyanyaga kugamba, “Uneva Esau aneza kuditaha diya idifyo dya nk'hongo, diya dituhu nedikadaha kusumka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Niho Yakabo akamlombeza Mnungu akagamba, “Unitegeleze weye Mnungu ywa tate Ibulahimu, naho Mnungu ywa tate Isaka, weye Zumbe niwe wanigambaga niuye kwa want'hu wangu na kwe isi yangu, naho nokunigamba kila kint'hu nekinde chedi kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Hiwagilwe kwa vovose kwo udya uwedi na uhuwilwa wako, udya unitendele mtumwa ywako. Nawombokaga umto wa Yolidani handa ne nk'home du yo kugendela, mna haluse nauya kaya na mafyo aya maidi. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nalombeza, unihonye, na maya ya ndugu yangu Esau. Nogoha kugamba eza kunikump'hukila na kukikoma suwe chose hamwenga na wavele na wana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Mna nokugamba nounidamanyile kila kint'hu kunda chedi, no kunink'ha welekwa wabindile ingi, hekwiina mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kuwawaza. Kwaviya uwingi wawe nounde enga msanga we bahali.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Kilo icho Yakobo agonaga aaho, asagulaga mifugwa kulawa mwa amafyo yakwe kugenda kumwink'ha mageleko nduguye Esau, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />mbuguma za mbuzi magana maidi, na mavulata milongo miidi, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamia zikonk'heza milongo mitatu hamwenga ne zindama zawe, mbuguma milongo mine za ng'ombe, na majeku mlongo, mbuguma za mp'hunda milongo miidi na majeku ya mp'hunda mlongo. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Ayapangaga mwe wandima wakwe, kila yumwenga na fyo dyakwe. Niyo awagamba, “Longoleni, naho neniwaze nk'hacho kulawa mdimi yumwenga na fyo dyakwe, mpaka mdimi mtuhu na fyo dyakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Niyo amgamba mtumwa ywa nk'hongo, “Umwo ndugu yangu Esau akeza kudugana na weye no kukuuza kugamba. Weye ywi mtumwa ywa ani? Waitahi? Mifugwa ino ulongoze ya ani? <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />umhitule kugamba, Mifugwa ino yo mtumwa ywako Yakobo. Egala mageleko kwa mkuluwe Esau. Yehe mwenye Yakobo eza kunyuma.” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Niyo amsigiila iivo yudya ywa kaidi na ywa katatu na kwa wadya wose wandile wakatimila, “Ivi nivo mkuunga mlonge umwo mkadugana naye Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Naho msekujala kumgambila, Mtumwa ywako Yakobo eyuko kunyuma eza.” Yakobo afanyanyaga kugamba, “Mafa mwa mageleko aya humwink'ha yadahika naaleke kuniihia naho mafa naanilekele.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Alongozaga mageleko, mna yehe mwenye agonaga kwe nk'hambi.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ahigana na Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Yakobo enukaga kilo ikia no kuwaguha wakaziwe wose waidi, na wavele wakwe watuhu waidi hi wa ndoza, na awanawe mlongo na yumwenga, niyo awombosa mwo mto Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Eze ajike kuwombosa, niyo naho ambosa ne vint'hu vose andile navo, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />mna mwenye niyo asigala kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">niyo mnt'hu yumwenga eza no kuhigana nae vyeleka mpaka kilokilo. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Uyo mnt'hu eze aone kugamba hakudaha kumhuma Yakobo, niyo amtenk'hula Yakobo mapeng'ene umwo wandile wakahigana. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Goja niite kwaviya kwatandazuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobo niyo amgamba, “Hikukulekela, mpaka univikile.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amuuza, “Weye wetangwa ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Niyo ahitula, “Netangwa Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Niyo yudya mnt'hu agamba, “Haluse howitangwe naho Yakobo. Kuhigana na Mnungu na want'hu, niyo wawahuma, ivo zina dyako nowitangwe Iziaeli.” Nuko kugamba, “Kahigana na Mnungu.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Niyo Yakobo amgamba, “Nigambile dizina dyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Mna yudya mnt'hu amhitulaga, “Waungilai kudimanya dizina dyangu?” Niyo amvikila.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Himuona Mnungu meso kwa meso, mna nikei mgima.” Ivo niyo ahetanga hant'hu aho, Penieli. Zina Panueli kwa kiibulania, nuko kugamba, “Uso wa Mnungu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Zuwa dyandaga ditont'homoka umwo Yakobo andaga akahalawa Penieli, naho Yakobo andaga akajegula kwaviya mapengene yakwe nayatenk'huka. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Nivo vikuleka hata dielo, welekwa wa Izilaeli hawakudya nyama ya peng'ene, kwaviya Yakobo atenk'hulwagwa nk'hwali ye dipeng'ene.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo wakebwiila na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Akajika aho, Yakobo amuonaga Esau akeza hamwenga na want'hu milongo mine. Ivo niyo awapanganiza wana mwa Lea na Laheli na mwa wambizi wakwe waidi. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Niyo awaika watumwa na wana ywawe kunda wa nk'hongo, niyo wamtimila Lea na wanawe, niyo kunyuma awaika Laheli na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobo aitaga kulongole mwa wose niyo afunama hasi mwe sanga nk'hanana mfungate umwo akaunga ambwiile mkuluwe. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Mna Esau na Yakobo kila yumwenga amgulukilaga miyawe, niyo amkumbatila na kumnonela. Wose waidi wandaga wakaila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau eze abagaze no kuwaona wavele na wana, auzaga, “Awa unanawo ni wahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Mkulu, awa nawo wana na wakazangu awo Mnungu anink'hile kwa uwedi wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Niyo wadya watumwa weza hamwenga na wana wawe no kumwinamila, <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Lea nae niyo eza hamwenga na wanawe, niyo wabindiliza. Yusufu na Laheli nawo niyo weza no kumwinamila.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau niyo auza, “Mafyo ya mifugwa matuhu nidugane nayo nivo yagaaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Idi ni geleko dyako vileke nizumilwe ha meso ha mkulu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Mna Esau niyo amhitula, “Nnanao ugoli ubindile ingi ndugu yangu, ugoli uwo unde wako mwenye.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Bule, uneva hipata mbazi kwako, nihokele mageleko yangu. Kuuona uso wako kwangu miye ni enga kuuna uso wa Mnungu, kwaviya kunihokela kwa kinyemi kikulu. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Nakulombeza uhokele mageleko yangu aya hwigaile, Mnungu kanda ywedi kwangu no kunink'ha kila kint'hu kiya niungile.” Yakobo agendeelaga kumhembeleza kwa mbazi niyo azumila.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esau niyo agamba, “Nekigendeele ne nt'hambo. Miye nohulongoele.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yakobo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe dyangu kamanya kugamba awa wana wasokela, naho aungwa kunda na wengele kwe mifugwa ino yonk'heza. Uneva inagendezeswa lugendo lutali neife yose. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Weye longola, name nohutimile mp'halahole, nekikombeke miye na wana ne mifugwa nekikubwiile uko Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau niyo agamba, “Vedi, goja hwasile want'hu wangu mwizanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Mna Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Usekutenda ivo, kwaviya miye hiunga kuzumilwa ni weye du.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Dizuwa diya Esau akongaga utafi wo kuuya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Mna Yakobo aitaga Sukoti, uko azengaga mahema yakwe yo kwikala, na kwajili ye mifugwa yakwe. Nivo vikuleka hant'hu aho hetangwa Sukoti. Kwa Kiibulania nuko kugamba, “Maheha”.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Mwo kuuya kulawa Mesopotamia Yakobo abulaga vedi mo mzi wa Shekemu mwe isi ya Kanani no kuzenga nk'hambi yakwe hagihi no mzi. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Agulaga kipande icho kulawa kwa welekwa wa Hamoli ise dya Shekemu kwa vipande gana va matundu umwo nimo azengaga nk'hambi yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Adamanyaga kilingo cha kutambikila niyo ahenk'ha zina niho, Eli Elohi Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina agwilwa haheina mwenye kuunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Dina mwana Yakobo na Lea, agendaga kuwatalamkila wavele wa Kikanani wamwenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Niho Shekemu mwana Hamoli Mhivi mkulu ywe isi idya, amuonaga niyo amgwila na kugona naye heina mwenye kuunga. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Naho Shekemu aonaga mwo moyo wakwe kugamba yudya Dina mwana Yakobo kahombweela, ivo niyo amunk'hilwa naye na kumhembeleza. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Niyo amgamba Hamoli ise, “Unink'he mndele uyu ande mkazangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo abunk'hulaga kugamba Dina mwananwe kageligwa soni, mna kwaviya wanawe we kilume wandaga kwo kudima, hadahile kudamanya dyodyose mpaka aho weze wande wauya. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamoli, ise dya Shekemu aitaga akasimuile na Yakobo, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Naho lupisi uulo wana Yakobo wandile wakauya kulawa kwo kudima. Weze weve ivo waonaga usungu niyo wafa maya kwa kiya awatendele want'hu wa Izilaeli kwa kugona na mwana Yakobo haheina mwenye kuunga kint'hu hekikuungwa kudamanywa. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamoli niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Mwanangu Shekemu kambwedesa mwanao Dina, elo nalombeza kugamba umzumile amlombe. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Neki zumilane kugamba, kunde na kulombelana mwa want'hu wetu na awenyu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Naivo elo no mwikale umu mwe isi yetu hamwenga na suwe. Nomwikale hohose hadya nomsagule, namdamanye uchuuzi kwa ulekelwa, no kukepatila ugoli.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Naho Shekemu niyo awagamba walumbuze na ise dya Dina, “Nifiileni mbazi, name neniwenk'heni chochose icho mkuunga. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Nigambileni mageleko yadya mkuunga. Naho yongezeni imali vovose ivo mkuunga miye nenilihe, uneva mnazumila nimlombe Dina.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Wadya wana kilume wa Yakobo wamhitulaga Shekemu na ise Hamoli, kwa lubezo, kwaviya Shekemu andaga kagona kale na Dina lumbudyawe. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Wamgambaga, “Hakikudaha kumleka lumbu dyetu alombigwe ni want'hu hewevinilwe, iyo neinde soni kwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Nekizumile du hadya nomnde enga suwe kwa kuwavinila wagosi wose uko kwenyu. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Aho niho nekilombelane. Nekikale mwa nyuwe naho kinde want'hu wa hamwenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Mna hamna zumilane na suwe no kuvinilwa, suwe chamguha lumbu dyetu na kuhalawa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Fanyanyi zawe nezioneka kunda ziwawelela Hamoli na mwanawe Shekemu niyo wazumilana na idyo. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Yudya mbwanga andaga mhuwilwa mkulu mwe mp'huga yawe hazile lupisi lutali mwe kudamanya ayo agambilwe, kwaviya Shekemu ambwedesaga mwana Dina mwana Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamoli na Shekemu mwanawe waitaga he nk'hiliyo mzi niyo walonga na want'hu wakagamba, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Want'hu awa ni wambuya zetu, walekeni wekale kwa ulekelwa. Isi ino nk'hulu chenela chose hamwenga na suwe. Suwe kiwalombele woho nawo wakilombele. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Mna want'hu awa nawazumile kwikala na kunda na suwe uneva du wagosi wetu wose nawavinilwe enga ivo wavinilwe woho. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Togoleni, hamkuona kugamba mifugwa yawe no ugoli wawe, vose hevinde va kwetu? Ivo nekizumileni wekale mwetu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Wekazi wose wo mzi wazumila mwe yadya yalongigwe ni Hamoli na Shekemu, niyo wagosi wose wavinilwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa matatu, umwo wagosi awo wandaga wakei mwo usungu wo kuvinilwa, wadya wana waidi we kilume wa Yokobo, Simioni na nduguye Lawi walumbuze dya Dina, waguhaga mabamba yawe yakutwa kose kose niyo wengila mwo mzi kipump'ha no kuwakoma wagosi wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hamwenga na Hamoli na mwanawe ywe kilume Shekemu. Wamguhaga Dina kulawa mwe nyumba ya Shekemu niyo wahalawa. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ukomi uwo wize womboke, wana kilume watuhu wa Yakobo wagendaga kuutaha umzi kulihiza kugeligwa soni kwa lumbu dyawe. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Waguhaga mafyo ya ng'ombe na mp'hunda, na kila kint'hu kimwomzi na mwe zink'honde. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Waguhaga kila kint'hu cha ugoli, wawatahaga wavele hamwenga na wana, no kwinula kila kint'hu mwe zinyumba.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Yakobo niyo awagamba wanawe, Simioni na Lawi, “Nyuwe mnigaila nk'huswa nk'huswa, kwaviya uneva Wakanani, Wapelizi na want'hu watuhu wowose mwe isi nawaniihiye. Miye hina want'hu wengi uneva nawakelunganye niyo weza kunikup'hukila mp'huga yetu yose neikomwe.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Wadya wabwanga waidi niyo wahitula, “Haikudahika lumbudyetu atendelwe enga pamp'he.”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo auya uko Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Yakobo, “Inuka wiite Beseli ukekale uuko niyo wadamanya kilingo cha kutambikila kwa Mnungu yudya ukulailaga umwo wandaga ukamnyilika nduguyo Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Yakobo niyo aigamba imp'huga yakwe na wadya wose andile nawo, “Lekeni mahili ye kigeni idya mnanayo, kesunt'heni, naho mvale suke zi kukile. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Mna chaita Beseli, uko nehadamanye kilingo cha kutambikila kwa Mnungu yudya anambizaga mwa makunt'ho yangu, naho yudya andaga na miye kila hadya naitile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ivo niyo wamwink'ha Yakobo mahili yawe mageni, ne ziheleni zawe. Yakobo azifulikilaga hasi yo mti wo mwaloni nuwo wandile uko Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobo na wanawe we kilume weze wakonge kwiita, want'hu wadya wandile mwe mizi imgihi, nawengilwa ni wogofi mkulu, naho hawagezile kuwatimila. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobo aitaga na want'hu wakwe wose uko Luzi, mwe isi ya Kanani, uwo ukwitangwa Beseli uwo ukwitangwa Beseli umwe isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Adamanyaga kilingo cha kutambikila kwa Mnungu. Ahenk'ha zina hant'hu aho, Eli Beseli, ni kwaviya aho niho Mnungu amlailaga umwo andaga akamnyilika mkuluwe. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Debola mlezi ywa Labekaniyo wammosela msanga hasi yo mti wo mwaloni nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi ya Beseli. Ivo niyo mti uwo wenk'higwa zina, “mwaloni wa ndilo.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Umwo Yakobo eze auye kulawa Mesopotamia, Mnungu amlailaga kaidi no kumvikila. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Zina dyako niwe Yakobo, mna kukongela ivi haluse nowitangwe Izilaeli.” Kwaivo Yakobo enk'hagwa zina ni Mnungu niye Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Naho Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Miye niye Mnungu mto udahi wose (El Shaddai). Unde na wana wengi. Si, na mafyo ya si, nayalawe kwako, naho maseuta nawalawe mwe cheleko chako. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Nohwink'he isi idya namwink'hile Ibulahimu na Isaka, naho neni ink'hize kwa welekwa wako wakuunga wakutimile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Aho niyo Mnungu amleka Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yakobo niyo akimalisa iwe dya nk'humbukila hadya Mnungu alongaga naye, naho kaditenda dinde dya Zumbe kwa kuditiila divai na mavuta ya zeituni. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Hant'hu aho Yakobo alongaga na Mnungu, Yakobo ahetangaga Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Laheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobo ne mp'huga yakwe wagendeelaga ne nt'hambo kulawa Beseli, mna umwo wandile wakei kwingila Efalasa, Laheli akongagwa ni usungu wa kweleka, naho alumisagwa ni usungu uwo. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Usungu wize wongezekele, mnk'hunga ywakwe niyo amgamba, Laheli, “Usekogoha, kupata mwana mtuhu wa kilume.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Mna Laheli andaga akatoweela kwaviaandaga akabanika, amwink'haga mwanawe zina dya Benoni, nuko kugamba, “Mwana ywa makunt'ho changu.” Mna ise niyo amwitanga Benjanini, Kwa Kiibulania nuko kugamba, “Mwana ywo mkono wangu wa kulume.”<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Laheli eze abanike nakamoswa msanga hank'handa ye sila ikuita Efulasa, uko mwa mazuwa aya kukwitangwa Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo asimikaga iwe dya nk'humbukila aho amosigwe msanga mkaziwe, naho ni kiwalo che kikuta cha Laheli hata ivi dielo. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Yakobo uyo etangagwa Izilaeli agendeelaga ne nt'hambo niyo aika nk'hambi kulongole yo mnala wa Eda.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Umwo Yakobo akekala mwe isi idya, Lubeni agendaga kugona na Biliha, yumwenga mwa wavele hi wa ndoza wa ise, Yakobo aivaga niyo aihiwa vitendese.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo andaga na wana kilume mlongo na waidi. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Wana wa Lea wandaga ni Lubeni, mwanawe ywa nk'hongo, Simioni na Lawi na Isakali na Yuda na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Wana wa Laheli wandaga ni Yusufu na Benjanini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Wana wo mtumwa wa Laheli uyo Biliha wandaga ni Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Wana wo mtumwa wa Lea uyo Zilipa wandaga ni Gadi na Asheli. Awa welekelwagwa uko Mesopotamia.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobo aitaga kwa ise Isaka, uko Mamle, hagihi na Hebuloni, uko wandaga wakekala Ibulahimu na Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka ekalaga miaka gana na milongo mnane, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />niyo abanika akanda adalahalise, ivo wanawe we kilume Esau na Yakobo wammosela msanga.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Esau uyo akwitangwa iviya iviya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau alombaga wavele wa Kikanani, awo Ada mwana Elini uyo Mhiti na Oholibama mwezukuluwe dya Anahi naho mwezukuluwe dya Zibioni Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />iviyaiviya amlombaga Basemati mwana Ishumaeli naho ni lumbudye dya Nebaioti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada niyo amweleka Elifazi na Basemati niyo amweleka Leueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />na Oholibama niyo amweleka Jeushi na Jalamu na Kola. Esau awelekaga awa woseni mwe isi ya Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Niyo Esau awaguha wakaziwe na wanawe we kike na kilume, na want'hu wose wa mwe nyumba yakwe, hamwenga no ugoli wakwe wose apatile mwe isi ya Kanani, niyo aita kwe isi nt'huhu, hale na nduguye Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Ahalawaga kwaviya isi idya nawakekala na Yakobo, heikawakint'ha, kwaviya wandaga na mafyo makulu ya udimi, naivo hawakadaha kwikala wose hamwenga. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Niyo Esau akwikala kwe isi ya vigulu ikwitangwa Seili. Zina tuhu dya Esau niye Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Esau, awo wandaga wakale wa Waedomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Esau elekaga mwanawe ywa kilume kwa mkaziwe Ada na kumwink'ha zina niye Elifazi naho niyo amweleka Leuli kwa mkaziwe Basematithi. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elifazi elekaga wana kilume washano, awo ni Temani na Omali na Zefo na Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Iviyaiviya Elifasi elekaga mwana kilume akwitangwa Amaleki kwa Timna uyo andaga mwuwele ywakwe. Awa nawo wezukulu wa Ada andaga mkaza Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Lueli elekaga wana kilume wane, nawo ni Nasani na Zela na Shama na Miza. Awa wandaga wezukulu wa Basemathi uyo andaga mkaza Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Mkaziwe mtuhu ywa Esau uyo Oholibama, mwana kike ywa Anahi na mwezukulu wa Sibeoni elekaga wana kilume watatu, Jeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Awa nawo welekwa wa Esau wendile watemi wa makabila ye hengi. Cheleko cha Elifasi mwana ywa nk'hongo ywa Esau, nuko alaile mtemi Temani na mtemi Omali na mtemi Zefa na mtemi Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />na mtemi Kola na mtemi Gatamu na mtemi Amaleki. Awo wose wandaga ni welekwa wa Ada uyo andaga mkaza Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Na kwa Lueli mwana ywa Esau, nuko walawile watemi awa, mtemi Nahati na mtemi Zala na mtemi Shama na mtemi Miza. Awa woseni wandaga welekwa wa Besemathi mkaza Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Awa nawo watemi walaile kwa welekwa wa Oholiboma mkaza Esau uyo andile mwana kike ywa Anahi, mtemi Yeushi na mtemi Yalamu na mtemi Kola. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Awo ni wana wa Esau naho awa nawo wandile watemi wa Makabila aya yose welekwa wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Seili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Awakaya awenye we isi ya Edomu, nawapangana mwe makabila yawalawile kwa Seili uyo andaga ywa kabila dya Waholi. Ivo walawaga kwa Lotani na Shobali na Zibioni na Anahi, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />na Dishoni na Ezeli na Dishani. Wana awa wa Seili wandaga nawo watemi we isi ukwo Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotani andaga niye mkale ywa Holi na Hemani. Uyo Lotani andaga na lumbudye akwitangwa Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Shobali andaga niye mkale ywe zink'holo za wakina Alavani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Zibioni elekaga wana kilume waidi, Aya na Anahi. Uyu Anahi ni yudya abunk'hulaga zin'choko za mazi ye moto mdya mwe nyika, umwo andaga akadima zimp'hunda za ise. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Wana wa Anahi ni Dishoni na oholibama uyo andaga mkale ywe zink'holo za Hemdani na Eshibani na Itilani na Kelani. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Anahi iviya iviya andaga na mwanawe ywe kike etangagwa Oholiboma.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Ezeli andaga niye mkale ywe zink'holo za Bilihani na Zaavani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Dishani andaga niye mkale ywe zink'holo zawe, Uzi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Awa nawo wandile watemi wa Waholiti, mwe isi ya Edomu, mtemi Latani na mtemi Shobali na mtemi Zibioni na mtemi Anahi, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />na mtemi Dishomi na mtemi Ezeli na mtemi Dishani.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maseuta wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Umwo kwandaga hakunati kulaila maseuta yoyose mwe Izilaili, awa nawo wandaga maseuta mwe isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana Beoli andaga seuta ywa Edomu, naho zina dyo mzi wakwe wandaga Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela eze abanike Jobabu mwana Zela kulawa Bozila niye auguhaga useuta. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu eze abanike, Hushamu kulawa kwe isi ya Watemani auguhaga useuta. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu eze abanike, Hadadi mwana Bedadi auguhaga useuta, mzi wakwe mkulu wandaga ni Avithi. Uyu niye awatowaga na kuwahuma Wamidiani mwe isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi eze abanike, Shamula kulawa Mashileka auguhaga useuta. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samla eze abanike, Sauli kulawa Lehobosi, uko hagihi no mto Efulati auguhaga useuta. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sauli eze abanike, Balihanani mwana wa Akiboli aguhaga useuta. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baal hanani mwana Akiboli eze abanike, Hadadi auguhaga useuta, naho zina dyo mzi wakwe dikanda nidyo Pau. Mkaza Ekiboli andaga Mehetabeli, mwana kivele ywa Matuledi, naho ni mwezukulu ywa Mezahabi.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Esau andaga niye mkale ywe zink'holo izi za Edomu, Timuna na Alivahi na Jeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibamahi na Elahi na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi na Temani na Mibizali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidieli na Ilamu. Kila hadya dikale kabilia idyo, hetangilagwa dizina dya izo zink'holo. Naho wose nawalaila kwa Esau uyo andile mkale ywa Waedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo agendeelaga kwikala mwe isi ya Kanani uko ekalaga ise. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ino niyo isimulizi ya Yakobo ne mp'huga yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yusufu akanda na miyaka mlongo na mfungate, andaga akadima na wanduguze zimbuzi ne zingoto za tati yawe awo wana Biliha na Zilipa, awo wandaga wawele wa ise. Yusufu amwigailaga ise ulosi wa yaihile wa kudamanya wanduguze.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yakobo amuungisaga Yusufu kujink'ha wanawe wose kwaviya amwelekaga umwo andaga kadalahala. Amsumilaga Yusufu nk'hazu nt'hali ina mahambo. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Weze wabunk'hule kugamba tati yawe amuungisa Yusufu kujink'ha woho, wa mwiihiyaga ndugu ywawe niyo yanda hawa kusimwiilanya vedi.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Yusufu alotaga sozi kilo kimwenga, eze awagambile wanduguze isozi iyo, niyo wanduguze wamwiihiya vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Awagambaga, “Tegeelezeni ivo nilotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Suwe chose chandanga kwe nk'honde kika kaka miganda yo uhemba, aaho niyo mganda uwangu wakimala chululu. Miganda iyenyu yauzungulukaga uwangu niyo yafunamila ho uwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Wanduguze niyo wamuuza, “Weye wagamba nowize unde seuta kwetu?” Ivo wagendeelesaga kumwiihiya kwajili ye zisozi zakwe na ayo alongile mwa woho.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Yusufu alotaga sozi nt'huhu niyo awagamba wanduguze, “Hilota sozi nt'huhu. Iyo inilagisa kugamba, zuwa no mnenge ne zint'hondo mlongo na imwenga zininamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Iviya iviya amgambilaga ise isozi iyo, ise niyo amtivila akamgamba, “Sozi yani iyo? Weye wagamba nyokwe na wanduguzo na miye neki kwinamile?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Wanduguze niyo wamuonela finju, mna ise niyo ayaika mwo moyo ayo yose.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu atagwa no kwigalwa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Zuwa dimwenga umwo wanduguze waitaga Shekumu uko wagendaga kudima mafyo ya tati yawe, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Yakobo amgambaga Yusufu, “Naunga wiite Shekemu, kudya wanduguzo wakudimila amafyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yusufu niyo ahitula, “Neniite.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ise niyo agamba, “Uite ukawakaule wanduguzo na amafyo uneva wagima, niyo wauya unigambile.” Ivo ise niyo amtuma kulawa kwe dikolongo dya Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yusufu abulaga Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />niyo anda atwangadika mwe nyika, mnt'hu yumwenga niyo amuona na kumuuza, “Wazungulai?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusufu niyo ahitula. “Nawazungula wandugu zangu wakudimadima. Wadaha kunigambila ukwo weli?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo agamba, “Awa wahalawa kale. Nehiweva wakagamba waita Dotani.” Yusufu niyo awatimila wanduguze niyo awabwiila uko Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Umwo andaga akei kuwabwiila, wamuonaga kwa luhale, niyo waika mzungu ywo kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Wakegambaga, “Kauleni akulota sozi eza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Hayani nekimkomeni niyo cha duula kimba chakwe mwe disima hediina mazi. Nekigambe kugamba kakomwa ni makala mbago. Nekione elo zisozi zakwe nezinde vivihi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Lubeni eze aweve agezaga kumhonya Yusufu kulawa mwo mzungu wawe. Niyo agamba, “Kise kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Nekimduule du mwe disima idi mwe nyika ino, kise kumnyulika.” Alongaga ivo kwa mzungu wa kumhonya kulawa kwawe vileke amvuze kwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yusufu eze abule kwa wanduguze, wamhambulaga ink'hazu yakwe imemile mahambo. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Niyo wamgwila no kumduula mwe disima hediina mazi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Umwo wandile wakadya waonaga fyo dya Waishumaeli wandaga wakalawa Gileadi kuita Misili. Ngamia zawe zenulaga nt'hanu za ubani na zeli na Manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda niyo awagamba wanduguze, “Nekipatei kina mkoma mvuna ywetu no kufisa ukomi uwo? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Nekimtageni kwa Waishumaeli awa. Nekinde hakimkomile, hamwenga na ayo uyu ywetu, ni sakame yetu.” Wanduguze niyo wazumila. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Want'hu wachuuzi wa Wamediani weze wabule aho, wanduguze wamlavaga Yusufu mwe disima no kumtaga kwa vipande va matundu milongo miidi kwa welekwa wa Ishumaeli, niyo waita naye uko Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Lubeni eze auye kwe disima niyo abwiila Yusufu hahali, atatulaga zisuke zakwe kwa kinyulu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Awauiyaga waduguze niyo awagamba, “Mbwanga hakuli! Nenitende vivihi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ivo wachinjaga mbuzi niyo watufika ink'hazu ya Yusufu mwe sakame ye mbuzi. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Niyo waigala ink'hazu idya kwa tati yawe no kumgamba, “Kilogota ink'hazu ino, hiyo ya mwanao ino?”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Tati yawe nakaimanya ink'hazu, niyo agamba, “Kindedi ino ink'hazu ya mwanangu, makala ya kwembago yamkoma. Mwanangu Yusufu, kasabant'hulwa vihendohendo!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yakobo niyo atatula suke zakwe kwa kinyulu, niyo avala suke za gunia. Amhongezelaga mwanawe kwa mazuwa mengi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Wanawe wose wakilume na wakike, wagezaga kumtondowaza mna hazumile kutondowala niyo agamba, “Nilekeni nigendeele kumhongezela mwanagu mpaka mwe dizuwa dyangu dya kubanika.” Ivo niyo agendeela kumhongezela mwanawe Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Mwo lupisi ulo wadya Wamidiani wamtagaga Yusufu kwa Potifa, mkulu yumwenga mwo esueta wa Falao, uyo andaga mkulu ywa wamizi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Mwo lupisi ulo Yuda awalekaga wanduguze na kugenda kwikala na mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Hilahi, mnt'hu uyo ekalaga mwo mzi wa Adulamu. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Uuko, Yuda amuonaga mndele ywa Kikanaani akwitangwa Shua niyo amlomba. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Mndele Shua enulaga ubovu na kweleka mwana kilume. Yuda amwitangaga mwana uyo Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Niyo enula ubovu kaidi no kweleka mwana mtuhu ywa kilume, amwink'haga zina niye Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Enulaga ubovu naho apataga mwana kilume mtuhu, zina dyakwe niye Shela. Lupisi ulo Yuda na mkaziwe wekalaga Akizibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda amlozaga mwanawe ywa nk'hongo we kilume kwa mvele etangagwa Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Mna Eli, mwana ywa nk'hongo ywa Yuda andaga Mwavu hameso ha Zumbe, niyo Zumbe amkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yuda niyo amgamba Onani, nduguye Eli, “Kagone no mfiilwa mkaza nduguyo, ukint'hize yadya yakuungwa mwe kihendo chetu mwa uyo mfiilwa vileke umwelekele wana nduguyo.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Onani amanyaga kugamba, awana hawande wakwe, kwa ivi kila akagona na mkaza nduguye andaga aketiila hasi zimbeyu ze cheleko vileke asekumwelekela nduguye wana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Zumbe helelwe naicho adamanye, ivo niyo akomwa nae. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Yuda niyo amgamba Tamali, mka mwanawe, “Uuye kwa iso, ukekale uuko iivo umfiilwa mpaka mwanangu Shela akule.” Alongaga ivo kwaviya ogohaga sema mwanawe akakomwa enga viya wanduguze wakomigwe. Tamali niyo auya kwawe.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Lupisi lutali lwize lwomboke, Shua mkaza Yuda niyo abanika. Yuda eze ibinde lupisi lo kumhongezela mkaziwe, yehe na mbwiyaye Hilahi ywa Adulamu, waitaga Timnahi, uko zingoto zakwe Yuda nezikakant'higwa mazoya. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Mnt'hu yumwenga amgambilaga Tamali kugamba ise vyala naakaita Timnahi, kwo kukant'ha zingoto zakwe mazoya. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Tamali niyo ahambula zisuke zo ufiilwa ziya availe, niyo agubika uso wakwe ne kitambala, no kwikala hasi he nk'hili yo mzi wa Enaimu, mzi umwe sila ikuita Timnahi. Nakatenda ivo kwaviya abunk'hulaga kugamba Shela mwana Yuda nakakula kale mna halozigwe kunda mgosiwe.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda eze amuone, aonaga kugamba yudya andaga pamp'he, kwaviya agubikaga uso wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Ivo haheina kumanya kugamba yudya andaga mka mwanawe, ambasaga niyo amgamba, “Naunga nigone na weye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Yudya mvele niyo amhitula, “Nna kuzumila nounink'hei?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda niyo amhitula, “Nohwink'he mbuzi kulawa mwe difyo dyangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Nevidahike uneva una niikila lahani kint'hu chochose mpaka aho ukeza kunik'ha imbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Niyo amuuza, “Hwink'hei inde lahani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Niyo ahitula, “Nink'he iyo imp'hete yako ne sigi yakwe, hamwenga na iyo ingoda unanayo.” Yuda niyo amwink'ha uyo mvele ivo vint'hu, niyo akugona naye, niyo uyo mvele enula ubovu kwa Yuda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamali auyaga kaya, niyo ahambula kitambala icho akegubike mwo mtwi no kuvala naho suke zo ufiilwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda amtumaga Hilahi mbwiyaye egale imbuzi no kuvuza viya vint'hu aikile lahani kwa yudya mvele, mna Hilahi nakadunduga kumuwona. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Agezaga kuwauza want'hu wa Enaimu, “Ekuhi yudya pamp'he andaga aha he sila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Niyo wamhitula, “Hahandile na pamp'he yeyose aha.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Hilahi auyaga kwa Yuda niyo amgamba, “Himuone. Naho want'hu wa uko wanigamba hakwandile mbwitu na pamp'he yeyose uko.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda niyo agamba, “Leka aviguhe ivint'hu ivo. Kise kuunga kusekigwa ni want'hu. Nehiungisa kumliha mna kudunduga kumuona.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Miezi mitatu ize yomboke, want'hu niyo wakumgamba Yuda, “Haluse Tamali mka mwanao kanda pamp'he, naho mwo upamp'he uwo kenula ubovu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda niyo asigiila, “Mlaveni kuse naho okigwe moto abanike.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Aho andile akegalwa kuse, egalaga ulosi kwa ise vyala, “Miye nna ubovu wa mnt'hu mta ivint'hu ivi. Sinya ukaule kugamba niani mta imp'hete ino ne isigi yakwe, ne ingoda ino.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda avibunk'hulaga niyo agamba, “Tamali mkindedi kunijink'ha miye. Miye hidamanye vedi kwaviya himlozile kwa mwanagu Shela.” Yuda hagonile mbwitu na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Ize ibule Tamali aunga kweleka, neioneka kugamba Tamali neeleke mapasa. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Umwo andaga akengila nyumba, mwana yumwenga alavaga mkono wakwe kuse, umnk'hunga niyo amfunga luzigi lwi nk'hundu niyo agamba, “Uyu niye akongile kwelekwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Mna niyo auvuza umkono kundani, miyawe niyo asunguza kwelekwa. Yudya mnk'hunga niyo agamba, “Nii kukup'huka!” Ivo niyo zina dyakwe etangwa Pelizi. Nuko kugamba, “Kukup'huka.” <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Nduguye niyo elekwa no luzi lwi nk'hundu mo mkono, niyo wamwink'ha zina niye Zela. Nuko kugamba, ung'azi wink'hundu wa mtondo, (mgingu).<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na Mkaza Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ivo Waishumailia waitaga naye Misili niyo wamtaga kwa Potifa andile mkulu yumwenga mwa vilongozi wa Falao. Naho nakanda mkulu ywa Watowani wamizi. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Zumbe andaga hamwenga na Yusufu, naho amtendaga Yusufu agendeele vedi mwe zimbuli zakwe zose. Ekalaga mwe nyumba yo mkulu ywakwe ywe Kimisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Uyo mkulu nakabunk'hula kugamba Zumbe nakanda hamwenga na Yusufu, naho kamtenda agendeele vedi mwe zimbuli zakwe zose naakadamanya. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Potifa niyo ambwendesa Yusufu, niyo amwiika kunda mndima ywakwe mwenye. Naho kunda mnyamp'hala mwe nyumba yakwe yose, na kila kint'hu kiya andaga nacho. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kukongela aho na kugendeela, Zumbe kwa kombokela kwa Yusufu, aivikilaga nyumba ya yudya Mmisili na kila kint'hu kiya andile nacho mwe nyumba yakwe na kwe nk'honde. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potifa alekelaga kila kint'hu andaga nacho mo ukimalizi wa Yusufu, haheina yehe mwenye kukimaila, kuleka ink'hande yakwe du.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu aumbwagwa vedi naho andaga mbwanga akuwagila, <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />lupisi lumwenga mkaza Potifa akongaga kumunk'hilwa naye na kumlombeza wakagonanye. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Yusufu amlemelaga na kugamba, “Kaula, mkulu kaniika kunda mnyamp'hala ywa kila kint'hu ananacho mwe nyumba. Naho yehe mwenye hakukaula mbuli yeyose idya kwaviya miye ni aha. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Hahali mta udahi mwe nyumba ino enga miye. Mkulu hanilemeze kint'hu chochose mna weye bule, kwaviya ywi mkaziwe. Nenidahe vivihi kudamanya usavu no wavu hameso ha Mnungu?”<verse eid="GEN 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Hamwenga na kugamba uyo mvele ambwedesaga na kumhembeleza Yusufu kila zuwa, Yusufu hagezile kugona naye.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Mna zuwa dimwenga umwo Yusufu aitaga kwe nyumba akadamanye ndima zakwe, hekwiina mtumwa yeyose. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Yudya mvele amgwilaga Yusufu mwe suke akamgamba, “So kigonanye!” Mna Yusufu anyilikilalaga kuse no kumwasila isuke mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Yudya mvele eze aone kugamba Yusufu kamwasila isuke na kunyilika kuse, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />awetangaga wandima wa mwe nyumba na kuwagamba, “Kauleni! Muibulania uyu kigailwe ni mnumangu he nyumba akigela soni. Keza kwe chumba kwangu niyo aunga anikakalise, mna higuta lukunga. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Eze eve haguta niyo anyilikia kuse, mna kanasila isuke yakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Yudya mvele aiikaga isuke idya mpaka hadya mgosiwe aho auyaga kaya. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Niyo amgambila mgosiwe imbuli idya, “Muibulania uyu mtumwa umwigale aha, kengila kwe chumba changu no kinisezigila. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Mna nize nigute lukunga nakanyilika kuse no kunasila isuke yakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Ivo yudya mkulu ywa Yusufu eze eve ivo mkaziwe naakamgambila, “Ivi nivo mndima ywakwo anitendile.” Mkulu uyo niyo ywa Yusufu afilisaga maya. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Yusufu agelagwa kwe divugailo kudya wavugailwa wa seuta wandaga wakavugailwa, niyo Yusufu ekala uuko. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Mna Zumbe andaga hamwenga na Yusufu, nakumwambiza mpaka kamtende aungiswe ni mkulu ywe divugailo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Amwiikaga Yusufu kunda mkulu ywa wavugailwa wose, naho niyo anda mnyamp'hala ywa kila kint'hu nekikadamanyika kwe divugailo. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Uyo mkulu ywe divugailo hakakaula kint'hu chochose kiya naka kimaila Yusufu, kwaviya Mnungu andaga hamwenga na Yusufu, niyo amtenda agendeele vedi kwa kila kint'hu kudya naaka damanya.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Sozi za wavugailwa waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Ize yajike aho wandima waidi wa Falao, uyo akudamanya vint'hu vo kunywa vya seuta na uyo akudamanya vint'hu vo koka wanaicho wabanangaga kwa seuta ywawe. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao awafiilaga maya wandima awo waidi, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />niyo awavugaila mwe divugailo kwe nyumba yo mkulu ywa wamizi, aho aikagwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Wekalisaga mwe divugailo, niyo mkulu ywa wamizi amwika Yusufu kunda mtumwa ywawe naho wandaga mwe divugailo kwa lupisi.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Kilo kimwenga yudya mwamizi we vint'hu vo kunywa, na akudamanya vint'hu vo koka walotaga sozi heziligane. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Aho mtondo Yusufu eze aweziile, aonaga wana wogofi. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Niyo awauza, “Nii dielo mwaoneka kunda na wogofi?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Niyo wahitula, “Kilota sozi, mna kila yumwenga kalota sozi yakwe heviikudahika kuzitambalisa ulosi wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufu niyo agamba, “Nigambileni zisozi zenyu. Ni Mnungu du akuwenk'ha want'hu udahi wa kufyambula sozi.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Yudya mdamanyi we vint'hu vo kunywa amgambilaga Yusufu, “Mwe sozi yangu hiona mzabibu kulongole kwangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />una matambi matatu. Wize ukonge kutuguta niyo mabwali yalaila niyo kwalaila zabibu ziivile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Nenulaga kikombe cha Falao no kuzikamila zizabibu izo mwe kikombe niyo namwink'ha Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusufu niyo agamba, “Uno nuwo ulosi we sozi yako, matambi matatu uyaone ayo ni mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mwa mazuwa ayo matatu, zumbe naakulave mwe divugailo niyo akuvuza mwe ndima yako. No umwink'he naho ikikombe chakwe enga viya noukatenda umwo wandile ukadamanya vint'hu vo kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Mna unikumbukile umwo mbuli zako zikanda zedi kwako. Ukande ywedi kwangu kwa kunitambula hameso ha Falao, nidahe kufosa mwe divugailo idi. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Kwaviya miye hitahigwa kulawa kwe isi ya Waibulania, naho aha Misili hibanange kint'hu kikuleka nigeligwe mwe divugailo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Yudya mwoka mikate eze aone kugamba utapita we sozi ya mdamanyi wa vint'hu vo kunywa ni wedi, amgambaga Yusufu, “Name hilota sozi! Mwe sozi yangu miye nehinula nt'hangulu nt'hatu za mikate mwo mtwi wangu. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mwe nt'hangulu ya kulanga nomnda na vint'hu vi hengi vo kokwa kwaajili ya Falao. Mna madege yandaga yakadya mwe nt'hangulu iyo imwo mtwi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusufu niyo ahitula, “Utapita we sozi yako nu uno, nt'hangulu nt'hatu, ni mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mazuwa matatu kulongole zumbe naakulave kwe divugailo niyo akukant'ha mtwi wako no kutungika mwo mti, madege nayadye ikimba chako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Dize dibule zuwa dya katatu, dyandaga zuwa dya kukumbukila kwelekwa kwakwe Falao, awadamanyilaga fugo wakulu wa wandima wakwe wose, Awalavaga, mwoka mikate mkulu na yudya mwamizi ywakwe mkulu we kudamanya vint'hu vo kunywa, niyo awegala hameso ha wandima wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Niyo amvuza yudya mdamanyi we vint'hu vo kunywa mwe ndima yakwe, <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />mna niyo amnk'hata mtwi na kutungikwa mwo mti yudya mwoka mikate mkulu enga ivo Yusufu awenk'haga utapita we zisozi zawe. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Mna yudya mdamanyi we vint'hu vo kunywa hamkumbukile Yusufu, nakamjala.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu atapita sozi ya Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Miaka miidi ize yomboke. Falao alotaga kugamba kakimala hagihi no mto Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />aho aonaga ng'ombe mfungate zigimbale zikalawa mwo mto no kudya mani mwe ndete. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Naho naonaga ng'ombe nt'huhu mfungate zihile naho zinyalise zikalawa mwo mto Naili, niyo zeza kukimala hagihi ne ziya zigimbale hank'handa yo mto, <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />ng'ombe ziya zinyaile zazidyaga ziya zigimbale, aho Falao enukaga mwe zint'hongo. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Eze agone naho niyo alota kaidi. Aonaga mafundo makulu yedi mfungate yamemile vedi yandaga yahota mwe sina dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Naho akajika yalailaga mafundo matuhu mfungate yanyazigwe na mp'heho yakwe nyika naho masisili. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Yadya mafundo masisili yanyaile niyo yayamela yadya mafundo yamemile vedi. Falao eze enuke mwe zint'hongo abunk'hulaga kugamba andaga akalota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Kwize kunde mtondo Falao andaga na wogofi vitendese, awetangaga wagangana wose wa Misili, na wadya wata umanyi, niyo awagambila zisozi zakwe, mna hakwandile na yeyose adahile kumtapitila zisozi zakwe.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Niho yudya mdamanyi ywe vint'hu vo kunywa, Falao niyo agamba, “Dielo nakumbukila masa yangu. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Hadya wakifiilaga maya suwe wandima wako, miye no mwoka mikate mkulu, wakivugailaga mwe divugailo kwe nyumba yo mkulu ywa wamizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Zuwa dimwenga nekilo chalotaga sozi, kila yumwenga na yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Elo, chandaga naye mwe divugailo mbwanga yumwenga ywa Kiibulania, uyo andaga mtumwa ywa mkulu wa wamizi. Chamgambilaga zisozi zetu niyo akitapitila. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Mbuli zilaila viligane na viya alongile, miye kunivuza mwe ndima yangu, yudya mwoka mikate mkulu naye kumnk'hata umtwi na kumtungika mwo mti.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Falao atumaga want'hu wamwitange Yusufu niyo wasunguza kumleta kwe divugailo. Yusufu eze ajike kupucha zifili, no kusakanya zisuke zakwe, niyo eza hameso ha Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falao niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Hilota sozi, mna hakuli yeyose adahile kunitapitila. Higambilwa kugamba weye wadaha kunitapitila.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusufu niyo amhitula Falao, “Miye hikudaha, mna Mnungu naakwink'he utapita udya ukuunga.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Falao niyo agamba Yusufu, “Hilota kugamba hikimala hank'handa ho mto Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />naonaga ng'ombe mfungate zigimbale zikalawa mwo mto niyo zadya mani. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Niyo zeza ngombe nt'huhu mfungate zinyaile na kusokela. Hinati kuwona ng'ombe zinyaile naho sisili enga izo mwe isi ino ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Niyo zia zing'ombe zisisili zazidya ziya mfungate zigimbale. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Mna hamwenga na kugamba ziwadya weyawe wadya wagimbale, hakwandile na mnt'hu adahile kumanya kugamba ziwadya weyawe wadya wagimbale, kwaviya zoho nezinda no unyazi uudya wa nk'hongo. Aho niyo nenuka.”<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />“Naho niyo nalota kugamba hiona fundo mfungate za mamp'hemba yekale vedi naho yamemile mpuluzi, yakuhota mwe digota dimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Naho niyo zalaila fundo nt'huhu mfungate sisili naho zinyaile ne mp'heho ya kwenyika, <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />ziya fundo mfungate zisisili, niyo zazidya ziya zifundo mfungate izedi. Elo, miye nawagambilaga wagangana zisozi izo mna hakwandile na yeyose adahile kunink'ha utapita wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yusufu niyo amgamba Falao, “Sozi zako zimbili zina utapita umwenga. Mnungu kakugambila kiya akuunga adamanye. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Zing'ombe mfungate zigimbale, ni miaka mfungate. Ne zifundo mfungate izedi, ni miaka mfungate. Utapita we sozi iyo ni umwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ziya zing'ombe mfungate zinyailise, ziya zazitimile ziya zigimbale, na fundo mfungate heziina kint'hu, zinyazigwe ni mp'heho ya kwenyika, idya ni miaka mfungate ya gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Enga ivo hugambile, Mnungu kakulagisa kiya akuunga adamanye. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Nokunde na miaka mfungate ya ulozo mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Akajika aho, nukunde na miaka mfungate ya gumbo, niyo uwo ulozo houkumbukilwe naho. Digumbo idyo nediibanange isi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Msimo wo ulozo houkumbukilwe naho, kwaviya sala ikwiza neinde iihisa. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Sozi yako ivuzagiza nk'hanana mbili naho kwa miliganyizo iligane kulagisa kugamba mbuli ino ilawa kwa Mnungu naho naadamanye mazuwa mageke yakwiza.”<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Naivoelo, Falao, waungwa kusagula mnt'hu mmanyi, mbala umwink'he ande mnyamp'hala ywe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Naho waungwa usagule wambizi watuhu wengi wa mwe isi wakuunga waduganye hant'hu ha shano yo ulozo wose we miaka iyo mfungate ya ulozo. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Waungwa waduganye nk'hande yose mwe mika ino yo ulozo ikwiza no kwiika kindolo hasi ya Falao, kiikwe mwe mizi kwajili ya nk'hande. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Nk'hande iyo neinde mp'handa mkole ye isi ize idigwe mwe miaka mfungate ya gumbo ikwiza mwe isi ya Misili vileke want'hu wase kwiza kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu enk'higwa ukulu mwe isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Ulangilizi alavile Yusufu nouneka kunda wedi hameso ya Falao na vilongozi weyawe wose. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Niyo Falao awagamba vilongozi weyawe, “Hekidahe kupata mnt'hu ywedi enga Yusufu, mnt'hu mta Muye ywa Mnungu mndani mwakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Falao niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Mnungu kakulagisa aya yose, hahali mtu mtuhu mbala naho mmanyi enga weye. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Ni weye noukimaile isi yangu, naho want'hu wangu nawaunge kwiva yadya ukuunga ulonge. Weye niwe nounde mkulu ywa kaidi kulawa miye. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Naho haluse nakusagula kunda mnyamp'hala mwe isi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Falao niyo ahambula imp'hete yakwe ye kiwalo cho useuta mwa kadole kakwe no kumvala Yusufu mwa kadole kakwe. Amvalaga valo dya kiseuta, no kumvala mkufu wa zahabu mwe singo yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao amwink'haga Yusufu digali dyakwe dya kaidi dikuvutwa ni falasi, akwele. Naho wamizi wamlongoelaga Yusufu wakagutiila wakagamba, “Damanyeni sila!” Ivo nivo Yusufu enk'higwe ukulu mkulu mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Falao niyo amgamba, “Miye ni Falao, mnt'hu yeyose mwe Misili asekudamanya kint'hu chochose haheina weye kuzumila.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao amwink'haga Yusufu zina dya Kimisili niye Safenathipanea. Niyo amwink'ha mvele ande mkaziwe mwana Potifela, mlavant'hambiko wo mzi wa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusufu andaga na miaka milongo mitatu aho akongaga kunda hameso ya Falao, niyo akonga kuitalamkila isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Mwe miaka idya mfungate yo ulozo, isi yalozokaga nk'hande vitendese. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yusufu awatendaga wandima waduganye ink'hande yose mwe miaka iyo mfungate yo ulozo, niyo aiika vindolo mwe mizi ya Misili. Mwe kila mzi aikaga kindolo cha nk'hande kulawa mwe zink'honde zimgihi.<verse eid="GEN 41:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yusufu aikaga kindolo cha nk'hande nyingi vitendese, enga msanga we bahali, niyo adunduga kuuhima.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Miaka ye digumbo ikei mpaka, Yusufu apataga wana waidi wa kilume kwa mkaziwe Asenethi. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusufu niyo agamba, “Mnungu kanitenda nijale makunt'ho yangu yose na wandugu zangu.” Ivo niyo amwink'ha zina mwanawe ywa nk'hongo niye Manase. Nuko kugamba, “Mtende ajale.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Naho agambaga, “Mnungu kanink'ha mwana mwe isi ya makunt'ho yangu.” Ivo niyo amwink'ha zina mwana ywa kaidi niye Efulaimu, Nuko kugamba, “Kwink'higwa wana.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Miaka mfungate yo ulozo mwe isi ya Misili yasilaga, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />niyo yakonga miaka mfungate ye digumbo, enga viya Yusufu alongaga. Kwandaga na gumbo mwe ziisi zint'huhu zose, mna kwandaga na nk'hande mwe isi ya Misili yose. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Gumbo dize dikonge mwa want'hu wa Misili, niyo want'hu awo wakonga kumwiila Falao awenk'he nk'hande. Ivo niyo awagamba waite kwa Yusufu, nawo niyo watenda enga ivo awagambile. <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Gumbo dyandaga diihise no kwenela mwe isi yose, Yusufu niyo akomola vindolo vose, niyo awatagila nk'hande want'hu wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Want'hu kulawa mwe si nt'huhu wezaga Misili kugula nk'hande kwa Yusufu, kwandilisaga na gumbo kila hant'hu.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Wanduguze dya Yusufu wagenda kusuma Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Ivo Yakobo eze eve kugamba Misili iyuko nk'hande, awagambaga wanawe, “Nyuwe mwikala du aha mkakekaula? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Evaga kugamba Misili iyuko nk'hande, iteni mkagule nk'hande kinase kuzehuka ne digumbo.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Ivo wanduguze mlongo dya Yusufu niyo waita kwo kugula nk'hande uko Misili. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Mna Yakobo hamlekile Benjamini nduguye dya Yusufu aite nawo, kwaviya ogohaga kugamba sema analailwe ni kint'hu kihile.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Wana Yakobo wabulaga Misili hamwenga na want'hu watuhu kokugula nk'hande, kwaviya Kaanani nako kwandaga na gumbo. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Yusufu niye andaga mkulu we isi ya Misili, niye andaga akawatagila nk'hande want'hu we ziisi zose. Ivo wanduguze wezaga niyo wamwinamila hameso hakwe, nevihanga vawe wakaviika hasi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yusufu eze awaone wanduguze, awakombaganyaga, mna niyo aketenda enga hawamanyize. Niyo awauza kwa kuwafank'hila, “Nyuwe mlawa hii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Niyo wahitula, “Suwe kilawa Kaanani kiza kugulala nk'hande.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Hamwenga na kugamba Yusufu awamanyaga wanduguze, woho mna hawammanyaga. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Akumbukilaga isozi alotaga mwa woho niyo agamba, “Nyuwe mwi wapelembi, mwiza kukaula hant'hu he isi yetu haheina wamizi mwe isi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Niyo wamhitula, “Hivo ivo zumbe. Suwe watumwa wako kiza kugula nk'hande. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Suwe chose kindugu naho tatiyetu yumwenga. Kiwant'hu wedi hiyo wapelembi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yusufu niyo awagamba, “Bule! Nyuwe mwiza kukaula hant'hu haheina wamizi wedi mwe isi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Niyo wagamba, “Suwe watumwa wako chandaga mlongo na waidi, wana wa mnt'hu yumwenga ekelaga mwe isi ya Kanani. Mvuna ywetu ekaya hamwenga na tatiyetu, yumwenga ywetu naye abanikaga.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yusufu niyo awagamba, “Hivo nilongile. Nyuwe mwi wa pelembi. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Ivi nivo nomgezigwe. Nakelisa kwa zina dya Falao, kugamba homhalawe aha mpaka mvuna ywenyu mdodo eze aha. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Msigiileni yumwenga ywenyu akeze naye aha, nyuwe msigale nomvugailwe naho mgezigwe milosi yenyu uneva ni ya kindedi. Nakelisa naho kwa zina dya Falao, nyuwe mwi wapelembi!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Niyo awaguha wose no kuwavugaila kwe divugailo kwa mazuwa matatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu Yusufu niyo awagamba, “Kwaviya miye namogoha Mnungu, damanyeni aya mnde wagima. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Uneva ni wahuilwa, yumwenga ywenyu naasigale mwe divugailo, wamwenga waguhe nk'hande wegaile zimp'huga zenyu, zinase kuzehuka. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Naho mwaungwa kwiza naye mvuna ywenyu kwangu, milosi yenyu ikaulwe ikindedi chakwe mnase mna komigwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Wazumila kudamanya ivo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Niyo wakegamba woho kwa woho, “Ikindedi chasulumizwa kuliha yadya chamtendelaga mvuna ywetu. Chaonaga ivo andaga akadumangila, naivo andaga akaunga kimwambize kwajili yo ugima wakwe, mna suwe hachamtegelezaga, naivi nivo vikuleka chasusulumizwa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Lubeni niyo agamba, “Namigambilagani kugamba msekumtendela vihile mbwanga, mna nyuwe hamwanivile. Haluse sakame yakwe yaungwa kiilihe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Nawanda hawamanyize kugamba Yusufu naaka weva yadya nawakalonga, kwaviya naakalonga nawo kwa kwombokela mtapita. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yusufu niyo ahituka na kulava masozi. Eze ande na udahi wo kulonga naho. Niyo amsagula Simioni, no kulagiza akakwe mp'hingu iivi waka kaula.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanduguze dya Yusufu wauya Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Niyo Yusufu alagiza wandima wakwe wamemeze nk'hande mwe mifuko ya wanduguze, naho kila yumwenga avuzilwe matundu yo kuguila nk'hande mwe mfuko wakwe, na mp'hamba. Niyo wadamanyilwa ivo vose. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Niyo wadya wanduguze niyo wakweza nt'hwika zawe ze nk'hande mwe zimp'hunda niyo waita. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Weze wabule hant'hu hamwenga na kuika nt'hulwe vileke wagone, yumwenga ywawe aloholaga mfuko wakwe vileke aink'he nk'hande mp'hunda yakwe, ehelagwa kuwona matundu ye mwo mfuko wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Niyo awagamba wanduguze, “Matundu yangu yavuzigwa, kauleni ye mwe digunia dyangu.” Niyo wafa chevu, wakakehitukila wakazingiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Wakagamba, “Ni kint'hu chani iki Mnungu akidamanyile?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Weze wauye kwa tati yawe Yakobo, niyo wamgambila yose yawalaile wakagamba, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Mkulu ywa Misili kakikwank'hila, niyo akivugaila akagamba suwe nekikapelemba isi yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Niyo chamgamba, suwe hiyo wapelembi kiwant'hu wahuwilwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Suwe kiwana mlongo na waidi, suwe wose tatiyetu yumwenga. Ndugu yetu yumwenga abanikaga, mvuna ywetu mdodo eyuko Kanaani, ekala na tatiyetu. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Yudya mkulu niyo akigamba, ivi nivo nenimanye kugamba nyuwe mwi wahuwilwa. Mwaseni ndugu yenyu yumwenga aha, watuh muwegaile sumo ukwo kwenyu kaya. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Nasileni uyo ndugu ywenyu mdodo, ivo neni manye kugamba nyuwe hiyo wapelembi mna mwi want'hu wahuwilwa. Naivo nenimvuze kwenyu, naho nomdahe kwikala aaha, no kudamanya uchuuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Umwo wandaga wakakupula magunia yawe ye nk'hande, waonaga vifuko va matundu mwe kila mfuko wa kila yumwenga. Weze waone matundu ayo, wose hamwenga na tati yawe, wogohaga. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Niyo tati yawe awagamba, “Nyuwe mnazila mwanangu? Yusufu hahali na Simioni naye hahali, naho mwaunga mumguhe Benjamini naye. Aya yose yanilaila miye!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Ivo Lubeni amgamba ise, “Uneva hina mvuzile Simioni kwako, weye uwakome wanangu waidi. Nihuwile kugamba nenimdime naho nenimvuze kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Yakobo niyo amgamba, “Hamkudaha kuita na mwanangu, nduguye kabanika, kasigala yehe du ekedu. Uwihi wowose una mlaila mwe sila, nomleke habanika kwa usungu mkulu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Wanduguze dya Yusufu waita na Benjamini uko Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Gumbo dyagendelaga kunda kali mwe isi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Mp'huga ya Yakobo ize ibinde nk'hande yalawaga Misili, tati yawe niyo awagamba, “Uyeni naho Misili mkakiguile nk'hande ludodo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Mna Yuda niyo amgamba tati yawe, “Yudya mnt'hu kakikanya kugamba, kisekuita kwakwe uneva hakinandile naye ndugu ywetu mdodo. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Uneva anazumila kiitanye na ndugu ywetu, nekiite kokugula nk'hande. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Mna hunazumile, hekiite kwaviya yudya mnt'hu kakigamba asekukiona naho hakina itile naye.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Nii mnigaila makunt'ho aya kwa kumgamba uyo mnt'hu mna ndugu ywenyu mtuhu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Niyo wahitula, “Yudya mnt'hu naakakiuzisa zimbuli ze mp'huga yetu, akagamba, tati yenyu akei mgima? Mna ndugu ywenyu mtuhu? Naswe nekimhitula viligane ne miuzile yakwe. Nekikamanya vivihi kugamba naakigambe kiite na ndugu ywetu uko?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda niyo amgamba ise, “Nnekele niite no mvuna ywetu, kiite kisunguze kikagule nk'hande, kinase kuzehuka. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Naande mwo ukaulizi wangu mwenye. Nouniuze miye uneva hina mvuzile kwako, k'halalizi neinde mwangu mwo ugima wose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Wandile hachekalise hegu nekiita na kuuya nk'hanana mbili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Niyo Izilaeli tati yawe awagamba, uneva niivo tendeni ivi, geleni vint'hu vedi va mwe isi mwa magunia yenyu, mmwigaile geleko uyo mkulu. Mwigaileni mavuta ya nk'wazu ludodo na viuki na ubani na mavuta ya mhemp'he na nk'hungu na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Guheni matundu yakuguwila nk'hande, naho msekujala kuvuza amatundu yaikigwe mwe mifuko yenyu. Vadahika yagelagwa hivo. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mguheni ndugu ywenyu msunguze kuuya kwa uyo mnt'hu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Mnungu ywo udahi naawenk'heni kuonelwa mbazi hameso ya uyo mnt'hu vileke awak'heni Benjamini hamwenga na uyu ndugu yenyu mtuhu. Mna uneva wanagu neniwaze enga ivo, goja wage.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ivo wadya want'hu niyo waguha digeleko diya, hamwenga na kongezela nk'hanana mbili ya matundu yekuguila ink'hande, hamwenga na Benjamini. Ivo niyo waita mpaka Misili, niyo wakimala hameso ya Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yusufu eze amuone Benjamini hamwenga na woho, niyo amgamba mnyamp'hala we nyumba yakwe, “Wegale want'hu awa kwe nyumba yangu, kachinje nyama yambikwe vedi, kwaviya want'hu awo neninde nawo ho ludyo lwa nomsi.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Yudya mtumwa niyo adamanya enga viya Yusufu alongile, niyo awaguha wadya want'hu, no kuwegala kwe nyumba ya Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Umwo wandile wakegalwa kwe nyumba ya Yusufu wogohaga wakagamba, “Kigalwa uku kwaviya matundu yadya yavuzagwa mwa magunia yetu viya nk'hongo. Hauluse aunga akitoe naho akitahe kinde watumwa wakwe, niyo aguha zimp'hunda zetu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Naivo niyo waita henk'hili ye nyumba ya Yusufu niyo walonga na yudya mtumwa mnyamp'hala, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Wakamgamba, “Kaula mkulu, suwe chezaga bosi kikeza kugula nk'hande. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Kize kibule hant'hu chaikile nt'hulwe vileke kigone, chaloholaga magunia yetu, kikaule! Matundu ya kila mnt'hu nayanda mwe kila gunia dya kila mnt'hu haheina kuhunguka. Naswe kiyavuza matundu ayo kwako. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Hamwenga na ayo kigala matundu matuhu yo kuguila nk'hande. Mna hakikummanya uyo akivuzile matundu yetu mwa magunia yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Yudya mtumwa mnyamp'hala niyo ahitula, “Mse kogoha. Mnungu ywenyu, Mnungu ywa tati yenyu, niye ageile matundu ayo mwe magunia yenyu. Maliho yenyu nayahokelaga.” Niyo amwink'hiza Simioni, kwawe.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Yudya mtumwa mnyamp'hala niyo awengiza wadya want'hu kwe nyumba ya Yusufu, niyo awenk'ha mazi ya kuhaka iviga vawe, niyo azink'ha nk'hande zimpunda zawe. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Nawaikila lumwe mageleko yawe wamwink'he Yusufu aho neezile nomsi, kwaviya naweva kugamba nawadye hamwenga na yehe. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yusufu ezeeze hakaya, niyo waguha mageleko yawe, wamwink'haga mageleko yawe ayo wamwigailaga kwe nyumba yakwe, niyo wamfunamila. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Awauzaga ugima wawe, niyo agamba, “Tati yenyu mgima, yudya mdala mwanigambilaga? Akei mgima naho ni ywedi?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Niyo wahitula wakagamba, “Mtumwa ywako tati yetu, akei mgima.” Niyo wafika madi no kufunamiza mitwi yawe hasi hameso hakwe.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yusufu aze kaule, niyo amuona nduguye Benjamini mwana nine, niyo agamba, “Uyu nuyo mndugu ywenyu umdodo yudya mwanigambile? Niyo amgamba, uvikilwe ni Mnungu mwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Ahoo Yusufu asunguzaga kuhalawa, kwaviya moyo wakwe wamemaga nkwina mwa nduguye, andaga hagihi na kuila. Engilaga kwe chumba chakwe niyo aiila uuko. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Eze ibinde kuila no kuuhaka kihanga chakwe mazi, afosaga kuse akaketogeza moyo, niyo asigiila nk'hande iletigwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Niyo wampasila Yusufu hakwehakwe, wanduguze nawo hawehawe, wadya Wamisili wandile wakadya naye, nawo wapasilwagwa hawehawe, kwaviya yandaga ni mwiko kwa Wamisili kudya hamwenga na Waibulania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Wanduguze Yusufu nawekala hameso hakwe viligane na malika yawe, kukongela umkulu mpaka umdodo. Nawo wehelagwa weze waone ivo wekale. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Nk'hande neikapasigwa kulawa he meza ya Yusufu, mna Benjamini apasilagwa nk'hanana shano ya idya ya wanduguze. Ivo wadyaga no kunywa kwa kinyemi hamwenga na yehe Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu awageza wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Niyo Yusufu amgamba yudya mnyamp'hala ywe nyumba yakwe, “Memeza nk'hande mwa magunia ya want'hu awa, kila yumwenga viligane no ludole lwakwe lwo kwinula, naho yavuze matundu ya kila yumwenga mwe digunia dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Naho gela ikikombe ichangu cho kunyweela mwe digunia dya uyo mdodo hamwenga na matundu yakwe yo kuguila ink'hande.” Niyo atenda enga ivo asigiilwe ni Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Mtondo kwize kutandazuke, wandugu wadya walekelagwa kuita hamwenga ne zimp'hunda zawe. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Weze wagende lupisi ludodo kulawa ho mzi, Yusufu niyo amtuma mnyamp'hala ywe nyumba yakwe, “Sunguza watimile want'hu awa, naho una wabwiila, wagambe, Nii mwaliha wiihi kwo uwedi? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nii mkabawa ikikombe cho mkulu ywangu icho akunyweela no kusinyila mnamulo? Mdamanya kint'hu kiihile.”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Yudya mtumwa eze awabwiile awagambilaga yadya alagizwe ni Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Niyo wamgamba, mkulu, “Nivo wagaaze? Chakelisa kugamba, hakidamanye kint'hu enga icho! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Weye kumanya kugamba nekivuza amatundu yadya chaitaga nayo uko Kanani, yadya yandaga mwa magunia yetu. Chadaha naho vivihi kubawa matundu hegu zahabu kulawa kwe nyumba ya mkulu ywako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Mkulu, uneva kinaonwa mwe yumwenga ywetu, naakomwe naho suwe kisigale nekinde watumwa wa zumbe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Niyo awagamba, “Ni vedi ivo mlongile, yeyose naabwiilwe nuyo naande mtumwa ywangu, nyuwe msigale nomlekelwe mwite.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Niyo kila mnt'hu asunguza kuseleza digunia dyakwe hasi na kila mnt'hu aloholaga digunia dyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Yudya mtumwa akizungulaga ikikombe, kukongela kwo mkulu mpaka kwo mdodo mwa wose. Ikikombe niyo cha bwiilwa mwe digunia dya Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Niyo walwebula zisuke zawe kwa kinyulu, niyo kila yumwenga atwikiza imp'hunda yakwe no kuuya kwo mzi.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Umwo Yuda na wanduguze wauyaga kwe nyumba ya Yusufu, Yusufu andaga akei aaho. Wamwinamilaga, <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />niyo Yusufu awagamba, “Mdamanya mbuli yani ino? Hammanyize mnt'hu enga miye nadaha kusinya mnamulo?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Niyo Yuda agamba, “Kigeeze kwako weye zumbe ywetu? Chaunga kikesunt'he vivihi? Mnungu kaulaviliza wiihi wa watumwa wako, haluse wose kinda watumwa wako, hamwenga na yudya awonwe ne kikombe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Mna Yusufu niyo agamba, “Bule hikudaha kudamanya ivi! Yudya aonwe ne kikombe niye naande mtumwa ywangu. Nyuwe msigalele keitileni kwa utondowazi, kwa tati yenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda alombeza Benjamini alekelwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Niyo Yuda amsogeela Yusufu no kumgamba, “Chakulombeza, mkulu, nnekele nilonge na weye ludodo. Usekunda na maya na miye, weye ni enga seuta mwenye.” <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Mkulu, wakiuzaga, uneva kinanaye tatiyetu hegu ndugu ywetu mtuhu? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Naho chakuhitulaga, kinanae Tati yetu eli mdala na mvuna ywetu amweleke kwo udala wakwe. Mkuluwe ywa yudya mbwanga kabanika, naho ni yehe mwana ekedu asigale kwa nine, naho ise amuungisa. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Mkulu nokukigamba watumwa wako, kimwigale uyo mbwanga vileke wize umwuone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Naswe niyo chakuhitula mkulu, hakudaha kumwasa ise, kwaviya anamwasa uyo ise adaha akabanika. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Niyo wakigamba watumwa wako, hamna seele naye ndugu yenyu umdodo homuuone uso wangu.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Umwo chauyaga kaya kwa mndima ywako, tati yetu chammgambilaga ivo weye walongaga. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Niyo tatiyetu akigamba kiuye kaidi kikagule nk'hande ludodo. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Suwe niyo chamhitula, kikamgamba, ‘Hakikudaha kuita uko. Nekiite uneva nekindanye na mvuna ywetu, kwaviya hakikudaha kumuwona yudya mkulu uneva hakinandile naye.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Niyo mndima ywako tatiyetu akigamba, ‘Mmanya kugamba mkazangu Laheli kanelekela wana waidi du. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Yumwenga mwa awo kanihalala, niyo nagamba, kwavovose kalwebulwa ni makala ya kwe mbago, kwaviya himuone ivo ahalawaga aha. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Uneva mnamguha mwana uyo naho, nakulumizwa uko, nomnimose msanga nkanda mdala mta kinyulu.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Yuda agendeelaga kulonga. “Naho mkulu, uneva hinauiye naye mvuna ywetu kwo mtumwa ywako tatiyetu naabanike. Kwaviya wikazi wakwe wigamila mwo wikazi wa uyu mvuna ywetu, naho kadalahalisa, kinamgela kinyulu chadaha kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />Uneva nnauya kaya haheina uyu mbwanga kunda naye, aho akeza kuwona hakinanaye mvuna ywetu, taiyetu naabanike. Kwaviya wikazi wakwe wegamila mwa uyu mbwanga naho ni mdala, kinamwigaila mbuli za usungu nekimkome. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ivo miye nakelavaga kwa tate kugamba ugima wa mwana uyu nounde mwa miye, uneva hina uiye naye mvuna ywetu kwako, neninde ywa kukalalizwa hameso ya tate wikazi wangu wose. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Kwaivo zumbe, nakulombeza, miye nenisigale aaha ninde mtumwa ywako, hant'hu ha uyu mvuna ywetu, umlekele mvuna ywetu auye kaya hamwenga na wanduguze. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Neni uye vivihi kwa tate haheina kunda hamwenga na mvuna ywetu? Nogoha kuwona maihi yakuunga yamlaile tate.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu akelavanya kwa wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Yusufu adundugaga kufinyiliza hameso ya wandima wakwe niyo alagiza wafose kuse. Naivo hakwandaga na yeyose umwo Yusufu akaketambalisa kwa wanduguze. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ailaga kwa izwi kulu vilekile Wamisili weve, niyo mbuli iyo yevika kwe nyumba ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Niho Yusufu awagambaga wanduguze, “Ni miye Yusufu. Tate akei mgima?” Wanduguze wadundugaga kumhitula kwaviya wengilwagwa ni wogofi umwo waka kaulana. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Naho Yusufu niyo awagamba, “Nisogeeleni hagihi.” Watendaga ivo awagambilaga, Yusufu niyo awagamba, “Ni miye ndugu ywenyu Yusufu yudya mwamtagaga uku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Haluse mse kunda na kinyulu no kukekalaliza wenye kwa kunitaga uku Misili. Mnungu mwenye niye anitumile niwalongoele vileke nikombole wikazi wa want'hu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Uno ni mwaka wa kaidi du wa gumbo mwe isi, iyuko miaka mituhu mishano kulongole, hokunde na kulima hegu kuvuna. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Mnungu kanigala niwalongoeleni vileke awahonye kwa kwehela kuwona kugamba nyuwe ne cheleko chenyu mwasigala wagima. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Elo hiyo nyuwe mnigale uku, mna ni Mnungu. Yehe kanitenda kunda mlangilizi ywa Falao na mkulu ywe nyumba yakwe na kilongozi mkulu mwe isi yose ya Misili.”<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Msunguze kuuya kwa tate mkamgambe, ivi nivo akulonga mwanao Yusufu, “Mnungu kanitenda kilongozi mkulu ywa Misili yose, sunguza wize. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Noukekale mwo mkoa wa Gosheni, naho nounde hagihi na miye, weye na wanao na wezukuluwo na mafyo yako, hamwenga na wadimi wako na vose unanavo. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Unekala Gosheni, nohulele kwaviya yeza miaka mituhu mishano ye digumbo naivo weye hamwenga ne nyumba yako yose na vose mnanavo mnase kuzehuka.”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Yusufu agendeelaga kulonga, “Naho haluse nyuwe wenye mniona na weye ndugu yangu Benjamini kuniona kugamba ni miye Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mkamgambile tate ivo nili na udahi aha Misili, naho mgambileni yose yadya myaone. Sunguzeni kamwigaleni uku.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Yusufu niyo amkumbatila nduguye Benjamini, niyo akonga kuila, Benjamini naye niyo amkumbatila nduguye uku naye akaila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Uku akagendeela kuila, awakumbatilaga wanduguze awatuhu na kuwanonela. Akajika aho wanduguze wakonga kusimuila naye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Mbuli izo zize zimanyike kwe nyumba ya Falao kugamba wanduguze dya Yusufu weza, Falao na wandima wakwe weleleswagwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Falao niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Wagambe wanduguzo watwike mizigo mwe zimp'hunda zawe wauye Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Waite wakamguhe tati yawe, ne zimp'huga zawe, weze aha. Neniwenk'he hant'hu hedi mwe Misili, nawo nawande na vint'hu va kuwakint'ha kwa wikazi wawe mwe isi. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Naho wagambile kugamba, waguhe magali yakuvutwa na falasi aha Misili yo kuwaguhila wakembe wawe, hamwenga na wavele wawe na tati yawe, weze aha. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Mse kwangadikila viya mnanavo uko, kwaviya ayedi yose ya Misili nayande yenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Wana wa Yakobo watendaga enga viya walagizwe. Yusufu awenk'haga magali na mp'hamba enga ivo seuta alongile. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Yusufu awenk'haga kila yumwenga ywawe suke mp'ya za kwasakanya, mna niyo amwink'ha Benjamini masawa magana matatu na suke shano mp'ya za kwasakanya. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Ivia ivia nakamwigaila ise vint'hu vedi va Kimisili kwaajili ya nt'hambo yakwe ya kuuya. Vitwikigwe mwe zimp'hunda mlongo, na mp'hunda nt'huhu mlongo zitwikigwe uhule na mikate na mp'hamba nt'huhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Niyo alagana na wanduguze, umwo wandile wakahalawa awagambaga, “Mse kukwank'hilana mwe sila!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Wahalawaga Misili, no kuuya kwa tatiyawe ukwo kwe isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Niyo wamgamba tati yawe, “Yusufu akei mgima! Ikindedi niye kilongozi mkulu ywe isi yose ya Misili!” Yakobo niyo etukisa mna hahuwile.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Mna weze wamgambile zimbuli zose alongile Yusufu no kuwona magali egailwe ni Yusufu vileke yamguhe kuita Misili, moyo wa Yakobo tati yawe watondowalaga. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Haluse himanya kugamba mwanangu Yusufu akei mgima! Neniite haonane naye iivi nikei kubanika.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ne mp'huga yakwe wasamila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Yakobo afunganyaga kila kiya andaga nacho, no kuita Belisheba, niyo amlavila nt'hambiko Mnungu ywa Isaka uyo andaga ise. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Naho Mnungu alongaga na Yakobo mwe sozi mwe kilo niyo etenga, “Yakobo, Yakobo!” Yakobo niyo etika, “Woe.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Niyo agamba, “Miye ni Mnungu, Mnungu ywa Iso. Use kogoha kuita Misili, kwaviya nohutende isi nk'hulu kudya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Miye mwenye neniite hamwenga na weye uko Misili, naho nenivivuze vyeleko vako mwe isi iino, naho Yusufu mwenye naakugome ameso yako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Yakobo niyo ahalawa Belisheba, naho wanawe wamwinulaga tatiyawe, na wakembe wawe na wavele wawe na kuwakweza mwa magali yadya Falao awenk'hile. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Waguhaga ne mifugwa yawe, na vint'hu vose wapataga mwe isi ya Kanani, niyo waita Misili. Niyo Yakobo aguha imp'huga yakwe yose, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />wanawe we kilume na wezukuluwe we kilume na wanawe wekike na wezukulu we kike na welekwa wakwe wose no kwiita nawo wose uko Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aya nayo mazina ya wana wa Yakobo wengilaga Misili, Lubeni mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />na wana wa Lubeni ni Hanoki na Palu na Heziloni na Kami. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Wana Simioni ni awa, Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Sauli, uyo andaga mwana ywo mvele ywe Kikanani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Wana Lawi ni awa Geshoni na Kohathi na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Wana Yuda ni awa, Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Mna Eli na Onani wafiilaga uuko Kanaani. Wana wa Pelisi wandaga ni Heziloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />awa nawo wana wa Isakali. Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Wana Zabuloni ni awa, Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Awa nawo wana wa Lea amwelekele Yakobo uko Mesopotamia ikanda ni hamwenga na Dina. Cheleko chose cha Lea ni want'hu milongo mitatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Awa nawo wana wa Gadi. Sefoni na Hagi na Shuni na Esibini na Eli na Elodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Awa nawo wana wa Asheli. Imna na Ishiva na Ishivi na Belia na lumbu dyawe uyo Sela. Wana Belia wandaga Hebel na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Awa ni wana wa Zilipa awo Labani amwink'haga mwanawe Lea, niyo amwelekela Yakobo wana mlongo na mtandatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Laheli amwelekelaga Yakobo wana waidi. Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Uko Misili Asenati mwana Potifa, uyo andaga mlavant'hambiko ywo mzi wa Oni, amwelekelaga Yusufu wana waidi, Manase na Ifulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benjamini awelekaga, Bela na Bekelina Alshebel na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Awa ni wana wa welekwa wa Yakobo na Laheli, kwa hamwenga wandaga mlongo na wane.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dani elekaga mwana yumwenga, naye andaga Hashimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nafutali awelekaga. Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Awa mfungate, ni welekwa wa Yakobo na Biliha, mtumwa mvele, uyo Labani amwink'haga mwanawe Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Uwazilo wa welekwa wa Yakobo wa sakame yakwe mwenye, waitile Misili wandaga milongo mtandatu na mtandatu, haheina kuhanganya wakaza wanawe. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Unawaza hamwenga na wadya wana waidi wa Yusufu awo awelekaga uko Misili, want'hu wose we nyumba ya Yakobo awo waitaga Misili wandaga milongo mfungate.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ne mp'huga yakwe wengila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo amtumaga Yuda amlongoele Yusufu amlongoze sila kwingila Gosheni. Weze wabule mwo mkoa wa Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusufu aguha digali dyakwe dikuvutwa ni falasi niyo aita Gosheni kumhokela ise. Aaho Yusufu eze alawanye hameso ya ise, amkumbatilaga ise kwa lupisi lutali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Yakobo niyo amgamba mwanawe, “Nenife elo haluse, kwaviya hikuona mwa meso kugamba ukei umgima.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yusufu niyo awagamba wanduguze na want'hu wose we nyumba ya ise, “Neniite hamgambile Falao, naho nehamgambe, Wanduguzangu ne mp'huga yose ya tate awo wandaga wakekala kwe isi ya Kanani weza kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Nehamgambile kugamba nyuwe muwadimi wa mafyo, naho mwiza ne zimbuzi ne zingoto ne zin'gombe, na kila kint'hu chenyu. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Falao akeza kuwetangani no kuwauza, ndima yenyu ni ihi? <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Nyuwe nomumgambe, watumwa wako kinda wadimi wa mafyo kukongela udodo wetu hata ivi haluse, enga ivo wakale wetu watendaga. Naivo nomwink'higwe kwikala uko Gosheni.” Yusufu alongaga ivo kwaviya wadimi wose wa ngoto nawakabezwa mwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yusufu aitaga niyo amgamba Falao, “Tate na wandugu zangu hamwenga na mafyo, ne mifugwa yawe, na kila kint'hu chawe, weza kulawa mwe isi ya Kanani, naivi we aha mwo mkoa wa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Naho nakaguha wanduguze washano niyo awegala hameso ya Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao niyo awauza, “Ndima yenyu nyuwe ni ihi?” Niyo wamhitula Falao, “Mkulu, suwe watumwa wako kiwadimi wa ngoto, enga ivo wandaga wakale wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Wamgambaga Falao, “Kiza kwikala watakwiza mwe isi ino, kwaviya, madimo ya watumwa wako hayana ludyo, kwaviya gumbo ditendesa uko Kanani. Elo chakulombeza watumwa wako ukink'he isi ya Gosheni kikale.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Iso na wanduguzo weza kwako, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />naho isi ya Misili imwe mikono yako. Wekaze iso na wanduguzo hant'hu hedi mwe isi, waleke wekale mwo mkowa wa Gosheni. Naho uneva weyuko mwa woho want'hu wamanyi mwa madimo, waike wande wakimalizi wa madimo yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yakobo niyo amguha ise no kumwika hameso ha Falao. Niyo Yakobo amvikila Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao niyo amuuza Yakobo, “Una miaka mingahi?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo niyo ahitula, “Miaka nink'higwe kwikala enga mtafi, ni miaka gana na milongo mitatu. Miaka inda migeke naho yakwangadika, naho haibuile kwe idya wekalaga wakale wangu enga watafi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Niyo naho Yakobo amvikila Falao, niyo ahalawa. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Niyo Yusufu awekaza, ise, na wanduguze, hant'hu hatendese wedi mwe isi ya Misili, hande hawe enga ivo Falao alagize. Hant'hu aho handaga hagihi na mzi wa Lamasesi. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yusufu niyo awenk'ha nk'hande ise na wanduguze, na want'hu watuhu wose we mp'huga ya ise, viligane no uwazilo wa wana wawe.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gumbo dikugendeela mwe isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Gumbo dyagendeelesaga naho niyo kwanda hekwiina nk'hande mwe isi yose, niyo want'hu mwe isi za Kanani na Misili wazehuka kwa sala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yusufu niyo akisanya matundu yose mwe Misili, na Kanani, yailaile mwo kutaga nk'hande no kuyegala matundu ayo kwe kaya ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Matundu yose yeze yasile mwe isi ya Misili na Kanani kwa kuguila nk'hande, Wamisili naweza kwa Yusufu niyo wamgamba, “Kink'he nk'hande, kinase kuzehuka hameso hako kwaviya matundu yetu yasila.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Niyo Yusufu awahitula, “Nink'heni mifugwa yenyu yose name neniwasakanyileni na nk'hande, uneva matundu yenyu yasila.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Ivo niyo wegala mifugwa yawe kwa Yusufu, niyo awenk'ha nk'hande kwa kusakanya ne zimpunda zawe ne zingoto zawe ne zing'ombe zawe ne zimpunda zawe. Mwo mwaka udya, nakawenk'ha nk'hande kwa kusakanya ne mifugwa yawe yose.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Mwaka utimile niyo wamwizila no kumgamba, “Hakikudaha kufisa ikindedi hameso yako weye mkulu kugamba matundu yetu yasila, naho haluse mifugwa yetu ikwako. Hakihali kisigale cho kukwink'ha weye mafani, imili yetu ne isi yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Usekukileka kibanike chambize, ukigule suwe ne sanga yetu, kwa kwasakanya ne nk'hande. Suwe hamwenga ne zink'honde zetu nekinde watumwa wa Falao, naho sanga yetu ndeinde yakwe. Mna ukink'he du nk'hande kinde wagima ne zimbeyu mwe migunda yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Yusufu niyo amguila Falao isi yose ya Misili. Kila Mmisili haheina kuunga watagaga isanga yawe kwaviya gumbo dyatendesaga. Naho niyo isanga yose yanda ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Ivo Yusufu awatendaga want'hu wose kunda watumwa wa Falao mwe isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Mna migunda ya walavant'hambiko haiguile. Hawaitagile migunda yawe kwaviya nawakahokela nk'hande iyo wapangilwagwa kulawa kwa Falao. Kwaivo hakwandile na cho kuwatenda walava nt'hambiko watage migunda yawe. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yusufu niyo awagamba want'hu, “Miye hiwagulani nyuwe hamwenga ne migunda yenyu, mnda watu wa Falao. Elo nomwink'higwe zimbeyu mkahande mwe migunda yenyu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Hakeza mpaka ho uvuni, nomumlihe Falao, imwenga mwe shano, vine kwa shano visigale nevinde venyu kwa mbeyu na nk'hande yenyu wenye ne zimp'huga zenyu, na wana wenyu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Niyo wagamba, “Weye kuukombola ugima wetu, kunda ywedi kwetu, naswe nekinde watumwa wa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Ivo niyo Yusufu aika mwiko mwe mbuli ye migunda mwe isi ya Misili, naho iyuko hata ivi dielo kugamba, Falao naalihigwe imwenga mwe zishano yo uvuni. Isi ya walavant'hambiko ikedu niyo hi ya Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo alagiza mwe mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Waizilaili wekalaga uko Gosheni mwe isi ya Misili. Niyo wanda wagoli uko na kugenyelesa. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo ekalaga mwe isi ya Misili kwa miaka gana na milongo mine na mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Mazuwa yo kubanika kwa Yakobo yeze yande hagihi, amwitangaga Yusufu mwanawe niyo amgamba, “Uneva wiyuko uwedi kulawa kwako, ika mkono wako hasi ya mawambo yangu, naho uniikile kilapi kugamba hounimosele msanga mwe Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Mna heza kubanika, uninule kulawa Misili, niyo wanimosela msanga hadya wamoselwe wakale wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu niyo ahitula, “Nenidamanye enga ivo ulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Niyo Yakobo amgamba, “Ika kilapi kugamba noudamaye ivo.” Yusufu aikaga kilapi, niyo Yakobo afunamila kwo mtwi wakwe na kumtogola Mnungu hadya ho lusazi lwakwe.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo awavikila Manase na Iflaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Akajika aho, Yusufu agambilwagwa kugamba ise andaga akalumwa. Ivo awaguhaga wanawe waidi Manase na Iflaimu, niyo aita nawo kwo kumtemeela ise. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobo eze eve kugamba mwanao Yusufu keza, akekakamulaga, niyo akungumala mwo lusazi. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobo niyo agamba, “Mnungu ywo udahi anilailaga uko Luzi mwe isi ya Kanani niyo anivikila. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Anigambaga, nohongezele cheleko chako no kuwagenyeza mwo uwazilo wako, nohutende fyo dya want'hu, naho neni wenk'he welekwa wako isi ino inde yawe mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />“Kwaivo Yusufu, wanao awaidi awa uwelekele Misili umwo nandile hinati kwiza, nawande wangu, Iflaimu na Manase, nawande wangu enga ivo weli Lubeni na Simioni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Mna, wana nouweleke kulongole nawande wako, hawenk'higwe ukipe we isi yangu, mna nawenk'higwe hant'hu aho kwombokela kwa Iflaimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Nadamanya ivi kwaajilki ya Nyokwe, umwo nandile hauya kulawa Padani. Yehe Laheli abanikaga mwe isi ya Kanani kikanda hagihi mpaka Efulata. Ivo kwa kinyulu kikulu nammoselaga msanga uko hank'handa ye sila ikwiita Efulata.” Mazua aya, Efulata niyo ikwitangwa Betelehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Yakobo eze awaone awana wa Yusufu, niyo agamba, “Awa nawo wahi?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusufu amhitulaga, “Awa nawo wanangu nink'higwe ni Mnungu aha Misili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobo niyo agamba, “Hake walete hangu vileke niwavikile.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Meso ya Yakobo yandaga hayakuona vedi kwaviya nakadalahala naho nevinda vidala kwakwe kuona. Ivo niyo Yusufu awegala hagihi naye, niyo ise awahokelaga no kuwakumbatila. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Yakobo niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Hyakawiile kukuona naho, naho Mnungu kanink'ha kuwaona wanao iviyaiviya.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Niho Yusufu awausa wanawe mwa mavindi ya ise, niyo yehe mwenye enama uso wakwe hameso ya ise mwe sanga.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yusufu niyo awaguha wose waidi, Ifulaimu kamwiika kumoso kwa Yakobo niyo Manase amwika kulumwe kwa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Mna Yakobo niyo achulula mikono yakwe, niyo ageleka mkono wakwe wa kulume mwo mtwi wa Ifulaimu, hamwenga na kugamba andaga mdodo, mkono wa kumoso nao niyo augeleka mwo mtwi wa Manase, uyo andile ywa nk'hongo ukwelekwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Yokabo niyo amvikila Yusufu akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Mnungu ywa wakale wangu uyo avikagwa ni Ibulahimu na Isaka, avikile wana awa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Mnungu akudima ugima wangu wose ibuile mwe dizuwa idi avikile wana awa!<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Mtumigwa yudya ywa kwe mbingu anikombole na maihi yose, awavikile wana awa, zina dyangu hamwenga na mazina ya watate Ibulahimu na Isaka, yagendeele kutambulwa kwombokela wana awa naho wande na wana wengi na cheleko kingi mwe isi!”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusufu akeivaga vihile umwo ise agelekaga mkono wakwe wo kulume mwo mtwi wa Ifulaimu, niyo awinula mkono wa ise auuse mwo mtwi wa Ifulaimu vileke augeleke mwo mtwi wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Niyo amgaba ise, “Tate hivoivo. Geleka mkono wako mwo mtwi wa uyu kwaviya niye mkulu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Mna Ise niyo alemela, akamgamba, “Mwanagu hivimanya ivo, wana wa Manase wande kabila kulu dina want'hu wengi. Mna wana wa mvunawe nawande kabila kulu kujink'ha awo.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Nakawavikila mwe dizuwa dia akagamba, “Mwa mazina aya Waizilaeli nawalonge uvikilwa. Nawagambe, Mnungu naawatendeni enga Ifulaimu na Manase.” Kwaivo Yakobo kamlongoza Ifulaimu, Manase akatimila.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Yakobo niyo amgamba Yusufu, “Enga ivo ukuwona, miye nihagihi no kubanika, mna Mnungu naande hamwenga na weye, naho naakuvuze kwe isi ya wakale wenyu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Kudya Shekemu, nakwink'ha weye, isi ina uwolo naho hikuwenk'ha wanduguzo, naiguhaga kulawa kwa Waamoli, kwa kutowana nk'hondo kwa sime yangu na kwa uta wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa uheelo wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobo awetangaga wanawe niyo agamba, “Keduganyeni niwagambileni kiya kikuunga kiwalaileni mwa mazuwa yekulongole.”<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Keduganyeni naho mtegeleze, nyuwe wana wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Mtegelezeni tati yenyu Izilaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Lubeni niweye mwelekwa ywangu ywa nk'hongo, weye ywi ludole lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Naho cheleko cho ubwanga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Mwa wose weye niwe mdahi mkulu naho ni mta ludole.”<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Kunda enga ugubiko wa mazi mengi yakomboka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">“Mna hounde ywa nk'hongo naho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Kwaviya nokugona mwo lusazi lwa iso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Naho nokulugela usavu lusazi lwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simioni na Lawi ni wandugu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Mna mabamba yawe ni vitowanilo va nk'humbizi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Heninde hamwenga nawo mwe kinyele chawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Heninde hamwenga nawo mwe midugano yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Kwaviya wakomaga want'hu kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Naho kwa kinyemi chawe wayahamant'haga majeku.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Nayaligitwe amaya yawe kwaviya yatendesa ukali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">No kufujuka kwawe hekwiina mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Neniwasambaze mwe isi ya Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Naho neniwasambaze mwe want'hu wawe.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Weye Yuda, wanduguzo nawa kutunye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Nouwagoge waihi wako mwe zisingo zawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Wanduguzo nawakwinamile.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda ni enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Ikomile kwo kongola niyo yakwela mnanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Katambaala hasi na kukechuula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Hahali ywa kumgela nk'huswank'huswa.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ngoda ye kiseuta heifose kwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Naho nk'home yo uzumbe hemlawe mwe viga vakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Mpaka eze umwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Naho isi zose nezimwive yehe.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Naa izinganize imp'hunda yakwe mwo mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Na mwana mp'hunda kwo mzabibu wedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Yehe afigisa suke zakwe mwa mazi ya zabibu na mwe sakame ink'hundu ye zabibu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Meso yakwe nayande yenk'hundu kwa kunywa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">Meno yakwe nayang'ale kwa kunywa mele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zabuloni neekale mp'wani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Yehe naande enga mp'wani ya kwegamiza meli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Naahakane ne isi ya Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakali naande enga mp'hunda ina ludole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Ikuketambalika mgatigati mwe zint'wika zakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Niyo aona kugamba hant'hu ho kwikala ni hedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Naho isi yakwe inyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Ivo niyo afunamiza mgongo wakwe no kuketwika nt'wika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Nakukelava mwenye kudamanya ndima zo utumwa kwa want'hu watuhu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dani naawasengele want'hu wakwe ivo viwagilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">Enga viya nk'holo nt'huhu za Izilaeli zikudamanya.”<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani naande enga nyoka mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Nyoka ina sumu mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Nyoka ikuluma visinyagilo va falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Naho akweile ifalasi agwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Nagojela unikombole weye Zumbe Mnungu!”<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi naakump'hukilwe ni fyo dya wahoki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">Mna yehe naawakulumbuze na kuwatowa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Si ya Asheli neilozoke nk'hande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Naho naamlozoele seuta nk'hande yedi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nafutali yehe keiga mp'hala heivugailwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">Ikweleka wana wedi.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yusufu yehe ni enga mti ukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Mti ukweleka hagihi ne n'choko, matambi yakwe yagubika mwo lukazi.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Wank'hondo wakwe nawamkump'hukila kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">Niyo wamgulusa na kumlasa misale.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Mna uta wakwe utoga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Ne mikono yakwe neipate ludole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa udahi wa Mnungu Mta Udahi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Akwitangwa Mdimi, naho Mwamizi ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Ni kwa wambizi wa Mnungu wa iso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Ni Mnungu mta udahi akukuvikila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa uvikilwa wa vula kulawa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kwa uvikilwa wa mazi mengi kulawa hasi ye isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Uvikilwa wa wavele kwelekesa wana wengi ne mifugwa neyongezekele.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Uvikilwa wa iso ni mkulu kujink'ha uvikilwa, hegu vint'hu vedi vikulawa kwe milima ya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Vint'hu vikumunk'hilwa ne vigulu va mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">ne vint'hu ivo vose vikale mwo mtwi wa Yusufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Uvikilwa uno unde mnanga mwa Yosefu eli mkulu mwa wanduguze.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benjamini ni enga uzi kali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Mtondo adya yoo ukala wakwe, mwalagulo awapanga watahigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Awa nawo nk'hongelo ya makabila mlongo na waidi wa Izilaeli, na ivo nivo alongaga tati yawe umwo andaga akawavikila, awavikilaga kila yumwenga na uvikilwa wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika no kumoselwa msanga kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Yakobo awagambaga wanawe, “Miye nenikelunge na want'hu wangu, mnimosele msanga hamwenga na wakale wangu mwe mp'hanga imwo mgunda wa Efuloni Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />mwe mp'haga idya ya Makipela hagihi na Mamle mwe isi ya Kanani, idya Ibulahimu agulaga kwa mnt'hu we dikabila dya Wahiti akwitangwa Efuloni, hande hant'hu ha kumosela msanga hamwenga no mgunda. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Hadya naaho wamoselwe msanga Ibulahimu na mkaziwe naho Sala iviya iviya naaho amoselwe msanga, Isaka na mkaziwe Labeka, naho naaho ammosele msanga Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Mnimosele msanga mwo mgunda udya ne mp'hanga idya yagulagwa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobo eze ajike kuwalagiza wanawe, aketambalikaga naho mwo lusazi niyo abanika.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yusufu niyo amwinamila na kumbatila ise akaila na kumnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Niyo Yusufu awagamba waganga wakwe wamhake Yakobo uyo ise, miti vileke asekuola. Wadya waganga niyo wamhaka. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Waguhaga mazuwa milongo mine wakamhaka miti. Wamisili wamhongezelaga kwa mazuwa milongo mfungate.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Kuhongeza kwize kusile, Yusufu awagambaga wandima wa Falao, “Mwigaileni Falao ulosi uno kugamba, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />umwo tate andaga hagihi no kubanika, anitendaga nikelise kugenda kummosela msanga kwe kikuta akesimbilaga mwenye uko Kanaani. Elo, namlombeza kukagamba, goja hammosele tate msanga, naho akajika neniuye.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao niyo amhitula, “Ita kammosele msanga iso enga ivo walaganaga kudamanya.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Ivo Yusufu aitaga kwo kummosela ise sanga. Aitaga hamwenga na wakulu wose wa mwe nyumba ya Falao, na wadala vilongozi wose we kitala cha Falao, na wadala vilongozi wose wa isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Imp'huga yakwe na wanduguze na wose mwe mp'huga ya ise, wose waitaga hamwenga na yehe. Mna, wana wadodo na ngoto na mbuzi ne zingombe, wasigalaga uko Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Iviyaiviya waitaga want'hu wakwelega falasi na magali yakuvutwa ni falasi, kulajunga kulu.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Weze wabule he kiwasa cho kuhutila nk'hande cha Atadi, nt'hendelo ya kaidi ya Yolodani, wahongezaga kwa kinyulu kikulu na usungu, niyo Yusufu amhongezela ise kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Want'hu wa Kanani wadya wandaga wakekala hadya weze waone mahongezo aho he kiwasa cho kuhutila cha Atadi, niyo wagamba, “Mahongezo aya ni makulu mwa Wamisili!” Nivo vikuleka hant'hu aho hetangwa Abeli Mizilaimu. Nuko kugamba, “Mahongezo ya Wamisili”.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Ivo niyo wanawe watendaga enga viya tati yawe awalagizaga. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Wamwinulaga niyo wamwigala kwe isi ya Kanaani no kummosela sanga mwe mp'hanga imwo mgunda wa Makipela yandile ulailo wa zuwa wa Mamle, iyo Ibulahimu aigulaga kwa Efuloni Mhiti inde hant'hu ha kumosela hamwenga no mgunda wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yusufu eze ajike kummosela msanga ise auyaga Misili hamwenga na wanduguze na wose waitaga naye kwo kummosela msanga ise.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu awausila wawanduguze wogofi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Wanduguze dya Yusufu weze waone kugamba tati yawe kabanika wagambaga, “Nevinde vivihi uneva Yusufu naakiihiye, naho anaika mzungu wo kulihiza kwa maihi yose chamdamanyaile?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ivo niyo wamwigaila ulosi wakagamba, “Umwo tati yetu akei kubanika, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />nakakigamba kiukulombeze uwalekele wanduguzo kwadiya wabanange, na wavu wawe wadamanye, kwaviya nawakutendela viihile. Elo chakulombeza uwalekele wavu watumwa wa Mnungu ywa iso.” Yusufu akeve ivo, niyo aila.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Niyo wanduguze nawo waila, wakafunama hasi, naho hameso hakwe wakagamba, “Suwe kiwa tumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Mna Yusufu niyo awahitula, “Mse kogoha. Miye hiye Mnungu ywa kuwasengelani. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwaikaga mizungu ihile mwa miye, mna Mnungu aihitulaga kunda yedi, vileke want'hu wengi wahonywe enga ivo vili dielo, kulawa mwa ayo yalaile. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Ivo msekogoha, miye neniwaleleni nyuwe hamwenga na wana wenyu.” Awatondowazaga miyoyo yawe kwa milosi yedi.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubanika kwa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusufu agendeelaga kwikala ukwo Misili hamwenga ne mp'huga ya ise. Ekalaga miaka gana na mlongo niyo abanika. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yusufu ekalaga niyo awaona wana na Ifulaimu na wezukulu wakwe. Naho awahokelaga wana wa Makili wandaga wana wa Manase kwe mp'huga yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Yusufu niyo awagamba wanduguze, “Miye nihagihi no kubanika, mna kwavovose Mnungu nawezileni, niyo awalava mwe isi ino, no kuwegala kwe isi idya awaikilaga Ndagano kwa kilapi, awo Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Yusufu awagambaga Waizilaeli waike kilapi kugamba, “Umwo Mnungu akeza kuwezilani na kuwaambiza kuuya kwe isi yenyu. Mwaungwa mwinule mavuha yangu kulawa mwe isi ino.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Ivi Yusufu abanikaga kudya Misili akanda na miaka gana na mlongo. Wamhakaga miti ase kuwola, no kumgela mwe Disanduku.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>